(3282, 'Welcome to the Great Forge $g lad : lass;. It may be cold outside but we keep it nice and hot down ''ere. Grab a hammer, strike that anvil and show me ye''ve got what it takes to be a Blacksmith of the Great Forge!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
