(3285, 'Ye have my approval $n, ye can forge blades better than any I''ve trained in years. If ye want to make a real weapon though, ye need to talk with Myolor Sunderfury. That Dwarf will set ya on the right path.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
