(4045, '', 'Please, a moment, $n. Kindal is down below in the Grimtotem camp trying to free the faerie dragons from captivity. We were just lucky that help came along when it did. Who knows what those foul tauren would have done to them.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
