(4053, 'Salutations.  I am a guardian of entry.  Unless you have the Plates of Uldum already integrated with your disc set, I will not allow for entry into the Uldum compound.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4054, 'What function do you serve?', 'What function do you serve?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4055, 'My purpose is to regulate access to the Uldum complex for the Creators.  I allow entry into the compound only when the solicitor exhibits for access the proper sequencing discs.$B$BYour disc set currently does not contain the Plates of Uldum, the primary prerequisite for entry.  Access is not granted unless the Plates of Uldum are present.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
