(4415, 'Bye, bye, tiny little $r. Raze go now.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4416, 'The ancient Altar of Hakkar stands silently near the entrance to the room.$B$BLooking to the balconies above it, you notice a large serpent-like statue rests on each. The statues look very much like the ones on the altar before you. They must be related in some way...', 'The ancient Altar of Hakkar stands silently near the entrance to the room.$B$BLooking to the balconies above it, you notice a large serpent-like statue rests on each. The statues look very much like the ones on the altar before you. They must be related in some way...', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4417, 'How could the altar and the statues be related?', 'How could the altar and the statues be related?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4418, 'I want to begin the statue puzzle.', 'I want to begin the statue puzzle.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4419, 'Tell me more about muisek.', 'Tell me more about muisek.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4420, 'Existing in this area are many creatures considered allies of the night elves. The elves have had access to the power within each of these creatures; it is time that the horde be allowed this same satisfaction. I have devised a way that this power can be captured and used for our benefit.$B$BDo not doubt what I tell you, $n. Help me, and you shall see that I speak truth.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4421, 'There''ll be a new trade risin'' up round your carcass, $n. We''ll call it ''flesh-craftin.''', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4422, 'All they be doin'' is a little huntin'' and gatherin''. Where''s the harm in that??', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4423, 'If tailoring is your thing, Vizzklick will most definitely have your supplies. Take a look around, $n, and let me know if you wish to purchase something!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4424, 'I wish to browse your wares.', 'I wish to browse your wares.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4425, 'Grab your things, $n! I''ve just gotten word from Nilith Lokrav in the Searing Gorge that the Undermarket has set up operations in the heart of the Cauldron. Find Nilith Lokrav in the Searing Gorge and get the low down!', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4426, 'One bright light appears accross the room, then disppears. Then you notice another beam... and then another.$B$BThey seem to be showing you a pattern.', 'One bright light appears accross the room, then disppears. Then you notice another beam... and then another.$B$BThey seem to be showing you a pattern.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4427, 'The statues are all in place, and you may begin the puzzle.', 'The statues are all in place, and you may begin the puzzle.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4428, '%s goes into a berserker rage!', '%s goes into a berserker rage!', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4429, 'Vengeance shall be mine.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4430, 'Tell me what drives this vengeance?', 'Tell me what drives this vengeance?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4431, 'My father was slain by the filth that inhabits the cauldron. My pleas for assistance to the Stormwind magistrate fell on deaf ears. Nay, they want not to admit that this part of the world even exists, let alone send their precious military in to administer justice.$B$BI seek vengeance, $r, plain and simple. Is there a more passionate cause in this world?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4432, 'Continue please.', 'Continue please.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4433, 'As you can see, I am but one man with a lumbering oaf of a squire. The might of the Dark Iron dwarves and the beasts held in the grip of Ragnaros would surely overwhelm me alone, but I have the utmost confidence that such a brave and ambitious adventurer such as you would have no problem handling the denizens of the cauldron. Should you choose to assist me, I shall reward you with riches and wealth beyond your wildest dreams.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4434, 'Let me confer with my colleagues.', 'Let me confer with my colleagues.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4435, 'We will enslave the quilboar!', '', 0, 5819, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4436, 'We will spread across this barren land!', '', 0, 5820, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4437, 'Soon, the Scourge will rule the world!', '', 0, 5821, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4438, 'My eyes!  It burns... it burns...', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4439, 'Torture me no more!  Release me, mortal!  The Swamp of Sorrows... mortal... please...', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4440, 'Foolish mortal, I will rend your soul in two once I am released!', '', 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4441, 'You are an agent of their wicked god, fool.  I will see you destroyed!', '', 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4442, 'My soul is not a trinket!  Mortal, you must release me from these chains!', '', 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

', 'The statues all move back into their original positions.$B$BThe sequence must be started again now, from the beginning.
', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4468, 'Right away, master!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4469, 'Greetings, $Gsir:miss;. I am Master Xylem''s apprentice Nyrill. If you have any concerns, please feel free to bring them up with the master.$B$BI will be here to serve you when you''re ready to return down to the base of the mountain.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4470, 'I know who you are, $n.  Fate and forces beyond that have brought you to me for a reason, and it is one I take no pleasure in being a part of.  There are many decisions you will make in the coming times, and I hope you are wise enough to make the correct ones.$B$BBelieve me, $r, when I tell you this - there are correct choices.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4471, 'What''s an elf like you doing inside a cave like this?', 'What''s an elf like you doing inside a cave like this?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4472, 'You are quite inquisitive, though such inquisitiveness belies a general lack of understanding.  I say this because were you to have a definite purpose in being here, the question you ask would seem pointless. $B$BWith that, I bid you good day.', '', 0, 0, 0, 21, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4473, '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4474, 'Do you know someone... or something, rather, by the name of Eranikus?', 'Do you know someone... or something, rather, by the name of Eranikus?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4475, 'You know I do, mortal; I am abandoning a fair number of pretenses here, and I recommend you do the same.$B$BYou have come here clearly because you know that what you possess, garnered from your actions within the Sunken Temple of the Atal''al, has brought you to me for a purpose.  This purpose is to put my associate... my brother, to rest.  He is trapped within a nightmare within the Dream itself.  He cannot break free alone.', '', 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4476, 'What happened to him in the first place?  When I... encountered him, he was rather malicious.', 'What happened to him in the first place?  When I... encountered him, he was rather malicious.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4477, 'The god that the Atal''ai trolls had brought forth is to blame for this.  We destroyed the god''s physical manifestation and sunk the temple, but the god was much stronger than even we had anticipated.  Its seed of corruption ran deep, twisting everything in its path.$B$BEranikus was charged to watch over the sunken temple to ensure that neither the simple Atal''ai nor their god would rise again.  He was an unwitting victim of this corruption, and we in underestimating its potency.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4478, 'I possess part of Eranikus'' essence.  What do you want with it... or with me?', 'I possess part of Eranikus'' essence.  What do you want with it... or with me?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4479, 'The fact that you are here is a first step... a correct choice if you will, in aiding Ysera''s Dragonflight.$B$BYou may be here for purely the lure of personal gain, or you may be here because you are morally compelled.  Neither reason is important on its own, but both are in fact critical to this end: The agony that Eranikus endures is what rousted me from my Dream, and it is now my charge to see his torment ended.  I now ask you to aid me in this quest.
', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4480, 'I will consider what you have told me.', 'I will consider what you have told me.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4481, 'I have given you an oathstone of Ysera''s Dragonflight, $n.  When you are ready and able to aid us, use it, and then we may begin.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4482, 'Good luck. Sorry I can''t take you with me!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4483, '%s begins to summon wraiths out of the freezing cold air!', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4484, 'Intruders! Attack the intruders!', 'Intruders! Attack the intruders!', 0, 0, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4485, 'My banishment is ended! Let the blood flow!', '', 1, 5859, 14, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4486, 'Interesting, interesting... I know of a druid that lives atop the hill above the Wailing Caverns, $n. She might be able to tell you more about this shard you have found.$B$BNow, I must get back to work!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4489, '%s staggers.', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4490, 'The shield be down! Rise up Atal''ai! Rise up!', '', 6, 5861, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4491, 'Mistress!! They seek to destroy your work!!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4492, 'Ha! Now your death is ensured!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4493, 'All right, stay close.  These fiends will jump right out of the shadows at you if you let your guard down.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4495, '', 'You dare! Now feel my wrath, $r.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4496, 'The days we''ve spent here in Azshara are not among our best and most glorious, but we are still young and blood still courses through our veins--we shall find victory here. It is only a matter of time.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4497, 'Belgrom sent us here from Orgrimmar to aid him in an unwise Alliance, but if his gamble pays off, then it will be to the great benefit of all the Horde.$B$BToo many orcs have already perished because of his desire to please women, but he still commands us, and our honor dictates we make the best of this situation.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4498, '', 'I am not here because of honor, $n. I am here because of one orc''s pride.$B$BIf I had not rejected Belgrom''s offers, then I''m sure I''d still be in Orgrimmar taking care of real business.$B$BHis desire for women is not unknown to many of the female warriors in Durotar, but that doesn''t stop him from being his charming self.$B$BHe''s lucky he didn''t pursue his desire for me much longer though--he''d be short more than just the digits on his hands.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4499, '', 'Greetings, $n. I see you''ve come from Orgrimmar to aid us. I''m glad. I want to be out of this forsaken forest as quickly as possible. I''d much rather be spending my time in Orgrimmar with a good ale.$B$BAlthough I cannot wait to hear how Belgrom talked you into coming out here.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4500, 'You''ve done it, $n! <The strangely familiar voice seems to be coming from the phial!> Hurry back! The fallout will only remain stable for thirty minutes.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4501, 'Okay, here we go.  It''s going to take about five minutes to shut this thing down through the ritual.  Once I start, keep the vermin off of me or it will be the end of us all!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4502, 'Who dares?! I will destroy you!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4503, 'DUMMY SPELL TEST MESSAGE', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4504, 'Three minutes left -- I can feel the energy starting to build!  Keep up the solid defense!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4505, 'Just two minutes to go!  We''re half way there, but don''t let your guard down!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4506, 'One more minute!  Hold on now, the ritual is about to take hold!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4507, 'That''s it -- we made it!  The ritual is set in motion, and idol fires are about to go out for good!  You truly are the heroes I thought you would be!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4508, '%s lashes at your collection phial. The green glow encases you. You don''t look so hot, pal.', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
