(4637, 'I can''t believe the officials in Stormwind, sending the bulk of our army abroad... when our home front is under so much pressure!$B$BWith thieves coming from Westfall and gnolls encroaching from from the east and west, it''s a wonder Stormwind itself isn''t besieged.', '', 0, 0, 7, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
