(5092, 'If yer of need of an Inn, The Stonefire Inn is where ye should be.  Ye''ll find it just to the left of the entrance to Ironforge if ye be coming, or to the right if ye be going.  $B$BOh, and if yer going that way, then tell them to have a tankard ready for me.', 'If yer of need of an Inn, The Stonefire Inn is where ye should be.  Ye''ll find it just to the left of the entrance to Ironforge if ye be coming, or to the right if ye be going.  $B$BOh, and if yer going that way, then tell them to have a tankard ready for me.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
