(5414, 'Aright *hic*... Say, you look familiar *hic*. Have I ever told you about the time me and Windsor fought off thir, er... a thous... a million orcs?$B$BOh settle down friend, this is a good one!', '', 0, 0, 0, 6, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0),
