(5420, '%s bursts into the hatchery once you apply the lure to the crystal!', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5421, 'The Orgrimmar Auction House is in the Valley of Strength.  Look for it on the east side next to Boomstick Imports.', 'The Orgrimmar Auction House is in the Valley of Strength.  Look for it on the east side next to Boomstick Imports.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5422, 'Your voice is hoarse from yelling huh?  Find the Orgrimmar Auction House in the Valley of Strength.', 'Your voice is hoarse from yelling huh?  Find the Orgrimmar Auction House in the Valley of Strength.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5423, 'The auction house', 'The auction house', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5424, 'Welcome to the Bank of Darnassus. We offer financial accounts and safety deposit boxes for valuable items. Do you already have an account with us $g sir : ma''am;?', 'Welcome to the Bank of Darnassus. We offer financial accounts and safety deposit boxes for valuable items. Do you already have an account with us $g sir : ma''am;?', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5425, 'Amazing, aren''t they? All these artifacts and remains.$B$BI''m not sure what I''m more impressed by, their size, or the stories that go along with them. There''s so much to study and learn. And the connections we can make...$B$BDid you know rumor has it that many races have the same heritage as Night elves?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5426, 'Image dissipation in sixty seconds.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5427, '%s begins to cast a powerful spell.', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5428, '%s transforms the items into a totem.', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5429, '', '%s is visibly shaken by the death of Emperor Thaurissan.', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5430, 'Emperor Thaurissan does not wish to be disturbed! Turn back now or face your doom, weak mortals!', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5431, 'Hail to the king, baby!', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5432, '', 'Hello there, my name is Petra.  To my right is my kodo, Dadanga.  We''re with Marshal Expeditions - been so for a few years now, ever since Dadanga was a babe.$B$BIf you have any lit torches or any open sources of flame, I''d like to ask you to keep them stashed if you could.  Dadanga dislikes smoke.', 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5433, 'For the love of all that is holy and dear, please tell me that you''ve come to deliver us from this forsaken land.  Though I''m with Marshal Expeditions, I would give you the gold teeth from my mouth to climb inside your backpack and leave this place.', '', 0, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5434, '', 'Oh, hello there!  I''m Hol''anyee, the chief scientist and biologist of Marshal Expeditions.  My brother and I, along with our companions, travel Azeroth exploring the wild and untamed majesty.  It is exciting... but, um... I think we got ourselves into a little too much excitement this time!', 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5435, 'Hello stranger, and welcome to the untamed majesty of Un''Goro Crater!$B$BMy name is Williden Marshal.  My sister, our companions, and I make up Marshal Expeditions - scientists and explorers of Azeroth''s wild and great unknown.$B$BWe''ve hit a bit of a rough patch here, and we''re looking for some help if you have the time!', '', 0, 0, 0, 3, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5436, '', 'This is where things get interesting.  My plan is to follow the mountail wall, keeping it to our left.  That way, we won''t get lost in the jungle and we''ll cut down on the hostiles.  You ready?', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5437, '', 'Here''s the eastern mountain wall!  I''m cutting towards the south now; try and keep up.  We''re not out of the thick of it yet!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5439, '', 'Here''s the path out of Un''Goro!  We made it!  All we have to worry about is the Tanaris desert now.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5440, '', 'Here it is -- the Tanaris desert.  Funny how an inhospitable place like this looks better than a lush jungle once you''ve been trapped in it forever.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5441, 'You have been sentenced to death for crimes against the Dark Iron nation!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5442, 'The Sons of Thaurissan shall watch you perish in the Ring of the Law!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5443, 'Unleash the fury and let it be done!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5444, 'Haha! I bet you thought you were done!', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5445, 'But your real punishment lies ahead.', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5446, 'Good riddance!', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5447, 'Incredible! Amazing! I don''t even know what this means!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5448, 'Look at these samples! What does it mean? What does it mean? I''m going to need time, time to look at all this information. And I''ll need more information. Information I can''t get... damn! Think, Laris, think!$B$BWhat are you going to do? What?!$B$BThere has to be a solution!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5449, 'There must be someplace on Azeroth that we can find oozes uncorrupted by the Scourge or anything else. But where?!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5450, 'Is there a difference between ooze and slime?', 'Is there a difference between ooze and slime?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5451, 'No, not that I can tell. It seems to be mostly based on region. Some races have labled them slimes, some oozes. It seems to be preference mostly.$B$BEvery time I''ve encountered ooze, sludge, or slime they have basically been the same creatures. The differences seem to be based on their environment, which is why we need a pure sample.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5452, 'What do you mean by "pure?"', 'What do you mean by "pure?"', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5453, 'A pure sample would be one that''s uncorrupted by unintentional influences. We need to find the creatures in the most basic, normal environment we can.$B$BThat means somewhere devoid of civilization or the effects of the dominant races of Azeroth. Someplace... untouched.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5454, 'Are there any areas you can think of that would be so untouched?', 'Are there any areas you can think of that would be so untouched?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5455, 'It''ll definitely not be anywhere in the Eastern Kingdoms, that''s for sure.$B$BIt''ll have to be somwhere on Kalimdor, but still far enough away from the Horde and other races. Someplace unaffected by the Sundering--that means no where near the Night elves'' civilization either.$B$BI would guess it''d be someplace protected also... like a valley, or a crater. I don''t know. I''m just guessing now. I''m sorry I couldn''t help you more.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5456, 'I bid you welcome, $c. Rare do we have visitors down to these levels of the Apothecarium... unless of course there''s something someone wants... or needs.$B$B<Chemist Coely laughs.>$B$BHow can I help you today, hmm?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5457, 'Come to the aid of the Throne!', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5458, '%s groans.', '%s groans.', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5459, '%s weeps pitifully.', '%s weeps pitifully.', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5460, '%s begs to be put out of his misery.', '%s begs to be put out of her misery.', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5461, '', 'Well, we''re not getting any closer just standing here.  Come on Dadanga!  Yah!', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5462, '', 'Step lively Dadanga!  Come on, girl!  The quicker we get through here, the happier we''ll both be.', 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5463, '$n, you have disturbed me from my rest!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5464, 'Leave me now in peace. I must rest.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5465, 'Who dares awaken Aquementas?', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5466, '', 'Get away from my kodo, you freak of nature!', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5467, '', 'Dadanga!  Attack!', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5468, '', 'That has to be the biggest $n I have ever seen... and it''s coming right for us!', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5469, '', 'Watch out for the $n!', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5470, 'The gathering and knowledge of herbs is a specialty of Firodren Mooncaller.  Seek him out in the Temple Gardens in the southwestern area of Darnassus.', 'The gathering and knowledge of herbs is a specialty of Firodren Mooncaller.  Seek him out in the Temple Gardens in the southwestern area of Darnassus.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5471, 'A budding herbalist are we?  Then you should visit with Firodren Mooncaller over in the Temple Gardens.  He may have some tricks of the trade to impart with you.', 'A budding herbalist are we?  Then you should visit with Firodren Mooncaller over in the Temple Gardens.  He may have some tricks of the trade to impart with you.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5472, 'Why you would want to leave these sunny shores and crystal blue waters I have no idea. It''s like paradise down here. But don''t tell my brother Zapetta that, he''s bitter enough already about getting stuck up there in Tirisfal all day long. This Zeppelin here drops off at Orgrimmar so you shouldn''t have to worry about having to listen to him whine. But if you are in Tirisfal anytime soon, heed my warning and don''t get him started.', 'Why you would want to leave these sunny shores and crystal blue waters I have no idea. It''s like paradise down here. But don''t tell my brother Zapetta that, he''s bitter enough already about getting stuck up there in Tirisfal all day long. This Zeppelin here drops off at Orgrimmar so you shouldn''t have to worry about having to listen to him whine. But if you are in Tirisfal anytime soon, heed my warning and don''t get him started.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5473, 'I sense the taint of corruption upon this $n. Help me destroy it!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
