(5659, '', 'Ah, $r... I possess great knowledge a'' da world and how ta create charms a'' great power. ', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5660, 'Many times my blades have felled my target before they even drew near. The secret is in the flick of your wrist.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5661, '', 'Mau''ari know why you seek her out...$B$BBring me da E''ko you find in the world, an'' I can transform it for you.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5662, 'How do I use the Cache of Mau''ari?', 'How do I use the Cache of Mau''ari?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5663, 'Sssplendid... Then let us watch as my children tear these mortals to pieces.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5664, 'Use the freezing breath, imbecile!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5665, 'Foolsss... Kill the one in the dress!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5666, 'Inconceivable!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5667, 'Do not force my hand, children! I shall use your hides to line my boots.', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5668, 'Your efforts will prove fruitless. None shall stand in our way!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5669, 'I promise you an eternity of dung clean up duty for that failure!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5670, 'Curse you, mortal.', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5671, 'Concentrate your attacks upon the healer!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5672, 'Sire, let me join the fray! I shall tear their spines out with my bare hands!', '', 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5673, 'Impossible!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5674, 'Flee while you still have a chance, mortals. You will pray for a swift death should I enter the arena.', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5675, 'You will learn of the sanctuary only death can offer...', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5676, 'It appears as if I will have to step in and take care of you myself.', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5677, 'I will tear off your limbs and use them to beat you into submission!', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5678, 'Defilers!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5679, 'I can stand no more of this!', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5683, 'Thanks a bunch... I can find my way back to Whitereach Post from here. Be sure to talk with Motega Firemane; perhaps you can keep him from sending me home.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5684, '%s spies you tampering with the camp''s fruit stores and attacks you!', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5685, '%s emerges from the log hovel and catches you tampering with the grain stores!', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5686, '', 'More and more of Kalimdor is turning into the twisted landscape to our left, and the critters who dwell within are NOT friendly.  Watch your step.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5687, '', 'Blast... ogres.  I forgot about these buffoons.  There''s no easy way around them, so expect plenty of fighting.  Look sharp!', 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5688, '', 'Come on Dadanga!  March girl, march!', 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5689, '', 'There it is -- Gadgetzan!  We''re in the home stretch now!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5690, '', 'We''re finally here, thanks to you $n!  Without your help, we would have been some over-grown lizard''s lunch!', 0, 0, 0, 10, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5691, '', 'It was quite a haul, but now I can load up on supplies for the trip back into the Crater.  I should be able to unload some of this exotic cargo as well.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5692, '', 'Look out, incoming!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5693, '', 'I''m gonna need some help with this $n!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5694, 'Yeah yeah, I know Dadanga dislikes smoke.  From the smell of it though, seems like Dadanga also dislikes bathing.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5695, 'Have you seen Petra or Dadanga around?
', 'Have you seen Petra or Dadanga around?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5696, 'They took off for Gadgetzan a while ago to bring us back some supplies.  Frankly, I would have given at least four of my fingers to have had the chance to crawl inside one of Dadanga''s packs in order to leave this forsaken place.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5698, 'What is E''ko?', 'What is E''ko?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5699, '', 'Da Cache of Mau''ari holds great secrets... The shards used ta make it are reflective, and you can use its shiny surface ta siphon power from other tings and den reflect it onto yourself.$B$BKeeping da charm in your inventory lets you collect e''ko, da spiritual power from the beasts you fight. Once you find e''ko, you bring it ta Mau''ari.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5700, '', 'E''ko is da power dat each creatures possesses. Da charm I made for ya allows you ta capture it in a physical manifestation.$B$BI know an incantation dat can transform da e''ko you find, and turn it into juju.$B$BYou can den take the Cache of Mau''ari, an'' use it ta reflect da power of da juju onto yourself.$B$BC''mon, give it a try. Bring da e''ko ta Mau''ari an'' we have some fun.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5701, '', 'As nice as Gadgetzan is compared to Un''Goro, I have some good folks counting on us to bring them some supplies.  If you''re ready to go, then so are Dadanga and I.  Let''s mount up!', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5702, '', 'The Tanaris desert is littered with gigantic bones just like this one to my right.  I''d hate to have ever ran across that thing.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5703, '', 'Whoa, whoa, hold up Dadanga girl.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5704, '%s snorts deeply as she comes to a halt.', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5705, '', 'This doesn''t look... right.  Look at how alien the desert is!  Going through here might be a terrible mistake.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5706, '', 'What the... what are those things crawling at us?  We... we have incoming!', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5707, '', 'That was not what I would call ''escort friendly''.  I will find a way to go around these things.  Let''s move to the south, toward that rock.  Maybe we can wedge through it and still avoid the ogres.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5708, '', 'This will work -- keep heading through this gap.  The path to Un''Goro is due west of here once we round these infernal bugs.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5709, 'THIS CANNOT BE!!! Rend, deal with these insects.', '', 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5710, 'The mortals have fallen! The new age of the Blackrock legion is at hand!', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5711, '%s is knocked off his drake!', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5712, 'WOOT!', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5713, 'That will surely save me some work.', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5714, 'I want those boots! Nobody touch that corpse!', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5715, 'Consider yourself lucky, mortal. At least your corpse is still somewhat presentable.', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5716, 'Do not consume the entire corpse just yet, children! Save room for dessert!', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5717, 'Served!', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5718, 'You actually believed that you stood a chance?', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5719, 'The Blackhand legion shall wear your skin as fashion accessories!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5720, 'The Warchief shall make quick work of you, mortals. Prepare yourselves!', '', 1, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5721, '%s paces back and forth in anticipation of the battle.', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5722, 'With pleasure...', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5723, 'Good day to ye $g lad : lass;. Can I be of service?', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5724, 'Here for training eh? Just began my training meself, but I would be glad ta teach ye what I can.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5725, 'Ye learn fast $g lad : lass;, much faster than I can keep up with. If ye want ta continue yer training, I suggest ye see my teacher. His name''s Rotgath, Rotgath Stonebeard and ye''ll find him in Ironforge at The Great Forge.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5726, 'Taste in my power!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5727, 'Eh? I don''t have time ta chat, my da'' wants me ta finish this order fer him.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5728, 'Ye''ve got a little skill on ye. Enough to learn ye a few things I wager. Let''s see what I can teach ye, shall we?', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5729, 'Ye know more than I do, that''s a certainty. Tell ye what though, go talk with me da''. He''ll want ye ta prove yerself, but he is a fine teacher indeed. His name''s Rotgath, and ye''ll find him near the anvils workin steel for ol'' Bengus.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5730, 'Well my friend, ye have more skill than I do. Why don''t ye go find me old friend Rotgath Stonebeard. He stayed in Ironforge when I left to join Jaina''s army. I''m sure he''ll be able ta teach ye somethin, or at least know someone who can. If he''s still around, I''m sure he''ll be at The Great Forge.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5731, 'Where should I look for E''ko?', 'Where should I look for E''ko?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5732, '', 'The creatures in Winterspring are a good place ta start.$B$BHoweva'', der may also be other places you can look...', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5733, 'Of course I can help you with training. I''m just a journeyman myself, but I''m sure there''s something I can show you.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5734, 'I don''t admit this lightly, but you are a far better smith than I am. If you want to learn more than my meager teachings then I suggest you seek out a Dwarf named Therum Deepforge in Stormwind. You will find him in the Dwarven District.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5735, 'I''m sorry, I''m a bit busy right now making horseshoes for Verner Osgood in Lakeshire. ', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5736, 'Do I look like I have the time to spend jawin?', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5737, 'You''re not bad, but let me show you a few tricks you might find handy. ', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5738, 'A far better blacksmith than I am, that''s for sure. Though I''ll deny it if you tell anyone I said that. You should go speak with Therum Deepforge. If anyone can teach you more, it''s him.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5739, 'I hear one comment about waterfowl, and you will be eating through a tube.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5740, 'Just swinging a hammer at an anvil doesn''t make you a smith. Give me that and let me teach you something before you embarrass us all.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5741, 'Not bad. Go talk with Snarl, he just moved to Orgrimmar to study under Saru. Look for him in the Warrior district near Saru''s smithy. Oh and he''ll test you, so you better be as ready as you think you are.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5742, 'Snarl calls me simple because I am too slow. I just want to do the job right, and that takes time.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5743, 'I can show you what you wish to know, but you must be patient. Take your time to work the steel and feel the way it shapes beneath your hammer. When you become one with the steel, then you will understand.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5744, 'You learn quickly, that is not a bad thing. Just be sure to do the job right, as long as it takes to do so. Now, I fear I must send you to Snarl to learn more. Learn what he can teach, but do not listen to his angry words. He gets that way when Saru''s daughters laugh at him.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5745, 'I listen and I listen but I don''t hear these spirits that Karn speaks of. ', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5746, 'Karn says we need to listen to the spirits of the forge and of the steel, that they will guide us. I hear nothing but a ringing in my ears. Here, take a hammer and let us try to hear the spirits together.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5747, 'I guess the spirits like you better than me, I still have not heard their call but you seem to have gathered their lessons well. Go speak to Karn, he will be excited to see one who hears them as he does.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5748, 'All is not lost! Battle these beasts without fear. Your wounds I shall heal, bones I shall mend. Be renewed, heroes!', '', 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5749, '', 'Your interruption is costing me valuable time, this had better be good.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5750, '', 'Ah yes, another who will stoke the fires and forge the weapons of war. Of course I will teach you how.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5751, '', 'You have learned well my child. Go to the Undercity, find a smith named James Van Brunt. He will be able to teach you much that I cannot. I understand he spends his time near the Warriors training hall, forging their weapons and armor.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5752, 'I hope to one day forge weapons and armor from the bones of my enemies.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5753, 'You are not trying to kill the anvil with your hammer, you are trying to create a weapon to kill your foes with. Let me show you what you are doing wrong.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5754, 'You have learned much, more than I can teach. Go to James Van Brunt, he will teach you what I cannot.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5755, 'You must continue! Their resolve is weakening. Drink from my power and be renewed once again!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5756, 'What is Juju?', 'What is Juju?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5757, '', 'E''ko is da unfocused form of the supernatural power, and Juju is da concentrated essence. By using a stong incantation, I can transform da E''ko into Juju.  Once it becomes Juju, you can den use the Cache of Mau''ari ta reflect da powers onto yourself.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5758, 'I lost the Cache of Mau''ari. What can I do?', 'I lost the Cache of Mau''ari. What can I do?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5759, '', 'Ah am very surprised that one wit such a careless nature has gotten dis far...$B$BYah, you may have another charm, but Mau''ari is very displeased wit your actions!$B$BGo, now. ', 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5760, 'You have come too far to fail. Stand back, mortals.', '', 1, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5761, 'You will suffer in this defeat, Nefarian!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5762, 'This should do it! At least it better do it!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5763, 'Holy Krakle! The temperature is 428,000 degrees Kraklenheit! ', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5764, 'The temperature is 9280 degrees Kraklenheit! That''s HOT!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5765, 'The temperature is 564 degrees Kraklenheit.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5766, 'The temperature is 122 degrees Kraklenheit.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5767, 'The temperature is 12 degrees Kraklenheit. How exciting.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5768, 'Um, Ozzie... that doesn''t look very safe.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5769, 'OZZIE!!!! OH NO!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5770, 'Didn''t even leave his boots behind...', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5771, '%s shrugs.', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5772, '%s collapses but the broken body rises again!', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5773, 'The living are here!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5774, 'Ow!  OK, I''ll get back to work, $n!', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5775, 'When I get all shaken up, hear me shout...', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5776, 'Vaelastrasz, when this world belongs to the black flight, your flight shall know its end.', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5777, 'But for now, your death will have to suffice...', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5778, 'You merely destroy an image, fool. I shall hunt you until the end of days.', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5779, 'Aye, it appears as if ye have learned quite a bit, I''m impressed. But do ye know how many I have that seek to be my apprentice? Tell ye what, do a small task fer me and I''ll take ye on.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5780, 'Ye have some skill about ye with hammer and anvil, but not enough. Go speak to Dane Lindgren, he''ll get ye ready to learn what I have to teach ye.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;


', '', 0, 0, 0, 14, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0),
(5971, 'What roles?', 'What roles?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5972, 'Truly, I envy you: To battle in the name of the Horde, at the forefront of conflict. Mine is a job of command.$B$BCertainly, in my youth, I lived out the dreams that make my old age bearable. I now revel in the glory of victory, the bitter taste of defeat - all through the soldiers I command.
', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0),
(5973, 'Dreams?', 'Dreams?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5974, 'I dream, $n... oh yes, I dream. In my dreams I die a thousand times in a thousand different ways. Some would call dreams such as mine nightmares. NOT I! In dreams I die in the thick of battle. For each single death of my own, ten thousand enemies of the Horde fall before me. It is glorious!', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0),
(5975, 'I pray for such things.', 'I pray for such things.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5976, 'Aye, I could tell just by looking at you, $n. You remind me very much of myself as a young warrior of the Horde.$B$BYou will undoubtedly go far in life and even further in death.$B$B<Goretooth salutes.>', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 66, 0, 0, 0),
(5977, 'I do not deserve such praise, Warlord Goretooth.', 'I do not deserve such praise, Warlord Goretooth.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5978, 'And modest too... Perhaps it is your time, then, $n.$B$BAre you prepared to enter the fortress of the Blackrock orcs? To wreak havoc? To tear asunder the foundation of the mountain citadel?', '', 0, 0, 0, 25, 6, 6, 0, 0, 0),
(5979, 'Sir! Until my body ceases to function!', 'Sir! Until my body ceases to function!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5980, 'I did not doubt you for even one second, $n.$B$BHere are your orders, $n. I know that you will not let me down.
', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5981, 'Yes, sir. Thank you, sir!', 'Yes, sir. Thank you, sir!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5982, '%s bows before Krang Stonehoof', '%s bows before Krang Stonehoof', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5983, 'Ah a visitor! Must be an adventurer, we don''t get many tourists down this way. Grab a chair and a drink, make yourself comfortable. Say, you look like you have some meat on your bones. You thinkin about competing in the cage matches?', 'Ah a visitor! Must be an adventurer, we don''t get many tourists down this way. Grab a chair and a drink, make yourself comfortable. Say, you look like you have some meat on your bones. You thinkin about competing in the cage matches?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5984, '%s attacks the pike!', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5985, '%s destroys the pike!', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

', 'Hearthglen?? But...
', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5997, '<Eitrigg laughs.>$B$BYoung one, the world has not always been in such disarray. It was a time before the Scourge had sacked the land. Before those parts of Lordaeron were known as the Plaguelands.$B$BIt was there that Thrall rescued me from death and it was then that I joined the new Horde... but I digress. This is a story for another time. Yes, another time... Perhaps...', '', 0, 0, 0, 11, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0),
(5998, 'I will take you up on that offer, Eitrigg.', 'I will take you up on that offer, Eitrigg.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5999, 'I''m certain you will. Perhaps one day you could deliver a message to an old friend of mine. I hear he still wanders those woods.$B$B<Eitrigg bows his head for a moment, as if in prayer.>$B$BSo Rend, yes... Rend and his brother Maim ruled the Spire, in constant conflict with the Dark Iron dwarves. They managed to displace the dwarves in the upper portion of the city, but only after the dragons came and only after the death of Maim.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0),
(6000, 'Ah, so that is how they pushed the Dark Iron to the lower parts of the Spire.', 'Ah, so that is how they pushed the Dark Iron to the lower parts of the Spire.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6001, 'Indeed. Nefarian, brood of Deathwing, rules the Spire now. Rend is under the command of the dragon.$B$BIf only you could somehow manage to pass through the Halls of Ascension.$B$B<Eitrigg sighs.>$B$BAlas, only those deemed worthy by the black flight earn privilege to ascend.
', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0),
(6002, 'Perhaps there exists a way?', 'Perhaps there exists a way?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6003, 'Perhaps. Go now, young one. Seek council with the Warchief. He will surely wish to know of your discovery.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6004, 'As you wish, Eitrigg.', 'As you wish, Eitrigg.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6005, 'Hulfnar!  Thontek!  Stand and address me.', 'Hulfnar!  Thontek!  Stand and address me.', 0, 0, 3, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6006, 'It''s 428,000 degrees Kraklenheit... What''s happening, hot stuff!?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6007, 'DING! 428,000 degrees Kraklenheit, exactly! Well, approximately. Almost. Somewhere around there...', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6008, 'Measuring by Kraklenheit, it is 428,000 degrees! That''s Krakley!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6009, '18 degrees Kraklenheit. It''s kind of cold, actually...', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6010, 'It''s 40 degrees Kraklenheit. Can you feel the heat? No? I really couldn''t either.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6011, 'Wow, it''s 3 degrees Kraklenheit. Keep looking.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6012, 'The stake is covered with the remnants of those foolish enough to anger the Warchief.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6013, 'Honor your heroes! On this day, they have dealt a great blow against one of our most hated enemies! The false Warchief, Rend Blackhand, has fallen!', '', 6, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6014, 'Be bathed in my power! Drink in my might! Battle for the glory of the Horde!', '', 6, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6015, 'Be bathed in the power of the Warchief! Drink in his might! Battle for the glory of the Horde!', '', 6, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6016, 'The Valley of Trials will temper even the weakest into a warrior worthy to join the Horde. Those who cannot rise to its tests will be left to bake in the scorching desert sun.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6017, 'Place Rend''s head on the stake.', 'Place Rend''s head on the stake.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6018, '', 'Hello there, $N.  I am known as Chronormu, but you may call me Chromie.  I am comfortable with such familiarity.$B$BNow - how did I know your name, you ask?  I am one of the bronze dragonflight, forever attuned to the ebb and flow of time.  You could say that we have met before.  To that end, we shall also meet again.$B$BI hope that my choice of visual demeanor does not disturb you; while I might be charged to be a sentry of sorrowful places, I choose not to drown in the sorrow of the locale.


', 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6019, '', 'Hello once again, $n.  I sense that the flow of time remains threatened by forces that are quite powerful indeed.  Your continued assistance is always welcomed by the bronze dragonflight.$B$BWhile the past is set in its ways, the future is always changing.  The decisions you make in the here and now help guide that change.', 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6020, 'I want you both to demonstrate the techniques I have taught you for the benefit of the younger students here.  Ready...  begin!', 'I want you both to demonstrate the techniques I have taught you for the benefit of the younger students here.  Ready...  begin!', 0, 0, 3, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6021, '', 'This is where I get off, suckers!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6022, '', 'Tell Lexlort if he wants the information, all he has to do is pay! Unfortunately, that means he can''t kill me if he wants the information - since I burned the battle plans and all...', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6023, '', 'Listen to your elders, $n. If you are strong of will and dedicated, there is no power you cannot control.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6024, '', 'Not all Forsaken are driven by Sylvanas'' will, $n. Some of us are driven by true power--power we earn for ourselves.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6025, 'Enough talk you two!  Commence fighting!', 'Enough talk you two!  Commence fighting!', 0, 0, 3, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6026, '', 'Now''s not a good time, $n.$B$BAre you insane?!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6027, '', 'It... is... not... the best... time, $n. I must concen... trate.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6028, '', 'Your errand must mean much, $c, to draw you so deep into the marsh...', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6029, '', 'The infernal is one of the most powerful demons a warlock could hope to have at $Ghis:her; side in battle. The creature is stong, well-armored, and delivers devastating blows upon any foe. If you were to choose to put the spirit of an infernal into your weapon, you would gain some of those benefits--greater health and regeneration and the like.$B$BIf you wish to know more about felhounds, then you should speak to Wytula across from me.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6030, '', 'The felhound... a vicious creature indeed. It is not as physically strong as an infernal, but a wise warlock knows that brute force is not always the answer--if it was, you would have chosen the path of a warrior instead, wouldn''t you?$B$BThe felhound draws upon the mana of its foes, using that and its quickness to overcome enemies. Its strength comes from the arcane and using that arcane power for its own ends.$B$BIf you wish to know more about infernals, then you should speak to Magaz across from me.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6031, 'ROOKERY MINION SPAWN DEBUG', 'ROOKERY MINION SPAWN DEBUG', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6032, 'ROOKERY MINION death DEBUG', 'ROOKERY MINION death DEBUG', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6033, '%s is summoned through a temporal rift!', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6034, '', 'Have you spoken to either of my acolytes inside the tower yet, $n? We cannot complete your orb until you''ve done one of their tasks. Speak to them now, if you''re ready.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6035, 'Help me kill $n!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6036, 'Protect me from this $n! I must return to my brood.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6037, 'Don''t let me die!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6038, 'Well Done!', 'Well Done!', 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6039, '', '%s roars out for her mate!', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6040, '%s answers the call of Shy-Rotam.', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6043, 'Please, help me $g brother : sister;...$B$BI will soon pass from this world, and though I suffer I know I shall not any more once I pass.  The wildlife though, my $g brother : sister;... the wildlife suffers too, and it knows no release.  I ask for your aid with my last breaths of life.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6045, 'Yes, I speak a language you understand $r.  We are not animals, yet most of your kind continues to treat us as such!  Our differences though pale to the tragedy that has befallen this land.  Please, put aside your differences with my kind and hear my dying plea.$B$BI came to this land to mend what I could, and now that will be for naught unless you can aid me.  I ask for such aid with my last breaths of life.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6046, '"..."$B$BThe body of the tauren druid lies still and unmoving.  It would seem as though he has finally passed from this world to his promised great beyond.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6061, 'None may challenge the Brotherhood!', '', 1, 5780, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6062, 'And stay down!', '', 1, 5781, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6063, 'Lapdogs, all of you!', '', 1, 5782, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6064, 'Fools! Our cause is righteous!', '', 1, 5783, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6065, 'The Brotherhood shall prevail!', '', 1, 5784, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6066, 'Leaping leper gnomes! I''ve been stuck in there for months. Thanks, gang.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6067, 'Who dares step into my domain!  Come!  Come, and be consumed!', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6068, 'Ever vigilant in their protection of the natural world, the druids are guided by Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm who resides in the Cenarion Enclave.  You will find him and the other Druid trainers in the northern section of Darnassus.', 'Ever vigilant in their protection of the natural world, the druids are guided by Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm who resides in the Cenarion Enclave.  You will find him and the other Druid trainers in the northern section of Darnassus.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6069, 'I am an officer of the city, working in the capacity of the Undercity''s census.  Since our liberation from the Scourge, we have tried to keep an accurate track of our city''s populace.  Through arcane methods and sharpened mental discipline, I am able to access these records.  If you have business with me accordingly, please proceed.  You should know if you do, at any rate.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6070, 'The Warchief has instructed me to study all kinds of weapons and armor. He has sent me here to the hub of both the tauren and orc cultures in the Barrens to meet as many travelers as possible, and to learn about the cultures of the Barrens.$B$BHe feels there''s something to be learned from even the most pathetic of cultures... like the quilboar or centaur.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6071, 'You surrendered.  I win.', 'You surrendered.  I win.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6072, 'Now that''s a War Stomp!  Good job!', 'Now that''s a War Stomp!  Good job!', 0, 0, 3, 21, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6073, 'That''s how it''s done class!  You better be paying attention!', 'That''s how it''s done class!  You better be paying attention!', 0, 0, 3, 21, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6074, 'Now that''s putting your hoof down!', 'Now that''s putting your hoof down!', 0, 0, 3, 21, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6075, 'You! $R! Come here. <snort>$B$BTime is short, and my end <snort> is near. Mangletooth shall win; you will see. <snort>$B$BMy capture can still aid <snort> my people. The Razormane tribe is more powerful than the Bristlebacks!$B$BThe Horde looks to find out who leads the raids on their people. You <snort> shall aid Mangletooth in return for the information only I know. Mangletooth can help you! <snort> But you must help Mangletooth.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6076, 'Welcome to Stormwind!  I am one of the city''s officers, aiding the citizenry of the city through our census bureau.  If you are in need of locating someone specific, then I might be able to assist you.  Through arcane methods and sharpened mental discipline, I am able to access these records.$B$BIf you have business with me, then please proceed!', '', 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6077, 'My hatred is strong <snort>, but the time is right to tell you a tale, $r.$B$BLong ago a battle took place between gods. Agamaggan, our great boar god, fell to the earth after being defeated in the War of the Ancients, his blood raining down and his bones torn asunder. <snort>$B$BGreat thorns reached up out of the earth where his blood touched the ground, and his skull adorns one of the caverns to the south.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6078, 'Whew... I need a smoke and the touch of a fine gnomish woman - not particularly in that order!$B$BI''ve been stuck inside the belly of that thing for months! What day is it anyway? Ah, nevermind. All that matters is that I''m finally out.$B$BWOOO HOOO!', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 4, 0, 0, 0),
(6079, 'How the hell did you get in there to begin with?
', 'How the hell did you get in there to begin with?
', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6080, 'How?? Well, it''s a long story.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6081, 'I''m all ears.', 'I''m all ears.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6082, 'Alrighty then! So I was down at the lava pits of the Molten Span, testing out my lava suit. Everything was going great. I was even able to swim around in that stuff without suffering a single injury!$B$BSo there I am, minding my own business, doing a few backstrokes, when out of nowhere this thing swallows me up whole! Had it not been for my lava suit and built in food pellet dispenser, I would have been done for!', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0),
(6083, 'So let me get this straight. You were swimming, nay, doing backstrokes in molten lava with this... this lava suit of yours? Yes? And out of nowhere, this here beast swallowed you whole? ', 'So let me get this straight. You were swimming, nay, doing backstrokes in molten lava with this... this lava suit of yours? Yes? And out of nowhere, this here beast swallowed you whole? ', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6084, 'Say, I sense a measure of disbelief in your voice - but yes, that''s how it happened.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6085, 'I must know something: How did you go to the bathroom with that thing on?', 'I must know something: How did you go to the bathroom with that thing on? ', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6086, 'I''m not out of the belly of this beast for more than two minutes and someone is already asking me about my bathroom behavior??? $G Mister:Missy;, I''d have smacked you silly for that question had you not been the one to rescue me!$B$BAnyhow! I''m grateful for the assistance. Maybe I can pay you back?', '', 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0),
(6087, 'Oh?', 'Oh?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6088, 'Well, maybe ''pay'' isn''t the best word to use. See, when I was stuck in the belly of that thing, I got to thinking:$B$BThis creature lives in hot, flaming magma and yet it doesn''t take a lick of damage from the fire!$B$BIf only I could find a pristine hide from one of these beasts. I could take it back to my dear friend, Malyfous Darkhammer, in Everlook. If anyone could do anything with the hide of a beast like this, it would be him. 
', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0),
(6089, 'I''ll consider that the next time I run into one of these things.', 'I''ll consider that the next time I run into one of these things.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6090, 'So how about you deliver a message for me?', '', 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6091, 'Ish nu!  That''s enough!', 'Ish nu!  That''s enough!', 0, 0, 3, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
