', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0),
(6133, 'So let us pretend I get this hide, what else would you need and what could you actually make?', 'So let us pretend I get this hide, what else would you need and what could you actually make?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
