(6278, 'Nefarian had ordered that unsuitable subjects be destroyed immediately, but these retched beasts would not do so without first inflicting an ''ample'' amount of torture.$B$BWhen we were thoroughly ''broken,'' they would round up what remained and throw us to these thugs. Our bodies used as instruments in their sick game: thrown into the lava or worse; to the open and waiting arms of the bloodthirsty legion below.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
