(6296, '', 'I welcome you, $N. And the Emerald Circle welcomes you.$B$BHopefully together we can help rejuventate and protect this once-mighty forest. Many forces seek to destroy it from without... and within.$B$BDo not be persuaded by the power here--it will only corrupt you, like it has this entire land.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6297, 'While Greta focuses her energy on the recovery of Jaedenar and those who she thinks is mostly responsible for the corruption here in Felwood. I spend my time looking into the effects the corruption has had on the land.$B$BHow has it affected the creatures of the land? What must be done to end the pain of their suffering?$B$BUnfortunately, the corruption runs so deep that eternal sleep is too often the answer.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
