(6855, 'And find it he did. After quickly advancing through the ranks of the Cult, the Lich King himself granted Ras immortality. Thus was born Ras Frostwhisper, the lich.$B$BNow do you understand?', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0),
(6856, 'Yes I do.', 'Yes I do.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6857, 'Good. In order to carry out my plan, we must first create a lifestone. Are you prepared to act?', '', 0, 0, 0, 6, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6858, 'Yes I am.', 'Yes I am.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6859, 'Some were spared the anguish that memories provide.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6860, 'Tell me about the Cult of the Damned.', 'Tell me about the Cult of the Damned.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
