(6882, '', 'Greetings, $c.  I am Miranda Breechlock - one of but a few authorized equipment and materiel quartermasters for the Dawn.$B$BAs you fight evil under our commission - all the while earning our respect and trust - you''ll earn valor tokens from Duke Zverenhoff.  Tokens serve two purposes: use them to gain increased standing within our ranks, or use them as tender in acquiring special items.$B$BAs you improve your standing with the Dawn, you''ll discover that more items will be made available to you.', 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6883, 'What is this?!  How dare you!', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6884, 'Greetings, $c.$B$BThose Sentinels over there have allowed me to share their camp as long as I promise no trouble will follow--I am sure you can appreciate the need for diplomacy while here, yes?$B$BI am here investigating disturbances to the land, and since it aids their cause also, they have agreed that my presence here could only aid the tenuous alliance between all of Azeroth''s races. If you wish to aid me, then I would appreciate it, but regardless, please try not to cause any trouble.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6885, 'Ah, so my minions from the Burning Steppes have brought the dragons...', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6886, 'Marduk, gather the box and place it before me!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6887, 'Master Vectus, I sense something strange within this container...', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6888, 'Welcome to Steelgrill''s Depot!', '', 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6889, 'Race does not dictate honor, $r. While you remain on my farmstead, I ask that you remember and respect this credo.$B$BI have known orcs who have been as honorable as the most noble of knights and humans who have been as vile as the most ruthless of Scourge.$B$BBut I shall not bore you with tales of my youth! There is much work to be done - if that is what you desire. ', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 254, 0, 0, 0),
(6890, 'We have yet to meet our quota for the wood demand.  Now back to work with you.', 'We have yet to meet our quota for the wood demand.  Now back to work with you.', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6891, 'Daylight is still upon us so let''s see that axe of yours chopping some more wood.', 'Daylight is still upon us so let''s see that axe of yours chopping some more wood.', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6892, 'We need to get this wagon filled by the end of the day.  So back to work with you.  Chop, chop!', 'We need to get this wagon filled by the end of the day.  So back to work with you.  Chop, chop!', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
