(7406, 'The spirit looks intently into your eyes and grasps your hand.  You feel a warmth shoot through your body, almost knocking you to your knees.$B$BAs the warmth passes, you feel the slight presence of an ursine spirit within your being... bolstering your resolve.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
