(7558, 'I am here for training.', 'I am here for training.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7559, 'Hey mon! You''ve ever been diving deep in the ocean? I''ll let you in on a little secret, eh. Deep in the ocean you can find bubbly fissures; they''ll allow you to breathe air while underwater.  Let''s keep this secret between you and me though, eh. I don''t need no competition for me shellfish traps elsewhere... if you get my drift!
', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7561, 'Impossible! Stay your attack, mortals... I submit! I submit!', '', 6, 8038, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7562, '', 'The flutter of the wings of a hawk, the breath of a ram in the snow, the pace of a bear through the forest... Such is life for the hunter.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7563, 'I would like to train.', 'I would like to train.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7564, '', 'Look at the wisdom and knowledge of the beast, and you will see yourself. Observe as the owl does, learn cleverness from the sabercat, embody the mighty spirit of the wolf.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7565, 'Please train me.', 'Please train me.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7566, 'The runes of warding have been destroyed! Hunt down the infidels, my brethren!', '', 6, 8039, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7567, 'Brashly, you have come to wrest the secrets of the Living Flame! You will soon regret the recklessness of your quest.', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7568, 'I go now to summon the lord whose house this is. Should you seek an audience with him, your paltry lives will surely be forfeit! Nevertheless, seek out his lair, if you dare!', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7569, '[PH] Ok, I''m outta here... see you in Ragnaros'' Lair... l8', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
