(7578, 'If you''re looking for a flight back to Rut''theran Village, then you should talk to my night elven counterpart, Silva Fil''naveth.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7579, 'You''ve interfered with our plans for the last time, foolish $c!', 'You''ve interfered with our plans for the last time, foolish $c!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7580, '%s begins countdown.', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7581, '%s disabled ghost region.', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7582, '', 'You''ve interfered with our plans for the last time, foolish $c!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7583, '%s is angered!', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7584, 'The times we live in are as fickle as the shifting winds, $c.  It is important to remember what is true and lasting in this world, and to preserve that.  Everything else is a waste.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7585, '%s is drawn to the ghost magnet...', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7586, 'No other race on Azeroth has suffered as much as our people, $c. To laugh in the face of death has become second nature for all of us.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7587, 'Greetings, $N, and welcome to Camp Narache. News of your arrival spread quickly among the tribe.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7588, 'Ah, the beauty of Shadowglen never ceases to delight my senses!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7589, 'Ah, well aren''t you a sturdy-looking one? Perhaps you can assist me with a thing or two. Not much help around here except for green apprentices, and they''ve other things to worry about.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7590, 'Hey, citizen!  You look like a stout one.  We guards are spread a little thin out here, and I could use your help...', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7591, 'The land of Azshara.', 'The land of Azshara.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7592, 'My knowledge of night elf lore is limited, but it is said long ago--back when the night elves still held sacred the art of arcane spell casting--that Azshara was the greatest of their kind. A beautiful woman they named queen. Sadly, it was her addiction to the arcane that would one day be the catalyst for the most devastating events in this world''s history.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7593, 'The Ruins of Eldarath.', 'The Ruins of Eldarath.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7594, 'The mage tower to the north.', 'The mage tower to the north.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7595, '', 'Assassins! Guards! Guards!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7596, '', 'I sense danger up ahead.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7597, '', 'My back is killing me.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7598, '', 'These orders must get to High General Abbendis!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7599, '', 'If I should fall, take my pouch. Make certain that it gets to the High General.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7600, 'The Timbermaw furbolgs.', 'The Timbermaw furbolgs.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7601, 'The presence of blue dragons.', 'The presence of blue dragons.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7602, 'Because you have aided me, I will tell you what I know of this land and of the things there are to see. My knowledge is not vast, but perhaps I can point out some things that might interest one such as yourself.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7603, 'Once a great city of the night elves, the Highborne once ruled there, practicing great and powerful arcane magics. They are cursed now, haunting the lands, and their ruined city has been victimized by the Spitelash naga. I understand that the naga search the ruins for powerful Highborne artifacts.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7604, 'A powerful human mage is rumored to live to the north; he keeps watch over the land for some unknown reason. I have not traveled there myself, but it is said that visitors are welcome and can even earn favor with him if they are willing to do errands for him.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7605, 'I''ve seen terrible things happen to the furbolg over the last few years--they were victims on many fronts. But it''s unclear to me what''s become of this tribe. Are they corrupted by the same plague that''s touched Felwood? Or perhaps they are simply angry at what''s happened to their once peaceful people and now seek to defend themselves. Either way, most of them appear hostile to those who come into the area.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7606, 'The blue dragons themselves aren''t here, but followers of Malygos are. I do not know why, but I can tell you this: wherever the blue dragons are, expect to find arcane magic. I wouldn''t be surprised if the dragonspawn are here protecting something... perhaps something the Highborne left behind.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7607, '', 'I should find some hired help; I don''t like sitting here all day selling fish supplies. I''d much rather go fishing, and then sell supplies.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7608, 'Let''s take a look at your fishing supplies.', 'Let''s take a look at your fishing supplies.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7610, '', 'Throm-Ka, $c. My mood is poor this day, so please, unless you can help me, I would prefer to be alone.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7611, '', 'Good work, $n!  Complete your trial by speaking with me.  Time continues to slip away until you do so!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7612, 'Reckless mortals! None may challenge the Sons of the Living flame!', '', 6, 8035, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7613, 'I can not train you, $c.', 'I can not train you, $c.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7614, 'I am Ulysses Rackmore, captain of the Gallant.  And this is the log of the last few days of my doomed ship.$B$BWe were sailing to Feathermoon Stronghold with a shipment of supplies when naga stormed the sides of the Gallant.  We drove them back but we knew they''d return.  Fearing the loss of my most precious belongings, I steered the Gallant to an island off the coast of Desolace, one with old, night elf ruins.  And there I left my treasure chest.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7615, 'Continue reading...', 'Continue reading...', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7616, 'My chest is one of ingenious design, and requires two keys to unlock, one gold and one silver.  The first key, the silver key, I gave to my first mate, and I kept the gold.$B$BBut we were doomed to lose them.  My key was lost during the next naga attack, and my first mate''s was lost a day later when drysnap makrura assailed us and pulled him into the deep.$B$BI am sure the naga and makrura have the keys.  I am glad the two are enemies and will not share them.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7617, 'After the makrura attack, we could see that the Gallant would not survive another.  So I and the few surviving sailors abandoned my ship.$B$BWe are now ashore and will soon strike out for the town of Nijel''s Point, but much danger lies between us and sanctuary, and I fear Desolace will consume us.$B$BI write this now in hopes that someone will know our plight, and some day avenge us against the watery fiends who were our ruin.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7618, '', 'The Shrine of Remulos is a sacred place for us in the Cenarion Circle here in Moonglade... so please conduct yourself in a manner befitting a visitor.$B$BA visitor who doesn''t want my scimitar buried in them, that is.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7619, '', 'May Cenarius watch over you, $g brother : sister;.$B$BI am Tajarri, and I am a sworn protector of this shrine.  It is my honor to serve Keeper Remulos as a warden of this sacred land.', 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7620, 'Before the Scourge came, I had a great business.  I bought and sold everything.  Everything!$B$BAnd my prices were INSANE!$B$BJust ask anyone.  Anyone who''s not dead.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7621, 'Hi $n!  Are you here to buy something?  Or maybe sell something?$B$BYou won''t find better prices anywhere, or my name isn''t Augustus the Touched!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7622, 'Commerce!  I crave it!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7623, 'Yes, Augustus.  I would like to do business.', 'Yes, Augustus.  I would like to do business.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7624, 'This is a dangerous place, $n. Be careful around here.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

', '', 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7645, 'The Firelord and his brethren once held sway over this entire world, mortal. As a servant of the Old Gods, he fought against the Titans for domination of this planet. The victorious Titans banished my master and his brethren to the Elemental Plane - there to remain imprisoned until the end of time.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7646, 'Tell me more.', 'Tell me more.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7647, 'Do you prefer guns or bows?', 'Do you prefer guns or bows?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7648, 'I do not have the knowledge you seek.', 'I do not have the knowledge you seek.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7649, 'Very well, $n.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7650, 'Wot kin I do fer ye?', 'Wot kin I do fer ye?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7651, 'I kinnae help ye with trainin''. Ye should look fer a $c trainer.', 'I kinnae help ye with trainin''. Ye should look fer a $c trainer.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7652, 'What?', 'What?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7653, 'Don''t waste my time.', 'Don''t waste my time.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7654, 'I can not train you.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7655, 'Impudent whelps! You''ve rushed headlong to your own deaths! See now, the master stirs!
', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7656, 'Hey mon, you be needin'' to head on over to da $c trainer.', 'Hey mon, you be needin'' to head on over to da $c trainer.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7657, 'Behold Ragnaros - the Firelord! He who was ancient when this world was young! Bow before him, mortals! Bow before your ending!', '', 6, 8040, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7658, 'Teach me the ways of the spirits.', 'Teach me the ways of the spirits.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7659, 'The spirits have guided you to me. How may I be of service?', 'The spirits have guided you to me. How may I be of service?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7660, 'May the spirits be with you.', 'May the spirits be with you.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7661, 'These mortal infidels, my lord! They have invaded your sanctum and seek to steal your secrets!', '', 6, 8041, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7662, 'FOOL! YOU ALLOWED THESE INSECTS TO RUN RAMPANT THROUGH THE HALLOWED CORE? AND NOW YOU LEAD THEM TO MY VERY LAIR? YOU HAVE FAILED ME, EXECUTUS! JUSTICE SHALL BE MET, INDEED!', '', 6, 8044, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7663, 'Da spirits be strong wit you, mon. What kin dis troll do for ya?', 'Da spirits be strong wit you, mon. What kin dis troll do for ya?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7664, 'May da spirits protect you mon.', 'May da spirits protect you mon.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7665, 'Where are you going?  Well if you''re looking to get there quickly, then look no further!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7666, 'I try to keep Sentinel Hill stocked, and that''s not easy with all the action we see.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7667, 'I need a ride, fast!  I have an important message to deliver!', 'I need a ride, fast!  I have an important message to deliver!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7668, 'Ah, $gpriest:priestess;, you came along just in time. I appreciate it.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7669, 'Argh, the pain. Will it ever leave me?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7670, 'Thank you! Thank you, $gpriest:priestess;. Now I can take on those murlocs with the Light on my side!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7671, 'Farewell to you, and may the Light be with you always.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7672, 'A mere three hundred years ago, a reckless dwarf named Thaurissan summoned the master from his fiery realm. His return to this paltry world devastated the surrounding lands and created this volcanic Core. Mighty Ragnaros has slept under this mountain ever since. 
', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7673, 'What else do you have to say?', 'What else do you have to say?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7674, 'We, his sworn servants, do his bidding and enforce his iron-rule. Cut off from the energies of his fiery realm, Ragnaros is but a shadow of his true self. However, he has more than enough strength to be your end.      
', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7675, 'You challenged us and we have come. Where is this master you speak of?
', 'You challenged us and we have come. Where is this master you speak of?
', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7676, 'Good day, $gsir:ma''am;. I''d shake your hand, but as you see, I''m in the middle of something. May I be of assistance?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7677, 'You''ve made a good start, but you still have a great deal to learn, $n.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7678, 'You''ve already learned everything I can teach you, $n. Talk to the night elf Lilyssia Nightbreeze in the Mage Quarter of Stormwind if you want to continue your studies. I hear she''s a good teacher.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7679, '', 'Shut inside this little house, I dream of joining the battles that rage outside the city walls. Still, duty compels me to share my knowledge with others who fight in my stead... for now.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7682, 'Ishnu-alah, $gbrother:sister;. Have you any tidings from abroad? My heart yearns for news of Teldrassil.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7683, 'I am honored to share my knowledge with you, $n. See that you use it well.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7684, 'You must choose a more experienced teacher, for you have surpassed my abilities. I advise you to speak with Lilyssia Nightbreeze here: she has much knowledge to offer.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7685, 'NOW FOR YOU, INSECTS! BOLDLY, YOU SOUGHT THE POWER OF RAGNAROS. NOW YOU SHALL SEE IT FIRSTHAND!
', '', 6, 8045, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7686, '', 'The druids say that it is only a matter of time until nature itself drives the Horde from Kalimdor. Yet corruption continues to spread throughout our lands, even here on Teldrassil.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7687, '', 'Well done! Your understanding of potions is coming along nicely.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7688, '', 'Unfortunately, there is little I can teach someone with your experience, my friend. Seek out the night elf Sylvanna Forestmoon, who resides in the Craftsmen''s Terrace of Darnassus.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7689, '', 'Elune-adore, my $gbrother:sister;. You are welcome here. Speak, and I will do what I can to aid you.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7690, '', 'Is it not astonishing what one can create from the plants of the forest? Truly, Elune has blessed us with her bounty.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7691, '', 'You are kind to seek me out, but your skills are beyond my own. Have a word with Sylvanna Forestmoon, just over there. She''s been looking for another student.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7692, 'Did my sweet lass Kali send you down to me? The apple of my eye, she is.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7693, 'I don''t suppose you''re here to talk about my lovely Kali. Fine, then. Potions it is. Anyone ever tell ye you''ve got a one-track mind?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7694, 'Ye''re beyond my skill to teach, $n. Go pester Tally Berryfizz; she''s a gnome living in Tinker Town of Ironforge. Oh, and since you''re headed up anyway, give Kali my love.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7695, 'Don''t let those big, innocent eyes fool ye. Tally''s an expert, all right: I learn something new every day. Why d''you think I''m here in Tinker Town? Do I look like an engineer to you? Aye, I didn''t think so.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7696, 'Put your back into it, $glad:lass;. Hard work and determination--that''s the way! Don''t let anyone tell you book learnin'' is all ye need.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7697, 'Och, there''s nothing I can teach ye, $n. Have a word with Tally Berryfizz over there. She can hardly reach the tables, but when she starts brewing a potion, watch out!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7698, 'You got the look of someone wantin'' adventure. Me, I had enough of that by the time we trolls came here. Now I take each day as it comes, an'' I train other folks to handle adventures for me.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7699, 'Ready for another lesson? All right, then. First, relax. You gotta stay loose to stir a potion just right.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7700, 'You got questions, but they be too big for me to answer, $n. You be needin'' to have words with the orc Yelmak in the Drag of Orgrimmar. He''ll help you out.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7701, 'All the bottles on this table are potions I brewed today. And they say a watched pot never boils. Ha!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7702, 'They called me stupid, but I''ll show them. I''m going to watch every pot I have and prove that they can all boil stuff anyway. Yeah, I''m on a roll! Who''s stupid now, huh? Huh!?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7703, 'Can''t help you. You know more about potions than I do. Besides, I have pots to watch. Talk to Yelmak over there. He knows a lot about potions.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7704, 'Bena works like one possessed. Day and night I have seen her bent over these potions, often going without sleep or food. I know our undead allies need help, but I begin to fear she will do herself an injury.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7705, 'I must have broken hundreds of vials when I first began brewing potions. The glass was so fragile in my clumsy hands. I hope you are more cautious than I was.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7706, 'Your capacity for learning has outstripped mine. You will need to talk to Bena Winterhoof over there for further instruction. Please don''t take too much of her time, though. She needs her rest.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7707, '', 'Nice to see a friendly face. I don''t get much chitchat from Apothecary Johaan unless he wants something. He''s been out of the grave too long. Someday I''ll be like that, I hear. Creepy. Maybe by then I won''t care.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7708, '', 'Here to learn about potions? I''ve got plenty to teach you. I might be dead, but I haven''t lost my brains. Yet.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7709, '', 'I appreciate the company, but let''s face it: you have more experience with potions than I do. Talk to Doctor Marsh instead if you want training. He''s a Forsaken in the Apothecarium of the Undercity.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7710, 'Once, it is true, I was human. What might otherwise be a shortcoming works to our advantage, $n, for I know human weaknesses intimately.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7711, 'Very well. Cut another lump of flesh from one of these specimens. Let us test what you''ve learned so far, and we can progress from there.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7712, 'Your knowledge of potions has exceeded mine, but you still have much to learn. Go up the stairs to the southeast and see Doctor Marsh. He will teach you true sufferi--ahem. He is a Forsaken who will train you further.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7713, 'Stop giving me that look. I may not be an adventurer like you, but that doesn''t mean I can''t have a few muscles. All that stirring makes your arms strong.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7714, 'There''s nothing more I can teach you. I''ve heard of a night elf who might be able to, though. Her name is Ainethil, and she lives in the Craftsmen''s Terrace of Darnassus.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7715, 'I''m sorry, $n, but I have no time to spend on novices. You want someone closer to your own skill level. Try the night elf Milla Fairancora, in the Craftsmen''s Terrace of Darnassus.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7716, 'You''ve put in your time studying the basics. Now it''s time to up the ante.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7717, 'You want my help? You got it. What do you need?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7718, '', 'Don''t let the beady eyes and bushy beard fool you. Vosur''s a talented apprentice and a good friend, even if I do get a crick in my neck when I talk to him.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7719, '', 'Um, you already know everything I could teach you. Maybe it''s time for you to talk to someone else. Try the night elf Ainethil in the Craftsmen''s Terrace of Darnassus. She''s got some real talent!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7720, '', 'Hey, that''s actually not so bad. Alrighty, then. How''d you like to run an errand for me?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7721, '', 'That''s nice, $n. Go show whatever it is to Vosur over there. He''ll answer any questions you have.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7722, '', 'Who are you and why are you bothering me? Oh, right--potions student. Right. What can I do for you?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7723, '', 'Ishnu-dal-dieb, $n. Have you come here in search of knowledge?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7724, '', 'Teaching is not a one-sided trade, $n. As I teach you, I learn more myself, and my understanding grows.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7725, '', 'My apologies, $n, but I do not offer instruction to novices. Instead, talk to Milla Fairancora in the Craftsmen''s Terrace of Darnassus. She can help you make up for lost time.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(7726, '', 'You have learned the fundamentals of making potions, but further study requires greater commitment. Prove your dedication by carrying out a task for me.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;




', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8038, 'In the Silverpine Forest along the edges of the North Tide''s Run, a derelict boat rests on the shore.  Out to the west of this lies what you seek; swim too far and the ocean will crush you from fatigue.  It resides on the ocean floor in a lockbox, waiting for you to claim it.$B$BYou''ll be hard pressed to survive a dive to such depths without aid, so take heart; a bubbly fissure offers renewed breath to divers seeking this half of the pendant.  Use it wisely.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8039, '', 'In the northern part of Darkshore runs the Cliffspring River, flowing down from the lands now known as Felwood.  As the river flows out and empties out into the Mist''s Edge, travel north to where the deepest parts of the ocean begin.  A stone formation that some call the Stone Claw due to its shape is where you may find what you seek.$B$BBe warned - threshers gather by the Stone Claw, and will attack those who trespass on their territory.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8040, '', 'In the northeastern Barrens lies a pool of water sickened by pollution.  The locals call it the Sludge Fen; the Venture Company has turned the once crystal-blue waters into a mire of industrial byproducts and waste.  In the heart of this fen lies what you seek, $n.$B$BBe warned - the Venture Company does not tolerate trespassers, and they consider anyone who does not work for them as such.  You''ll especially be a target as a protector of nature, something they vehemently oppose.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8041, 'The grass is soft and lush. The air is fresh, full of light and song. Everything I''ve seen suggests that Teldrassil is a dream come true. Why, then, is my heart full of foreboding?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8042, 'You have advanced beyond my skill to teach you. Journey now to Aerie Peak in the Hinterlands and speak with the dwarf Drakk Stonehand. His work is magnificent, far better than my own.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8043, 'You have demonstrated skill in learning our craft. Do you also possess the resolve to complete a mission on my behalf?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8044, 'I regret to say that I cannot aid you, $gnoble sir:gentle lady;, until you learn more of working with leather. Speak with Faldron or Darianna here instead. They can teach you the skill you require.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8045, 'Do not try to force your will upon the leather. Rather, let its natural tendencies dictate what form and function it will take. This is not a battle to be won. Work with the leather, not against it.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8046, '', 'The needle is small, but the thread is strong, and the stitches are fine. Our pact with Thrall and the others will hold. The Horde will not be driven from these lands.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8047, '', 'Even my talents have a limit, and you have reached it. Congratulations, $n. Your next stop should be Camp Mojache in Feralas. The tauren Hahrana Ironhide lives there; she is renowned for her skill.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8048, '', 'As members of the Horde, we must contribute to our community to ensure that it continues to thrive. Thus, I am certain you will gladly aid us by undertaking a small task I have for you.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8049, '', 'It''s been so long since I was a novice myself that I don''t think I''d be the best teacher for you. Try talking to Tarn or Mak, right over there. One of them should be able to answer your questions.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8050, '', 'Cairne has brought us to a land rich with possibilities for the future. We have been fortunate, and so in turn we pass on our good fortune to others. That is why I began teaching, $n.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8051, 'I can make amazing things with the materials I find out here. By Muradin''s beard, there are fantastic creatures in these hills! Go have a whack at them, $n, and bring me back some tall tales.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8052, 'Och, ''twas a sad day when I realized my obsession. I woke up and found myself tannin'' before I had my first tankard of ale. Hardly even a respectable hangover! I knew then--aye, I knew!--how it was goin'' to be.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8053, 'I love a good challenge; don''t you? Aye, of course ye do. An'' that''s why you''re about to do exactly what I say.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8054, 'I''m not here to teach babes fresh out of the cradle. Ye''ve nowhere near the amount of skill I require in my students. In fact, ye''re a sad figure of a $glad:lass;, an'' I''ll thank ye not to stand there jibber-jabberin'' at me.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8055, '', 'All requests for my work must be made in person by the buyer. Orwin often asks me to reconsider, but my priorities lie here. Look around you: many of these fighters rely upon me for their armor.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8056, '', 'I only wish I had more students like you. Not many will venture so far into enemy territory. I salute your courage.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8057, '', 'We cannot afford to give an inch in this war. Day and night, I create new armor, and I patch whatever can be salvaged from the old. I have no time for other tasks. Would you take care of something for me?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8058, '', 'You have wasted your time and mine by coming to me for training, $n. I have no time to teach basic skills. We''re fighting a war here, and this is one of the front lines. Don''t return to me until you are more prepared.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8059, 'I can tell that your wardrobe is in dire need of care.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8060, 'I''m a simple man who knows a few things about tailoring, but you need more assistance than I can provide. I have heard of a Night Elf who is quite an accomplished tailor. He resides in Stormwind, in the Magic District. ', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8061, 'So you would like to learn a few things? I would be happy to get you started!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8062, 'Life is like a carefully woven tapestry.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8063, 'Hmm... the things you need to learn are a little above my head. Have a talk with Sellandus over at Larson''s Clothiers just up the path to the right. He taught me everything I know!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8064, 'Very well, let your journey of tailoring begin.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8065, 'Needlework requires a steady hand. And patience... above all, patience.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8066, 'It is time for you to journey to Darnassus and speak to Me''lynn. She will guide you from now on.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8067, 'I would be happy to take you under my wing. Let us begin.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8068, 'Welcome to me shop. What can I do for ye''?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8069, 'Hold on there, I''m just an assistant. If ye want to start learnin'' the fancy stuff, talk to old Stonebrew over there.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8070, 'Excellent! I''ve been hopin'' for a new student. Well, let''s get started right away then!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8071, 'We use many animal pelts and skins in our creations. ', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8072, 'I know a few things, but I''m no expert. Lucky for you, Magar is. He''s standing near the back of the shop. See if he can help you, but be careful not to rile him. He can be irritable.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8073, 'I will teach you what I can.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8074, 'No part of the animals we hunt is wasted. ', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8075, 'You seek a higher knowledge. Tepa is blessed with such knowledge. She should be standing somewhere nearby...', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8076, 'With the Earth Mother''s blessing, we shall begin.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8077, 'Pleased to make you acquaintance. May I help you?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8078, 'I am knowledgable, but I am not an expert. You know who you should talk to? Rhiannon! She''s not far. Ask around for her in Undercity', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8079, 'So... you want to be a tailor? Very well, we''ll see if you have what it takes.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8080, 'We don''t get many visitors out here. May I interest you in something?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8081, 'I''m just a student myself, really. Rhiannon''s the expert. She''s standing by the crates over there. You can learn a lot from her.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8082, 'Yes, I think you have potential. Maybe I can show you a thing or two.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8083, '', 'There is no greater way to clear the mind than to weave.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8084, '', 'My education is ongoing, and your knowledge surpasses mine. If you wish to learn more you must speak to Me''lynn. She will guide you.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8085, '', 'You will not be disappointed, traveler. Tailoring is a joyous endeavor.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8086, 'Hey mon, what can I be doin'' for you?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8087, 'At dis point you know as much as I do, mon. Maybe you go see Magar in Orgrimmar. He not be da happiest tailor around, but he help you anyway.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8088, 'Dat''s da attitude! Grab a needle and thread and let''s get jammin''!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8089, 'I am afraid that I am no longer gentle or humble. Age and countless battles have hardened my skin and soul. Perhaps that is why Cairne assigned me to Sun Rock Retreat... the gentle winds and warm sun does ease the pain.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8090, 'I knew you would come, $n. It is good to see you again, friend.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8091, 'Yawww!', '', 0, 0, 0, 35, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8092, '%s loses power and shuts off!', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8093, '%s nearly shatters!', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8094, 'Greetings.  Our bats are well trained and fed.  You''ll not find faster.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8095, 'How may I be of service?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8096, 'Greetings, and welcome.  I am not very good at smiling, but trust me; I am happy to serve you.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8097, 'Let me browse your goods.', 'Let me browse your goods.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8098, '', 'The Hippogryph is a noble beast, proud and swift.  They are an honor to train, and can quickly take their rider a great distance.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8099, 'To maintain our link to the mainland, we have hippogryphs constantly flying between Rut''theran Village and Darkshore.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8100, '', 'The fish off the coast of Teldrassil are quite large and robust.  Rumors say it is the speedy growth of our new world tree that is the cause.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8101, 'Although the coast of Darkshore is more dangerous than that of Teldrassil, many fishers find profit here.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8102, 'It is my honor to provide for adventurers, for they are heroes in the making.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8103, 'I''m sorry but I can not let you ride my gryphons. You should go talk to Gringer if you need a ride somewhere.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8104, 'Fastest gryphons this side of Aerie Peak. Want to take a ride?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8105, 'Sure! Let''s go for a ride.', 'Sure! Let''s go for a ride.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8106, 'On the northern dock, you can board a ship that will carry you to Rut''theran Village and Darnassus.  From the southern dock, you can find passage across the Great Sea to Menethil Harbor on Khaz Modan.  Safe journeys to you!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8107, 'On guard, friend. The lady dragon will not give in without a fight.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8108, 'This dock here?  Well you can catch the ship that goes to that Night Elf place.  What''s it''s name?  Uhh Auberdine I think.  I don''t really know for sure, I just load and unload stuff.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8109, 'As was fated a lifetime ago in Karazhan, monster - I come - and with me I bring justice.', '', 1, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8110, 'Are you here to help with the delivery? Miran''s just about ready.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8111, 'My wind riders are trained to fly quickly through the hot Barrens air.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8112, 'The Barrens, with its hot sun and hostile denizens, is the perfect place to test your strength and fortitude.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8113, 'Delivering these barrels to the excavation site is hard work, but there are so many depending on us to get the blast powder there.$B$BWe must do what we can against the Dark Irons!', '', 0, 0, 7, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8114, 'Greetings.  If you are here for leather goods, then you will find my wares well crafted.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8115, 'Thanks for your help, $n. Because of you, another shipment arrived safely at the excavation.', '', 0, 0, 7, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8116, 'When mounted on the back of a wind rider, one sees that its reputation for strength and speed is well earned.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8117, 'You''re better at this gig than I am! You want someone with even more experience than I''ve got. That''d be Doctor Herbert Halsey, an undead who works in the Apothecarium of the Undercity.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8118, 'What is this? You trying to ruin my reputation? I don''t teach novices, $gbuddy:lady;. Go talk to Milla Fairancora in the Craftsmen''s Terrace of Darnassus.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8119, '', 'Seize him! Seize the worthless criminal and his allies!', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8120, 'Have a look at my meats, friend.  You won''t want to go out into the Barrens without a good stock of provisions.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8121, 'Reginald, you know that I cannot let you pass.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8122, 'You haven''t lived until you''ve looked down on the world from the back of a wind rider.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8123, 'You must do what you think is right, Marcus. We served together under Turalyon. He made us both the men that we are today. Did he err with me? Do you truly believe my intent is to cause harm to our alliance? Would I shame our heroes?', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8124, '%s appears lost in contemplation.', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8125, 'I am ashamed, old friend. I know not what I do anymore. It is not you that would dare bring shame to the heroes of legend - it is I. It is I and the rest of these corrupt politicians. They fill our lives with empty promises, unending lies.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8126, 'Dear friend, you honor them with your vigilant watch. You are steadfast in your allegiance. I do not doubt for a moment that you would not give as great a sacrifice for your people as any of the heroes you stand under.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8127, 'Stand down! Can you not see that heroes walk among us?', '', 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8128, 'Move aside! Let them pass!', '', 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8129, 'Reginald Windsor is not to be harmed! He shall pass through untouched!', '', 1, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8130, 'Go, Reginald. May the light guide your hand.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8131, 'You can find passage to Theramore from this dock.  Heed my words, those lands are rarely safe to travel for people of the Alliance.  Watch your step and your back.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8132, 'We shame our ancestors. We shame those lost to us... forgive me, Reginald.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

', 'What can you tell me about the bear - Ursangous?', 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8230, 'What can you tell me about the nightsaber cat - Shadumbra?
', 'What can you tell me about the nightsaber cat - Shadumbra?', 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8231, 'What can you tell me about the hippogryph - Sharptalon?
', 'What can you tell me about the hippogryph - Sharptalon?', 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8232, '', 'This bear wanders a path close to where the Talondeep Path lies, due west of Mystral Lake and the Alliance outpost of Silverwind Refuge.  While he is the easiest of the three creatures you will face on the Ashenvale Hunt, he should not be trifled with.  His presence is a constant threat to travelers who sojourn between Ashenvale and the Stonetalon Mountains.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

', 'With all due respect, Warchief - why not allow them to be destroyed? Does this not strengthen our position?
', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8315, '<Thrall laughs.>$B$BSo much to learn still, $r.$B$BYou are too young to remember the wars and bloodshed of ages past. Too young to remember the burden of the curse carried by our people.$B$BOur position with the Alliance right now is a tenuous one. Skirmishes and smaller battles do take place, but there is peace - something our people have not known for millennia. Would you give this up and plunge us into the maw of chaos again but against a new foe? One that will not rest until we are all destroyed?', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 6, 0, 0, 0),
(8316, 'I... I did not think of it that way, Warchief.', 'I... I did not think of it that way, Warchief.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8317, 'No, $n, you did not. I do not fault you, however, as yours is a mind much like mine was as a youth: Impetuous, rebellious, and often without a single coherent thought! Traits I can no longer afford to express.$B$BEnough lamenting. $R, I have a task for you; one that you may not survive. ', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0),
(8318, 'I live only to serve, Warchief! My life is empty and meaningless without your guidance.', 'I live only to serve, Warchief! My life is empty and meaningless without your guidance.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8319, '<Thrall laughs.>$B$BNoted... Now pay attention, $n. The Black Dragonflight brood mother, Onyxia, has been flushed out from her position of power in Stormwind. She has escaped, fleeing to her lair in Dustwallow Marsh.$B$BShe cannot be allowed to live in such close proximity to our capital cities. We must strike before being struck!$B$BI want her destroyed, $n. ', '', 0, 0, 0, 11, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0),
(8320, 'Of course, Warchief!', 'Of course, Warchief!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8321, '%s collapses upon seeing his master die!', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8322, 'Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.$B$BWe are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, as Malfurion lies in the Dreaming.  Never forget this.', '', 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8323, 'Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.$B$BWe are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, as Malfurion lies in the Dreaming.  Never forget this.', '', 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8324, 'Myranda, do you have enough eyeballs to make another amulet? I have lost the old one.', 'Myranda, do you have enough eyeballs to make another amulet? I have lost the old one.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8325, 'I see some interesting characters come and go here at the port. Watch yourself, $n. It''s never clear who to trust, what with all of the shady activity that goes on here...', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8326, 'So you''re here for the Warsong axes. Well, it''s about time, $n. That crate has been sitting out there for days, now.$B$BFeel free to haul it away whenever you are ready.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8327, '', 'Let''s go before they find out I''m free!', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8328, '', 'Look out! We''re under attack!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8329, '', 'Thank you for helping me. I know my way back from here.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8330, 'Stonetalon Mountain has many perilous caves through out this region.  Exploring these caves can hold many adventures for those willing to risk life for glory.$B$B$C, perhaps you seek riches that only following your heart and soul can garnish.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8331, '%s goes into a rage after seeing Misha fall in battle!', '%s goes into a rage after seeing Misha fall in battle!', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
