(8986, 'We can now rebuild!  For the Horde!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8987, '', 'Hail, $n!  It is good you came to see me.  We are prepared to launch a ground assuault through the Field of Strife!  Once Warmaster Garrick gets his orders, he and his reavers will cut a swath through the Alliance!$B$BDo you want to deliver those orders, $n?  Garrick is waiting in the Field of Strife...', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8988, '', 'Why are you here, $n?  Is there lead in your boots?$B$BYou have the assault orders - Warmaster Garrick needs them in the Field of Strife before he can make his assault!  Go!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8989, '', 'It''s good to have veterans like you in Alterac Valley, $n.  Our supplies are too low to launch a ground assault through Alterac Valley... speak with our quartermaster - he''ll tell you how to increase our supply base.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8990, '', 'Hail, $c!  Our supply level is high, and we are ready to launch a ground assault through the Field of Strife.  Perhaps if your renown was greater, I would trust you to deliver the assault orders.$B$BSo get out there and fight the Alliance!  Show me you''re a trusted and capable member of the Horde!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8991, '', 'You!  $n!  What are you doing wandering around the village like this?  There are Alliance foes in Alterac!  We must drive them out!$B$BOur supplies are too low to launch a large ground assault, so speak with our quatermaster.  He''ll tell you how you can increase our supply base.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8993, '', 'Even the bravest warrior must be well supplied if he is to face his foes with strength!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8994, 'I just gave kill credit to $n.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8995, 'Click here to remove res effects and repair all gear', 'Click here to remove res effects and repair all gear', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8996, 'Hi! Clear your res effects here!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8997, 'Click here to repair your gear', 'Click here to repair your gear', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8998, 'We have enough supplies to launch a ground assault.  If you want to send the order, and you think you qualify, then speak Sergeant Yazra Bloodsnarl.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8999, 'We have enough supplies to launch a ground assault.  If you want to deliver those orders, and you think you qualify, then speak with Corporal Noreg Stormpike.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(9000, 'I am in charge of recruitment for the Frostwolf Clan. As a soldier of Frostwolf, it is your responsibility to check in with me as your rank among the clan rises.$B$BHonor and respect are earned on this frigid field.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0),
