(9002, 'Hail, $r! I am Lieutenant Haggerdin, officer in charge of recruitment for the Stormpike Guard.$B$BAs you gain prestige and notoriety among the Stormpike, return to me and I shall see about upgrading your insignia. Also, should you ever lose your insignia, I am able to supply a replacement.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 113, 0, 0, 0),
(9003, 'Lieutenant, I have lost my insignia. Could you please supply me with a replacement?', 'Lieutenant, I have lost my insignia. Could you please supply me with a replacement?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
