(9453, 'So... you wouldn''t happen to have a chest around here that has, let''s say, a gauntlet that the Gordok ogres consider to be a priceless artifact?', 'So... you wouldn''t happen to have a chest around here that has, let''s say, a gauntlet that the Gordok ogres consider to be a priceless artifact?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(9454, 'Even if I did, fool, do you think I''d just let you take it from me?  The only way you''d ever get it - if I did possess it - is to pry it from my cold, dead fingers.$B$BThat, my little friend, will not be happening any time soon.', '', 0, 0, 0, 6, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0),
