(9609, 'So, you have found me. I suppose that you have come to learn of suppression and control.$B$BI will teach you much more than that... you will also learn of sacrifice.$B$B<Daio grins.>', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0),
