(9721, '', 'I know you will, $n.$B$BI myself am a priestess, though, unlike you I am long since gone from this world. My spirit, however, remains here, as do the spirits of the thousands who were brutally slain by the mad Prince, Arthas Menethil and his legion of undeath.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0),
