(9995, 'The theory behind it is that we completely destroy you with a massive explosion wherever you are and send those particles through a dimensional rip and then re-implode you at the machine here.   Instant Transport!    It might not work ALL the time, but what kind of goblin engineer are you!   If survival was your first priority you could never be a real Goblin Engineer!
Here is the recipe you will need to make the Dimensional Ripper and try it out!

', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
