(10564, '$C, we have a great need for your help in Warsong Gulch against the Silverwing Sentinels.  And there is even greater honor and reputation with the Warsong Outriders to be gained as well!  Do you have the courage to enter battle?', '$C, we have a great need for your help in Warsong Gulch against the Silverwing Sentinels.  And there is even greater honor and reputation with the Warsong Outriders to be gained as well!  Do you have the courage to enter battle?', 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0),
