', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(10597, 'Paragons of Power are powerful mojo.  They are Gurubashi Empire mojo.  We Zandalar must get mojo.  The tribe will take mojo for our own.  The Blood God will not destroy us.$B$BThere are three kinds of Paragons in Zul''Gurub.  Seek coins.  Seek bijous.  Seek primal items.  These are the Paragons.$B$BGo to Zul''Gurub now.  Kill.  Take the Paragons of Power.  Bring them to the tribe.  Earn our respect.  Earn our battle gear.  Earn real power.', '', 0, 0, 0, 15, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0),
