(10611, 'Behind me is the Altar of Zanza, a sacred place for us Zandalar.  We pray here to bolster our resolve in preparation for war against the Blood God, Hakkar.$B$BProve yourself to the tribe by using the altar to destroy any of the Hakkari Bijous you might find inside Zul''Gurub.  Also, I will trade you Honor Tokens our tribe uses for sets of coins you may find in Zul''Gurub.  Bring me the coins that I seek, and you will be rewarded!', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0),
