(10616, 'We, the Zandalarian trolls, traveled here from distant islands, for we cannot ignore the threat that now faces our world.$B$BThe leader of our expedition, Molthor, brought us to the Yojamba Isle, along the northern coasts of Stranglethorn, and even now recruits brave heroes to venture into the ancient troll city... Zul''Gurub.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
