(10620, 'I can get back to the Stronghold on my own, I think.  Now that you bought me some time, I should be able to stealth out of here.  Who ever you are... thank you.  May Elune bless you always!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
