(10622, 'You can''t teach an old dog new tricks.  At least that''s what someone once told me.  Lucky for you, I''ve discovered it to be untrue.$b$bHowever, pets do tend to get resistant to the technique, and I need more food each time to keep them happy.  What that means is that you''ll owe me more money the more times I untrain the same pet.$b$bNow then, would you like me to start untraining?', 'You can''t teach an old dog new tricks.  At least that''s what someone once told me.  Lucky for you, I''ve discovered it to be untrue.$b$bHowever, pets do tend to get resistant to the technique, and I need more food each time to keep them happy.  What that means is that you''ll owe me more money the more times I untrain the same pet.$b$bNow then, would you like me to start untraining?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
