(10657, 'Bronzebeard''s gone missing again! That dwarf sure didn''t get any of his brother''s good senses.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(10658, 'A terrible and costly mistake you have made. It is not my time, mortals.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(10659, 'The ashes from the burning wickerman radiate magical power.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(10660, 'Smear the ash on my face like war paint!', 'Smear the ash on my face like war paint!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(10661, 'The ashes from the burning wickerman radiate magical power.  You have already applied the ashes to your face.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(10662, '', 'Children of the Night, heed your Queen''s call!', 1, 0, 1, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(10663, '', 'I join you in celebration of this most revered of nights - the night we Forsaken broke the Scourge''s yoke of oppression!', 1, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(10664, '', 'It is this night that our enemies fear us the most.  It is THIS night that we show our enemies what it means to stand against the Forsaken!', 1, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(10665, '', 'Now is the time to shake the world to its foundations!  NOW is the time to remind those who would enslave us that we shall never yield!', 1, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(10666, '', 'We burn the effigy of the Wickerman as a symbol of our struggle against those who would oppose us.  We wear the ashes of the burnt Wickerman as a symbol of our neverending fight against those who would enslave us.', 1, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(10667, '', 'NOW is the time of the Forsaken!  Power to the Forsaken - NOW AND FOREVER!!!', 1, 0, 1, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(10668, 'Happy Hallow''s End, $c!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(10669, 'You like candy?  I like candy.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(10670, 'Go Forsaken!  Yay us!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(10671, '', 'Welcome to the Wickerman Festival, $c!$B$BOn the observance of Hallow''s End, the Forsaken burn a wickerman in honor of this, the most revered of occasions.  It was on this day that the Banshee Queen herself delivered us from the clutches of the Lich King and the Scourge.  We have remained free ever since.  Those who would have seen us fall are repayed in full... with vengeance!$B$BThe burning of the Wickerman begins at 8:00 PM!', 0, 0, 0, 4, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(10672, 'Wha... where am I?  So... weak..', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(10673, 'You there!  You look able bodied... we need your aid in defending Southshore!$B$BThe blasted Forsaken are all riled up because it''s Hallow''s End.  Their "celebration" will no doubt be leading them right to our doorstep.  If you''ve got the time, we really could use your help!', '', 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0),
(10674, 'So... cold...', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(10675, 'Yes!  I''m cured!  I''m cure... whoa, got up too fast!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(10676, 'Thanks for finding my reagents!  *yawn*  That poison''s made me... a bit tired...', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(10677, '%s goes into a frenzy!', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(10678, '%s roars, high atop Blackrock Spire...', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
