(11654, 'I last saw Elder Meadowrun at the Weeping Cave in the Western Plaguelands.', 'I last saw Elder Meadowrun at the Weeping Cave in the Western Plaguelands.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
