(222, '', 'Wow, all of this for a love potion. Hope he''s worth it.', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(223, '', 'If we use the Surian theory, then yes, but not if we go with the Y''serian approach.', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(224, '', 'At least we wouldn''t be around to have to clean it up.', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(225, '', 'Only if we didn''t follow the proper initialization procedures.', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(226, 'I suppose you''re right.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(227, '', 'Here''s my list, Keldric. The usual stuff.', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(228, '', 'Thank you, Keldric. See you later.', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(229, 'Curse you, $n!  One day, vengeance will be mine!', '', 0, 0, 7, 14, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(230, 'Alright, we''ve just gotten word that a caravan is leaving from Thelsamar. It''s time to move! Go go go!', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(231, 'Alright, we''re getting close to the excavation site, so we have to proceed carefully. Engage underwater breathing apparatus...', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(232, 'Hey Stone, did you hear about the new steam engine old Tonkrend has been runnin on?', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(233, 'Ah yes. I''ve heard all about those new flarged things. Armor was removed from the casing to decrease weight. Bargh! Nonsense!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(234, 'Do you ever think about anything other than fighting? I could circle you down on the stretch course!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(235, 'Bah! By the time you got in range of old Trollplow you would be in reduced to rubble!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(236, 'Argh! You''re hopeless!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(237, 'Hey Fizzer, I ever tell you the time I was riding through the canals and some goblins in shredder suits tried to ambush me?', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(238, 'Ah, let me see. Yes probably nearing a hundred times now I''d wager!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(239, 'Brahaha! Tha look on their faces as old Trollplow''s gun came swiveling around to meet them! Their saws couldn''t even touch me!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(240, 'I would have just dropped some Evershine in my tank and been back home before they realized I''d gone!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(241, 'Bah! That''s no fun!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(242, 'Hey Stone, let''s hit the circuit some time. We could run a few laps and see who wins?', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(244, 'Aye sure, just as long as we get to hit the arena right after!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(245, 'Nothing you can say will ever get me in the arena against that monstrosity of a machine you call a steam tank!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(246, 'Har! You scared I''ll hurt your little dainty racer?', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(247, 'Ha! I''m more afraid that those old holes and gashes would burst that thing and I would be showered by the shrapnel!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(248, 'Haha! Sturdy old Trollplow has just a few meager battle scars!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(249, 'Nothing beats the sound of a twin-carb, fork-ring steam engine burning pure firestone!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(250, 'Ha! I''d take the sound of a Crater Cannon XT blasting off a shell over that any day!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(251, 'Bah! You wouldn''t know a great steam engine if it smacked you upside the head!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(252, 'Maybe, but if it did hit me upside the head I''d know exactly which cannon to use to blow it into the smallest bits!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(253, '', 'Corbett, dear.  Harlan needs a load of knitted shirts and pants as soon as we can manage.', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(254, '', 'Corbett, you there?  Harlan needs another load of knitted goods.  Can you take it to him?', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(255, 'My pleasure, sugar drop.  I''ll be back soon...', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(256, 'Business must be good down at the bazaar.  I''ll get him resupplied right away!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(257, 'Hm...after dropping this off, I think I''ll head to that cheese shop for a snack.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(258, 'I should have a few extra coins from this sale.  Maybe I''ll buy myself some lunch...', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(259, 'Hey, Harlan.  Here''s a load of knitted cloth for you.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(260, 'Oomph!  Here''s another load of supplies, Harlan.  It must be selling fast!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(261, 'Ah, much appreciated, Corbett.  We''ll get these on the racks immediately.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(262, 'Ah yes, and promptly delivered.  As always, it''s a pleasure doing business with you, Corbett.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(263, 'Well, I''m off then.  Take care, Harlan.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(264, 'Glad to see you''re doing so well, Harlan.  And I hope to see you again soon...', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(265, 'Lord Mayor!  Our scouts report strange activity to the west.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(266, 'Mayor Ello!  Our graveyard scouts return with ominous reports...', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(267, 'Hideous bellows and growls are heard coming from that old hermit''s shack!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
