(320, 'I''d go out and clear out some of those gnolls, but this leg has seen better days and I am afraid I''d just wind up dead.', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(321, 'Watch your step out there.  Many an adventure seeker has not returned from the marsh.  hic!', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(322, 'It''s time for my meditation, leave me.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(323, 'There you are. What news from Westfall?', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(324, 'VanCleef sends word that the plans are underway. But he''s heard rumors about someone snooping about.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(325, 'Very well. I will return then.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO "world"."broadcast_text" ("entry", "male_text", "female_text", "chat_type", "sound_id", "language_id", "emote_id1", "emote_id2", "emote_id3", "emote_delay1", "emote_delay2", "emote_delay3") VALUES
(326, 'Hmm, it could be that meddler Shaw. I will see what I can discover. Be off with you. I''ll contact you again soon.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(327, '*sigh* It''s about time to check on the cemetery again-- I''ll be back in a few minutes.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(328, 'We really should fix this fence soon.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(329, 'Vrok said the sights are off on Grumlar''s gun. I suppose I should check it.', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(330, 'Hmph! I didn''t even hit the blasted target! That thick skulled dwarf was probably using the gun as a mace again.', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(331, 'Hmmmm... That one clipped it''s shoulder. Grumlar was right, the sights are slightly off. Easy enough for me to fix though.', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(332, 'Almost perfect shot! It''s a bit off but I can see where Grumlar would miss with it. He couldn''t hit the broad side of a barn.', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(333, 'Bullseye! That blasted dwarf doesn''t know what he is talking about. Only thing wrong with Grumlar''s gun is Grumlar''s aim.', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(339, 'Only $3658E shopping minutes before Christmas!  But wait, is it Christmas?  Well then, there are only $3659E minutes left to party!  TEST TEST DO NOT LOCALIZE', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(340, 'Warg, are you about ready to eat? I am gonna get it started.', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(341, '', 'Khara hums an old dwarven tune while she cooks.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(342, 'Hon, food is ready. Come wash up and eat.', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(343, 'Mmmm, that was good. However, time to get back to work!', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(344, 'Ahhh, just in time! My stomach was rumblin'' loud.', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(345, 'MMmmMMmmm. Smells delicious Khara.', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(346, 'Burp! Hon, that was really good. Not only do you know how to catch a fish but you sure do know how to cook one.', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(347, 'Whew! I think I ate too much. Need to loosen my belt a few notches.', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(348, 'Thanks for the great meal darlin'' but I need to get back out front.', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(349, 'Another glorious day of fishin'' is ahead of me, Khara. I best get movin''.', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(350, 'What a day for fishin''. They are sure to be bitin'' today!', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(352, 'Warg looks over the water appraising what his luck might be today.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(353, 'Welp the fish ain''t bitin'' no more so I might as start gutting and cleaning what I did catch today.', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(355, 'Best be on my way. Khara will be expecting me soon. See ya tomorrow X.', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(356, 'Look at all those ripples. Lots of activity in the water so I should catch a mess of fish today.', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(357, 'Hmmmm, only a little bit of activity on the surface but the sun is in the right place. Might turn out to be a fine day.', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(358, 'Not looking too good today. Sun is high and bright early and no activity on the water.', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(359, 'Hmph! What a sorry day for fishin'' this is going to be. Ah well, a bad day fishin'' is better then a good day workin''.', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(360, 'Berte! Evalyn! It''s getting dark. Come inside.', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(361, 'You can play more tomorrow. Now come on inside.', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(362, 'Alright, alright. You two can go play just stay in town. No sneaking off to bug Warg and Khara down by the water.', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(363, 'Hah! Daryl, you should have seen the look on your face! You half jumped out of your skin!', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(365, 'They have you good on that one, lad!', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(366, 'Oh, shut up.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(367, 'Awww Mom! It''s hardly dark yet! Can we play for a bit longer please?', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(368, 'Ok...', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(370, 'We must be vigilant to eradicate this plague!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(371, 'Keep up the good work.  This scourge will be cleansed!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(372, 'The Scarlet Crusade will scour these lands!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(373, 'Let none with the foul taint of plague live!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(374, 'Mom! Can we go play please please please? Can we huh? Can we?', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(375, 'The kids jump up and down with youthful energy. (PH emote)', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(376, 'Wheeee! Thanks Mom!', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(378, 'Thanks Mrs. Brightbeard!', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(379, 'Gettin'' a bit nippy out here. Think I will go warm myself by the fire and grab a pint or twelve.', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(380, 'Nothing like a roaring fire on a cool night with good friends and dwarven ale.', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(381, 'Brock. Torren. I am going inside for an ale and to warm myself by the fire.', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(382, 'Mmmmm, an ale by the fire does sound good. Sure, I will join ya Jern.', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(383, 'Here! Here! I''ll drink to that!', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(384, 'What? Did someone say ale? Don''t start pouring the pints without ol'' Torren!', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(385, 'I''ll drink to anything!', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(386, 'Noma should have dinner ready soon. Might as well head in.', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(387, 'My, that Black Claw stout packs quite a punch!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(388, 'I feel... dizzy.  It''s so hot... in... here...', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(389, 'Where''s the rest of the guys?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(390, 'Every bodies coming...', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(391, 'He really couldn''t help it...', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(393, 'No one lives forever...', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(394, '', 'Gimlok!  Gimlok! Get in here this instant!', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(395, '', 'Where has the boy gotten to now?', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(396, '', 'Gimlok, don''t you go and get your clothes all dirty.', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(397, 'Huuup...Huuup...Bleeeeehh!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(398, 'I''ll be a guard someday!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(399, 'Remember when Danath gathered all the mercenaries of Stormwind together and we marched to fight at Nethergarde?', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(400, 'I tell ye, I don''t miss the Great War at all. I remember when we fought at Darrowmere. All night in the fog, lying in a muddy trench.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(401, 'I miss the dwarven ale we used to get at that inn in Lordaeron. Remember that fight we started there?', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(402, 'Less than a hundred of us, and over a thousand orcs. Only a handful of us managed to walk away from that one.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(403, 'The best had to have been the look on Perenolde''s face when our army comes marchin'' right up to his front door. What a battle!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(405, 'Battling that band of Twilight Hammer in the Morass, I could think of better places for a war.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(406, 'Ahh yes, now I remember, your wedding night wasn''t it?', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(407, 'Ahh the Glustewelt twins!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(408, 'I still have the scars from that night.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(409, 'Broke both me legs that night. How could I forget?', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(410, 'I woke up in a bed in Northshire three weeks later. Don''t remember a damn thing.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(411, 'Wasn''t that the night we had to pick up my thumb and carry it in your smoke pouch?', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(413, 'I have a piece of iron in my back that will remind me of that night for the rest of my days.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(414, 'Course I remember that night. Two inches to the left and you''d be drinking with that elf, Morris. That was my best shirt, too.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(415, 'Was that the third or fourth time you nearly got me gutted trying one of your crazy stunts?', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(416, 'Aye and thanks for letting me carry my own hand back to the priests that night.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(417, 'Hehe, wimp.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(418, 'You screamed like a little girl, funniest thing I ever saw.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(419, 'It all worked out in the end.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(420, 'Let''s not even begin comparing battle scars, my friend.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(421, 'Never seen anyone move so fast in my whole life.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(422, 'You are constantly surprising me with what a person can live through.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(423, 'Well, you''re still here. I''d say that is something worth drinking to.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(424, 'You can thank me anytime for making your life more interesting.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(425, 'I. . .I. . .don''t. . .feel. . .right. . .', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(426, '%s waves to $n', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(427, 'You have disturbed my rest, $c.  Now face my wrath!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(428, 'My mind. . .my flesh. . .I''m. . .rotting. . . .!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(429, 'Let me have another one, Langston.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(430, 'Best ale in Stormwind, Langston. Thanks.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(431, 'Hey Reese, give me an'' Christoph another round.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(432, 'A warm tavern and a cold ale. What more could we ask for?', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(433, '%s raises the gun to his shoulder, aims it carefully then fires a shot at the target.', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(434, 'Die in the name of Ragnaros!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(435, 'The Thandol Span fell to Ragnaros.  So shall the Stonewrought Dam!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(436, 'King Magni Bronzebeard is a fool and a charlatan!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
