(525, 'The Dark Lady''s followers are blind to think they can stand against our might.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(526, 'We grow strong, while our foes are surrounded by foes, and weakened by constant attacks.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(527, 'Our Lord commands us to make ready for war!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(528, 'Prepare yourselves, for we will soon launch an assault against they who called themselves "The Forsaken."', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(529, 'Make ready for battle, my creations.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(530, 'We are the arm of His will.  And we will crush His foes into grave dust!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(531, 'These undead rabble, and their dead-elf queen, will fall!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(532, 'We will drive our foes from Silverpine, then bring the tides of war to their very capital!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(533, 'Death and Praise for the Lich King!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(534, '', 'It''s good to see you again, Erland.  What is your report?', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(535, 'Masses of wolves are to the east, and whoever lived at Malden''s Orchard is gone.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(536, 'If I am excused, then I''d like to check on Quinn...', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(537, 'Hello, Quinn.  How are you faring?', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(538, 'Try to take better care of yourself, Quinn.  You were lucky this time.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(539, 'I''ve been better.  Ivar the Foul got the better of me...', '', 0, 0, 33, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(540, 'No two-bit traitor will stop the powder from getting to Ironband!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(541, 'Beware!  A $n is upon us!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(542, '', 'Be ready, $n. I hear the council returning. Prepare to ambush!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
