(574, 'Here to visit the family?  Die, fool!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(575, 'The Agamand Mills is held by the Scourge, $C.  Join us!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(576, 'I raise my brew and hope to be rid of the likes of you!  Cheers, you no good scoundrel, $n!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(577, '%s cheers!', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(578, '', 'Stay back vile creatures!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(579, 'Croak!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(580, '%s sniffs the elixir then eagerly digs in!', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(581, 'Finally they show mercy!  They''ve given us something to drink!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(582, 'And Shindigger Stout too!  Thank the Light!  I was parched!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(583, 'Your undeath is not the end of your life, but the beginning. It is up to you to decide where your fate lies now.', '', 0, 0, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(584, 'You are free of His control. And while you will be judged by lesser beings, at least you have chances that the Scourge do not!', '', 0, 0, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(585, 'Terror, darkness, power? The Forsaken crave not these things; the Forsaken ARE these things.', '', 0, 0, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(586, 'My bones are weak, my eyes see only darkness, and my body feels only pain; but these things are good because my will is my own.', '', 0, 0, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(587, '', 'Hello, Charys. I have my list, could you get me all of that, especially the last ingredient.', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(588, '', 'Mommy? Can I pet Fizzles?', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(589, '', 'Sure, Paige. Just be gentle.', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(590, '', 'Thanks, Charys. C''mon Paige, sweetie.', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(591, '%s starts to chant in an ancient tongue, summoning forth something evil in nature.', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(592, 'Ah, it is good to be free of my bonds! Have you freed Tog''thar yet? The humans split us up after our capture.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
