(662, 'I love mornings! It''s a great day, isn''t it? Smell that air?', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(664, 'By the Light, I''m hungry today. Did you all see Darcy today? She looked great.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(665, 'You know, this bridge is kind of large for just the 6 of us to be building. You''d think more people would''ve been hired.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(666, 'You guys see her? I didn''t see Darcy. I wonder where she is tonight.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(667, '%s looks up and down the docks.', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(669, 'Oh well, I''m sure she''ll be around later.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(670, 'Night, all. I''m gonna sit up for a bit. Maybe Darcy''ll come by.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(671, 'Huh?! Darn it, it''s lunch time! I overslept!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
