(687, 'Adventurers from all over sell things to Antonio-- come look for yourselves what little treasures he has for you this week.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(688, 'Travelers and adventurers make haste to the town circle and take advantage of Antonio''s wonderful prices! Come one, come all!', '', 0, 0, 7, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(689, 'Well met, travelers of Duskwood! My incredible wares are on sale for a short time in Darkshire. Make haste!', '', 0, 0, 7, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(690, 'Leave your battles or errands, and browse my incredible wares! Only in Darkshire for a short time... praise the Light for that.', '', 0, 0, 7, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(691, 'Farewell, citizens of Darkshire. Until next time...', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(692, 'Finally, Redridge. A pleasant change from the dark, cold fog of Duskwood.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(693, 'Ha ha! I have Betsy!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(694, '', 'Gimme my dolly!!', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
