(3360, 'I do not like these human cities of stone and steel. I would prefer the forests of Ashenvale, tracking great beasts. But my dear brother, Kaerbrus, felt it would be beneficial to train the humans in our ways. So while I honor him and offer my services, I do not have to like it.', 'I do not like these human cities of stone and steel. I would prefer the forests of Ashenvale, tracking great beasts. But my dear brother, Kaerbrus, felt it would be beneficial to train the humans in our ways. So while I honor him and offer my services, I do not have to like it.', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(3361, 'I came from Ironforge to help out with the rebuilding effort here. If I can teach enough of ye my skills then maybe I can leave it to ye and take myself back home.', 'I came from Ironforge to help out with the rebuilding effort here. If I can teach enough of ye my skills then maybe I can leave it to ye and take myself back home.', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(3362, 'Yeah? Ye interrupted me, so ye better have a blasted good reason to do so.', 'Yeah? Ye interrupted me, so ye better have a blasted good reason to do so.', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(3363, 'Many would tell you that the Tallstrider is a laughable pet. But it''s intelligence and loyalty make it a hard creature to match in many situations. If you are interested in the breed, then perhaps I can introduce you and your pet to a few talents I have learned over the years.', 'Many would tell you that the Tallstrider is a laughable pet. But it''s intelligence and loyalty make it a hard creature to match in many situations. If you are interested in the breed, then perhaps I can introduce you and your pet to a few talents I have learned over the years.', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
