(4891, 'A class trainer', 'A class trainer', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4892, 'Your bondage is at an end, Doom''rel.  I challenge you!', 'Your bondage is at an end, Doom''rel.  I challenge you!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4893, 'The inn', 'The inn', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4894, 'You have challenged the Seven, and now you will die!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4895, 'The mailbox', 'The mailbox', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4896, 'A profession trainer', 'A profession trainer', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4897, 'Gloom''rel, tell me your secrets!', 'Gloom''rel, tell me your secrets!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4898, 'You wish to learn the old craft?  You wish to smelt dark iron?$B$BAppease me, $r.  Show me a sacrifice and I will consider it!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4899, 'Your will is strong, and your intent is clear.$B$BPerhaps you are worthy...', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4900, 'I have payed your price, Gloom''rel.  Now, teach me your secrets!', 'I have payed your price, Gloom''rel.  Now, teach me your secrets!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4901, 'You have shown me your desire, and have payed with precious stone.  I will teach you...', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4902, 'Intruders! Attack the intruders!', 'Intruders! Attack the intruders!', 0, 0, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4903, 'I know the way, insect. There is no need to prod me as if I were cattle.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4904, 'Surely you do not think that you will get away with this incursion. They will come for me and you shall pay for your insolence.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4905, 'RUN THEM THROUGH BROTHERS!', '', 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4906, 'I doubt you will be so lucky the next time you encounter my bretheren.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4907, 'They come for you, fool!', '', 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4908, 'What do you think you accomplish from this, fool? Even now, the Blackrock armies make preparations to destroy your world.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4909, 'On darkest wing they fly. Prepare to meet your end!', '', 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4910, 'You will not defile our sacred land!', 'You will not defile our sacred land!', 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4911, 'The worst is yet to come, $r.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4912, '%s laughs.', '', 2, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4913, 'Time to make your final stand, insect.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4914, 'The Kolkar will rule!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4915, 'Your Horde is nothing to the Kolkar!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4916, 'Shake in fear, dogs!  I am here!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4917, 'The Kolkar are the strongest!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4918, '%s submits.', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4919, 'You two-legs are nothing!  My children could beat you!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4920, 'I am here!  Your rule of this land is over!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4921, 'For the Horde!', 'For the Horde!', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4922, 'Defend the bunkers!', 'Defend the bunkers!', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4923, 'The invaders are here!', 'The invaders are here!', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4924, 'Beware!  The Kolkar attack!', 'Beware!  The Kolkar attack!', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4925, 'Our foes will fall!', 'Our foes will fall!', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4926, 'Beware, $n!  Look to the west!', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4927, 'You have come to play? Then let us play!', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4928, 'Kneel, Grark.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4929, 'Grark Lorkrub, you have been charged and found guilty of treason against the Horde. How you plead is unimportant. High Executioner Nuzrak, step forward.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4930, '%s raises his massive axe over Grark.', '', 2, 0, 0, 27, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4931, 'End him...', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4932, '%s raises his hand and then lowers it.', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4933, 'You, soldier, report back to Kargath at once!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4934, 'Get away from those kegs!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4935, 'I... I''m not really sure how I got here...$B$BI seem to remember traveling... a raft...$B$B', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4936, 'You''ll pay for that!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4937, 'Pay me and I''ll talk...$B$BOh hey, it''s you, $n! Nevermind about that...', '', 0, 0, 0, 25, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4938, 'Does my name sound familiar to you? Maybe we knew each other a long time ago...$B$BI think I''m named after someone important...', '', 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4939, 'Hi there! I''m glad you came back, $n. Tell me, have you completed the first quest I gave you? If you have, I might have a second quest for you...', '', 0, 0, 0, 3, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0),
(4940, 'When I was wandering the crater after I crashed here, I remembered something that I once was told... "Go up, up the mountain ahead," said the voice in my head.$B$BListening to it is how I ended up here, $n!', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4941, 'A long time ago, during my travels, I met a man that told me, "Master using it and you can have this."$B$BWhat do you suppose that means? I didn''t know then, and I still don''t now, really...', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4942, 'It''s a secret to everybody... including me!$B$BI''m glad you found me -- it''s a good thing I''m not hiding in a bush or underneath a rock, isn''t it?', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 11, 0, 0, 0),
(4943, 'Thanks, $n! You''re the hero of Un''Goro Crater!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4944, 'Ragnaros will reign supreme!', 'Ragnaros will reign supreme!', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4945, 'Have a drink, $c.  It might be your last!', 'Have a drink, $c.  It might be your last!', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4946, 'If it weren''t for the Grim Guzzler, I''d spend my free time pulling the wings off dragon whelps.', 'If it weren''t for the Grim Guzzler, I''d spend my free time pulling the wings off dragon whelps.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4947, 'If it weren''t for the Grim Guzzler, I''d probably spend my free time pulling the wings off dragon whelps.', 'If it weren''t for the Grim Guzzler, I''d probably spend my free time pulling the wings off dragon whelps.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4948, 'The water elementals are at war with the fire elementals, which sort of means they''re at war with us.  One of their leaders, Hydraxis, is mustering agents for his cause...', 'The water elementals are at war with the fire elementals, which sort of means they''re at war with us.  One of their leaders, Hydraxis, is mustering agents for his cause...', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4949, 'Oh man, I thought I was dead for sure.  Ugh... still dizzy...', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4950, 'I heard that a noble among the water elementals, Hydraxis, wages war with the servants of fire.  Let''s hope he loses!', 'I heard that a noble among the water elementals, Hydraxis, wages war with the servants of fire.  Let''s hope he loses!', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4951, 'The Waterlord Hydraxis hides off in Azshara, on an island in the Bay of Storms.  What kind of threat can the fool muster from there?', 'The Waterlord Hydraxis hides off in Azshara, on an island in the Bay of Storms.  What kind of threat can the fool muster from there?', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4952, 'I like the way you think!  Let''s get outta here!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO "world"."broadcast_text" ("entry", "male_text", "female_text", "chat_type", "sound_id", "language_id", "emote_id1", "emote_id2", "emote_id3", "emote_delay1", "emote_delay2", "emote_delay3") VALUES
(4953, 'If Hydraxis recruits more in his war, then it might shift the balance of power...', 'If Hydraxis recruits more in his war, then it might shift the balance of power...', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4954, 'It''s all guns and flames until someone loses and dies.', 'It''s all guns and flames until someone loses and dies.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4955, 'All right, I think I can make it on my own from here.  I don''t know who you are... but I owe you one.  Thank you!', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4956, 'My father told me there''d be days like this, where a stranger would talk to me and I''d have to restrain myself from killing $ghim:her;.', 'My father told me there''d be days like this, where a stranger would talk to me and I''d have to restrain myself from killing $ghim:her;.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4957, 'Welcome to Camp Mojache, brave $c.  How may I assist you this day?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4958, 'Greetings $c -- if you''re looking for leather goods and leatherworking supplies, you''ve come to the right semi-retired Paladin.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4959, 'You look like you might be needing passage across the Great Sea. Well you have come to the right place, this here is the berth of the Maiden''s Fancy, finest passenger ship to travel these waters. When she arrives, just climb aboard and the next thing you know you will find yourself basking on the sandy beaches of Stranglethorn.', 'You look like you might be needing passage across the Great Sea. Well you have come to the right place, this here is the berth of the Maiden''s Fancy, finest passenger ship to travel these waters. When she arrives, just climb aboard and the next thing you know you will find yourself basking on the sandy beaches of Stranglethorn.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4960, 'I must say, Booty Bay has the best Clam Chowder to be had anywhere in the South Seas. Oh, not interested in cuisine eh? Well then let me be the first to welcome you to the berth of the Maiden''s Fancy, the finest passenger ship to travel between the Eastern Kingdoms and Kalimdor. She''s due back for another trip to Ratchet soon, so make yourself comfortable till she arrives.', 'I must say, Booty Bay has the best Clam Chowder to be had anywhere in the South Seas. Oh, not interested in cuisine eh? Well then let me be the first to welcome you to the berth of the Maiden''s Fancy, the finest passenger ship to travel between the Eastern Kingdoms and Kalimdor. She''s due back for another trip to Ratchet soon, so make yourself comfortable till she arrives.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4961, 'Intruders!!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4962, 'What are you doing?  Intruders!!', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4963, 'Of course there''s no danger in everything catching flames and exploding like a huge helium bomb. This baby will get you to Undercity faster and safer than any boat, and the view is truly breathtaking. Speaking of breath, smoking is not allowed while on board the zeppelin, and fire spells are banned from being cast during the trip.', 'Of course there''s no danger in everything catching flames and exploding like a huge helium bomb. This baby will get you to Undercity faster and safer than any boat, and the view is truly breathtaking. Speaking of breath, smoking is not allowed while on board the zeppelin', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4964, 'Hello!  You''re just the person I was looking for.  Take a seat and listen, because I have a plan that will make us both rich!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4965, 'My brother said we could make great money with this trade route, but he didn''t tell me I would be the one living on this side. If you come back this way on the Zeppelin, could you bring me something to eat? They sell some of the finest meat in Orgrimmar, and I sure could use something that didn''t die weeks before it stopped moving.', 'My brother said we could make great money with this trade route, but he didn''t tell me I would be the one living on this side. If you come back this way on the Zeppelin, could you bring me something to eat? They sell some of the finest meat in Orgrimmar, and I sure could use something that didn''t die weeks before it stopped moving.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4966, 'I hope this works!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4967, '%s adds the haze to the Bloodpetal sprouts.', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4968, 'Look at them go!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4969, '%s laughs as he watches the pests run off.', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4970, 'It''s GO TIME! Come get sum! <replace this>', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4971, 'Your family says hello, Ribbly.  And they want your head!', 'Your family says hello, Ribbly.  And they want your head!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4972, 'You''re good for nothing, Ribbly.  It''s time to pay for your wickedness!', 'You''re good for nothing, Ribbly.  It''s time to pay for your wickedness!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4973, 'No!  Get away from me!  Help!!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4974, 'Look for Nogg''s Machine Shop in the Valley of Honor northeast of Red Canyon Mining.', 'Look for Nogg''s Machine Shop in the Valley of Honor northeast of Red Canyon Mining.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4975, 'You''ll find that goblin and his toy shop in the Valley of Honor.', 'You''ll find that goblin and his toy shop in the Valley of Honor.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4976, 'Engineering', 'Engineering', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4977, 'Help me choose wisely.', 'Help me choose wisely.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4978, 'I am a mage of great power, I have spent my days studying the mind and the memory as it pertains to learning and the retention of learned abilities. I would even now be perfecting my studies if not for the great voices that came to me in the night, informing me that my services were required. I will be here for only a short time offering my ability to wipe your talents for free. Soon I will leave again, and you will once more be stuck with whatever choices you make.', 'I am a mage of great power, I have spent my days studying the mind and the memory as it pertains to learning and the retention of learned abilities. I would even now be perfecting my studies if not for the great voices that came to me in the night, informing me that my services were required. I will be here for only a short time offering my ability to wipe your talents for free. Soon I will leave again, and you will once more be stuck with whatever choices you make.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4979, '', 'You got it!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4980, '', 'Coming right up!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4981, '', 'I''ll bring it right over, baby...', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4983, '', 'Yes $gsir:madam;.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4984, 'Hey Nagmara!  How about a mug of Dark Iron Ale?', 'Hey Nagmara!  How about a mug of Dark Iron Ale?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4985, 'Nagmara!  Have any mutton left?', 'Nagmara!  Have any mutton left?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4986, 'Mistress, you tell Plugger that I want more of his ale.  I can''t get enough!', 'Mistress, you tell Plugger that I want more of his ale.  I can''t get enough!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4987, 'Hey Nag, how about you slice me off a piece of that...', 'Hey Nag, how about you slice me off a piece of that...', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4988, 'I''d like to train in cooking.', 'I''d like to train in cooking.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4989, 'Hello, $n. If you''d like to learn a thing or two about cooking, please visit me at any time.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4990, '', '<Lady Prestor glares at you.>', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4991, 'Pardon the intrusion, Lady Prestor, but Highlord Bolvar suggested that I seek your advice.', 'Pardon the intrusion, Lady Prestor, but Highlord Bolvar suggested that I seek your advice.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4992, '', 'I was standing right next to you, imbecile. I know what you seek.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(4993, 'My apologies, Lady Prestor.
INSERT INTO "world"."broadcast_text" ("entry", "male_text", "female_text", "chat_type", "sound_id", "language_id", "emote_id1", "emote_id2", "emote_id3", "emote_delay1", "emote_delay2", "emote_delay3") VALUES
(5055, 'No stealing the goods!', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5056, 'Hey!  Stop that!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5057, 'Phalanx, I think you need to teach thos person a lesson.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5058, 'You are deemed a threat!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5059, 'I will be reborn, mortals! Incendius shall raise me from these ashes!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5060, 'That''s it!  You''re going down!', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5061, 'I cannot be destroyed! By the will of Ragnaros, I shall be reborn!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5062, 'A-Me good. Good, A-Me. Follow... follow A-Me. Home. A-Me go home.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5063, 'Good... good, A-Me. A-Me good. Home. Find home.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5064, 'Aid me! $n draws near!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5065, 'Help me with this $n!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5066, 'Have you tried that Thunderbrew Lager?  It''s good stuff!', 'Have you tried that Thunderbrew Lager?  It''s good stuff!', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5067, 'I have duty in an hour, but until then... bottom''s up!', 'I have duty in an hour, but until then... bottom''s up!', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5068, 'You looking at me, $gladdy:lassy;?', 'You looking at me, $gladdy:lassy;?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5069, 'I''ll take a pint of Dark Iron ale.  Oh, you''re not the $gwaiter:waitress;?', 'I''ll take a pint of Dark Iron ale.  Oh, you''re not the $gwaiter:waitress;?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5070, 'I think Plugger filled one of his kegs too much.  It looks like it''s about to blow!', 'I think Plugger filled one of his kegs too much.  It looks like it''s about to blow!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5071, 'Don''t bother me while I''m partying...', 'Don''t bother me while I''m partying...', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5072, 'Ye be needing directions $glad : lass;?', 'Ye be needing directions $glad : lass;?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5073, 'I love the smell of Ironforge in the morning!  Eh? And what would you be needing $c?', 'I love the smell of Ironforge in the morning!  Eh? And what would you be needing $c?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5074, 'Whatcha need?', 'Whatcha need?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5075, 'IF they say... IF!  There are no if''s about Ironforge!  Eh?  What now?', 'IF they say... IF!  There are no if''s about Ironforge!  Eh?  What now?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5076, 'Can you help me with some directions?', 'Can you help me with some directions?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5077, 'What do ye need directions to?', 'What do ye need directions to?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5078, 'Bank of Ironforge', 'Bank of Ironforge', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5079, 'Do ye have some new treasures that ye want to keep safe n'' sound?  Then ye''ll be wanting to store them at The Vault with the Stonemantles.  
INSERT INTO "world"."broadcast_text" ("entry", "male_text", "female_text", "chat_type", "sound_id", "language_id", "emote_id1", "emote_id2", "emote_id3", "emote_delay1", "emote_delay2", "emote_delay3") VALUES
(5158, '$n, no hurt A-Me. A-Me, good.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5159, 'Danger. Danger! $n try hurt A-Me.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5160, 'A-Me, home. A-Me go home! $n, no stop A-Me.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5161, '', 'Get this, $n off of me!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5162, '', 'Help!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5163, '', 'I need help!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5164, '', '$n attacking! Help!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5166, 'I want more ale!  Give me more ale!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5167, 'That one''s empty!!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5168, 'Ah, empty again!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5169, 'ALE!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5170, '%s looks at you expectantly.', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5171, '', 'You probably weren''t expecting to find me in this cave, were you?$B$BMy name''s J.D., and I really can''t tell you much about how I got here, but what I can tell you is that this cave is my home now!$B$BI spend my time studying the strange crystals that can be found all over the crater.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5172, 'Ah, hits the spot!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5173, 'Sweet Elune, thanks for getting me out of that... thing!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5175, 'Come with me if you want to live.', 'Come with me if you want to live.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5176, 'Burning Steppes - Tablet of the Seven', '', 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5177, 'Transcribe the tablet.', 'Transcribe the tablet.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5178, 'The symbols on the tablet are carefully transcribed...', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5179, 'Greetings, $c. For some, the hunter is a way of life, a chosen profession. For others, it is something of a pastime, a badge of courage, or a rite of passage depending on your tribe.$B$BFor me, race and profession mean nothing--it is the testing of your spirit and mind that I respect. For one to stand against the forces of nature and test all of their skills is the true mark of honor.$B$BIf you wish to test yourself and earn my respect, then speak to me more.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5181, 'You''ve started down an honorable path, $n. My ancestors respect your willingness, but you will not have my approval until you have followed through with my tasks.$B$BYou know what you must do if you wish to prove yourself a hunter in spirit.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5182, 'I give you warm greetin''s, $c, as does the Shattered Hand.$B$BDo not look so surprised, $n. There be shadows even on the highest perches of Orgrimmar--somethin'' must hide there. The Shattered Hand take that role willingly. Thrall, even in his good heart, acknowledge that the Hand be necessary to ensure orc and troll safety.$B$BBut you not here to talk ''bout my business, you here for somethin'' else.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5183, 'Un''Goro Crater be far to the south of Kalimdor. Beyond the Thousand Needles in Tanaris. Look for the large floating stones... they mark the entrance to the Crater. But be careful... it is no easy path. The raptors are not far from the entrance.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5184, 'Where is Un''Goro Crater?', 'Where is Un''Goro Crater?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5185, '', 'Thanks to you, we can now unlock the secrets of the crystals and the mysterious pylons, $n. If you need more information at any time, please come back and visit me again!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5186, 'Tell me more about the Eastern Crystal Pylon.', 'Tell me more about the Eastern Crystal Pylon.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5187, 'Who is this Lar''korwi you spoke of?', 'Who is this Lar''korwi you spoke of?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5188, 'Tell me more about the Northern Crystal Pylon.', 'Tell me more about the Northern Crystal Pylon.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5189, 'The ravasaur here in Un''Goro seem to be related to the raptors of the barrens--highly intelligent, volatile, and with a sense or code of conduct. The greatest of these that I have encountered is  Lar''korwi. He is one of the most dangerous beasts I''ve ever seen. In taurahe, Lar''korwi means "sharp claw," but that does not do him justice.$B$BDo not underestimate Lar''korwi if you ever plan on hunting him, but I will help you in any way I can if you do.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5190, 'Tell me more about the Western Crystal Pylon.', 'Tell me more about the Western Crystal Pylon.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5191, 'I lost my Crystal Pylon User''s Manual and need another one.', 'I lost my Crystal Pylon User''s Manual and need another one.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5192, '', 'The Eastern Pylon accepts blue, yellow, and green crystals.$B$BIt focuses on the energy that can be created using blue crystals as the main source of power. There are two possible effects: one provides bonus to spirit, and one that creates a damaging shield.$B$BCrystal Force requires blue and green crystals. This will provide you with an increase in spirit.$B$BCrystal Spire requires blue and yellow crystals. This will create a shield that does damage to attackers.
INSERT INTO "world"."broadcast_text" ("entry", "male_text", "female_text", "chat_type", "sound_id", "language_id", "emote_id1", "emote_id2", "emote_id3", "emote_delay1", "emote_delay2", "emote_delay3") VALUES
(5263, 'You''ll pay for that!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5264, 'Oh, now I''m pissed!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5265, 'No!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5266, 'Hey, my pockets were picked!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5267, 'That''s it!  No more beer until this mess is sorted out!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5268, 'Ha! Ha! Ha! Thank you for freeing me, fools. Now let me repay you by charring the flesh from your bones.', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5269, '', 'We showed that one!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5270, 'The secrets hidden within the Pylons of Un''Goro Crater are now yours. Visit the Pylons at any time to access their power and gain useful resources.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5271, 'You can''t hide from us.  Prepare to burn!', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5274, 'Welcome to Tanaris, $n. How can I be of service to you today? You don''t look like a blacksmith to me, but I know how looks can be deceiving.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5275, '', 'Uh oh!  I''m out of here!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5281, 'I''m getting out of here!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5283, '%s begins to summon a lava spawn!', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5284, 'I do not enjoy conversation.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5285, '', 'Oh, no! We''ve run out of time. ', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5286, '%s cries out an alarm!', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5287, '', 'Now, let''s see... If I am correct, then... Hmmm...', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5288, '', 'Blue plus red... I predict...', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5289, '', '$n, that''s it! I have finally figured it out!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5290, 'They are lost, $r. Librams written by the elven masters. Scattered across the world when the Scourge was unleashed upon Quel''Thalas.$B$BNow we search for these librams. Search to find the secrets they hold - to restore power once had.$B$BI search for the ten written by Master Kariel Winthalus. Should you find a libram, allow me to absorb its magical properties and for you I shall craft an amalgamation of power... of course, all things come at some cost. You will find my cost to be high; but pay you shall.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0),
(5291, 'I present to you the Libram of Rumination.', 'I present to you the Libram of Rumination.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5292, 'Ah, so... you have found it.$B$B<Mathredis points to the book in your possession.>$B$BHave you collected the necessary components?$B$BThe manifestations listed in the libram, imbecile!', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 5, 0, 0, 0),
(5293, '<Mathredis gazes intently at the libram.>$B$BYou come for an amalgamation? Have you done as the libram instructed?', '', 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0),
(5294, 'Give me the arcana and I shall craft the amalgamation, mortal.', '', 0, 0, 0, 25, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5295, 'A rare find, indeed.$B$B<Mathredis nods.>$B$B If you wish to continue, I will need the components.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5296, 'Greed has led you back to me.$B$B<Mathredis laughs.>$B$BA wise Draenei once told me that it - greed - is the single quality that all of the races on this world share. I would have to agree.$B$BHave you collected the components listed within the libram?', '', 0, 0, 0, 153, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0),
(5297, 'Intruders in the Manufactory? My constructs will destroy you!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5298, 'May the Light protect you this day.', 'May the Light protect you this day.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5299, 'I would like to train further in the ways of the Light.', 'I would like to train further in the ways of the Light.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5300, 'Violence!  Property damage!  None shall pass!!', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5301, 'You must leave the bar!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5302, 'You have outworn your welcome!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5303, 'NO SERVICE!!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5304, 'What want from Raze??', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5305, '', 'Hello, $n. Should you require assistance in completing your mission, you have only to ask. My guardian, Raze, can assist you in defeating the shadowsilk poachers. Use this Staff of Command to command Raze in battle. He is trained to ONLY attack shadowsilk poachers.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5306, 'I need help in defeating the shadowsilk poachers.', 'I need help in defeating the shadowsilk poachers.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5307, 'Drink up!  There''s more where that came from!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5308, 'Enjoy!  You won''t find better ale anywhere!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5309, 'Have you tried the Dark Iron Ale?  It''s the best!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5310, 'Try the boar!  It''s my new recipe!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5311, 'Thank you for clearing out those foolish senators.  Now prepare to meet your doom at the hands of Ragnaros'' most powerful servant.', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5312, 'Your efforts are utterly pointless, fools!  You will never be able to defeat me!', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5313, 'They were just getting in the way anyways.', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5314, 'Ha! You can''t even begin to imagine the futility of your efforts.', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5315, 'Is that the best you can do?  Do you really expect that you could defeat someone as awe inspiring as me?', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5316, 'Auction House', 'Auction House', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5317, 'Where is the Auction House?  Why it''s right by the gates of Ironforge as you enter our fine city.  Ye''ll find it just across from The Vault.', 'Where is the Auction House?  Why it''s right by the gates of Ironforge as you enter our fine city.  Ye''ll find it just across from The Vault.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5318, 'Anu therador mali $c.  Where can I guide you to?', 'Anu therador mali $c.  Where can I guide you to?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5319, 'How may I aid you in your journey?', 'How may I aid you in your journey?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5320, 'Do you require guidance to your destination?', 'Do you require guidance to your destination?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5321, 'What direction can I point you in?', 'What direction can I point you in?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5324, 'Can you help me with some directions?', 'Can you help me with some directions?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5325, 'Of all the wondrous places within Darnassus, which would you have me direct you to?', 'Of all the wondrous places within Darnassus, which would you have me direct you to?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5326, 'The Bank', 'The Bank', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5328, '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5329, 'You may find storage for your worldly goods at the bank of Darnassus, which lies in the center of our wondrous city.', 'You may find storage for your worldly goods at the bank of Darnassus, which lies in the center of our wondrous city.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5330, 'Hippogryph Master', 'Hippogryph Master', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5331, 'Vesprystus'' hippogryphs will bear you swiftly to your destination.  Seek him out in Rut''theran Village, through the portal which lies in the western section of Darnassus.', 'Vesprystus'' hippogryphs will bear you swiftly to your destination.  Seek him out in Rut''theran Village, through the portal which lies in the western section of Darnassus.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5332, 'Guild Master', 'Guild Master', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5333, 'If you desire to form a fellowship then it is the guild master, Lysheana, that you must see.  You will find her in the Craftsmen''s Terrace in the northeastern section of Darnassus.', 'If you desire to form a fellowship then it is the guild master, Lysheana, that you must see.  You will find her in the Craftsmen''s Terrace in the northeastern section of Darnassus.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5334, 'The Inn', 'The Inn', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5335, 'Though I find the cool grass which covers Teldrassil as good a bed as any, the beds which Saelienne keeps at the Inn in Craftsman''s Terrace are quite suitable for those with a taste for luxury.', 'Though I find the cool grass which covers Teldrassil as good a bed as any, the beds which Saelienne keeps at the Inn in Craftsman''s Terrace are quite suitable for those with a taste for luxury.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5336, 'Mailbox', 'Mailbox', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5337, 'There is a mailbox outside of the Bank which you''ll find in the center of Darnassus.', 'There is a mailbox outside of the Bank which you''ll find in the center of Darnassus.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5338, 'A class trainer', 'A class trainer', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5339, 'Here in Darnassus you will find skilled trainers who have perfected the skills of their chosen class through ages of training and dedication.  I will guide you to one who can become your mentor, you have but to name your chosen path.', 'Here in Darnassus you will find skilled trainers who have perfected the skills of their chosen class through ages of training and dedication.  I will guide you to one who can become your mentor, you have but to name your chosen path.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5340, 'Hunter', 'Hunter', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5341, 'You are fortunate to have come to Darnassus where you can find such an accomplished Hunter as Jocaste among our trainers.  I encourage you to visit her over in the Cenarion Enclave and seek her tutelage.', 'You are fortunate to have come to Darnassus where you can find such an accomplished Hunter as Jocaste among our trainers.  I encourage you to visit her over in the Cenarion Enclave and seek her tutelage.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5342, 'Druid', 'Druid', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5343, 'In grizzly times a druid can be a dear friend to those around them.  Ask any of the druids in the Cenarion Enclave and they will tell you the same.', 'In grizzly times a druid can be a dear friend to those around them.  Ask any of the druids in the Cenarion Enclave and they will tell you the same.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5344, 'Priest', 'Priest', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5345, 'The Temple of the Moon is home to the priests of Elune.  There you will find Jandria and Lariia, who will provide you with further guidance in the path of priesthood.', 'The Temple of the Moon is home to the priests of Elune.  There you will find Jandria and Lariia, who will provide you with further guidance in the path of priesthood.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5346, 'The power of Elune compels you!  The power of Elune compels you!  
INSERT INTO "world"."broadcast_text" ("entry", "male_text", "female_text", "chat_type", "sound_id", "language_id", "emote_id1", "emote_id2", "emote_id3", "emote_delay1", "emote_delay2", "emote_delay3") VALUES
(5376, 'Skinning', 'Skinning', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5377, 'In death, the animals of the world bestow both life and protection unto us.  If you feel that you can offer the appropriate respect for their sacrifice, then the skinner''s profession may suit you.  Speak with Eladriel in the Craftsmen''s Terrace in northern Darnassus to learn more.', 'In death, the animals of the world bestow both life and protection unto us.  If you feel that you can offer the appropriate respect for their sacrifice, then the skinner''s profession may suit you.  Speak with Eladriel in the Craftsman''s Terrace in northern Darnassus to learn more.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5378, 'Survival', 'Survival', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5379, 'If you need help surviving in the woods, you had best not stray far from the city walls.  However if you do plan to stray, then you had better have a talk with Malygen in the Cenarion Enclave so that you might learn to set a proper campfire.', 'If you need help surviving in the woods, you had best not stray far from the city walls.  However if you do plan to stray, then you had better have a talk with Malygen in the Cenarion Enclave so that you might learn to set a proper campfire.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5380, 'Tailoring', 'Tailoring', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5381, 'You would certainly be looking for Me''Lynn if you have any hope of learning to be a tailor.  She resides at the Craftsmen''s Terrace in northeastern Darnassus.', 'You would certainly be looking for Me''Lynn if you have any hope of learning to be a tailor.  She resides at the Craftsmen''s Terrace in northeastern Darnassus.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5382, 'Tracking', 'Tracking', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5383, 'Not a creature in the forest can elude Corand, such is his skill at tracking.  You would do well to listen to his teachings if you wish to be even half as successful.  
INSERT INTO "world"."broadcast_text" ("entry", "male_text", "female_text", "chat_type", "sound_id", "language_id", "emote_id1", "emote_id2", "emote_id3", "emote_delay1", "emote_delay2", "emote_delay3") VALUES
(5477, 'You may shed yourself of your worldly possessions at the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise.', 'You may shed yourself of your worldly possessions at the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5478, 'Metal, as with all things, should be used in balance with nature.  Karn Stonehoof has a smithy setup near the pond on the lower rise.  Seek out his wisdom.', 'Metal, as with all things, should be used in balance with nature.  Karn Stonehoof has a smithy setup near the pond on the lower rise.  Seek out his wisdom.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5479, 'You honor the spirits of the animals you must slay by not letting them go to waste.  Aska Mistrunner will show you how.  She has a kitchen on the high rise.', 'You honor the spirits of the animals you must slay by not letting them go to waste.  Aska Mistrunner will show you how.  She has a kitchen on the high rise.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5480, 'Greetings honored one.  Turak Runetotem and the other druids have been expecting you at the Hall of Elders on Elder Rise.', 'Greetings honored one.  Turak Runetotem and the other druids have been expecting you at the Hall of Elders on Elder Rise.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5481, 'The profession of Enchanting displays the cycle of destruction and creation that is at the heart of nature.  Teg at the Dawnstrider Enchanters on the middle rise will show you how.', 'The profession of Enchanting displays the cycle of destruction and creation that is at the heart of nature.  Teg at the Dawnstrider Enchanters on the middle rise will show you how.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5482, 'Life is a struggle, and the saying that which does not kill you makes you stronger is not always true.  Sometimes wounds act slowly, which is why we have bandages.  Pand Stonebinder of the Spirit Rise can teach you the art of First Aid.', 'Life is a struggle, and the saying that which does not kill you makes you stronger is not always true.  Sometimes wounds act slowly, which is why we have bandages.  Pand Stonebinder of the Spirit Rise can teach you the art of First Aid.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5483, 'Kah Mistrunner at Mountaintop Bait & Tackle on the high rise will show you the way to find inner peace and serenity while fishing for your next meal.', 'Kah Mistrunner at Mountaintop Bait & Tackle on the high rise will show you the way to find inner peace and serenity while fishing for your next meal.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5484, 'A fellowship of kindred spirits can be a powerful force.  Krumn will help you to achieve this.  You will find him at the Thunder Bluff Civic Information center on the lower rise next to the lifts.', 'A fellowship of kindred spirits can be a powerful force.  Krumn will help you to achieve this.  You will find him at the Thunder Bluff Civic Information center on the lower rise next to the lifts.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5485, 'Nature provides all that we need.  Speak to Komin Winterhoof at Holistic Herbalism on the middle rise.', 'Nature provides all that we need.  Speak to Komin Winterhoof at Holistic Herbalism on the middle rise.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5486, 'Any friend of the animals is a friend of mine.  The Hunter''s Hall is what you seek.  It sits atop the Hunter Rise.', 'Any friend of the animals is a friend of mine.  The Hunter''s Hall is what you seek.  It sits atop the Hunter Rise.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5487, 'There is a symmetry in the idea of the hide of your enemy providing you with protection.  To further your leatherworking skills look for Una inside the Thunder Bluff Armorers on the middle rise.', 'There is a symmetry in the idea of the hide of your enemy providing you with protection.  To further your leatherworking skills look for Una inside the Thunder Bluff Armorers on the middle rise.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5488, 'Very sad to think what has befallen those poor undead souls.  You can find Archmage Shymm reflecting near the Pools of Vision under the Spirit Rise.', 'Very sad to think what has befallen those poor undead souls.  You can find Archmage Shymm reflecting near the Pools of Vision under the Spirit Rise.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5489, 'The Earth Mother holds many secrets and Brek Stonehoof can help you to discover some of them.  You will find him on the lower rise at Stonehoof Geology.', 'The Earth Mother holds many secrets and Brek Stonehoof can help you to discover some of them.  You will find him on the lower rise at Stonehoof Geology.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5490, 'Despite their tragedy the Undead have come all this way to aid us.  I only hope that we can be as helpful to them.  Seek out Father Cobb near the Pools of Vision under the Spirit Rise.', 'Despite their tragedy the Undead have come all this way to aid us.  I only hope that we can be as helpful to them.  Seek out Father Cobb near the Pools of Vision under the Spirit Rise.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5491, 'The Earth Mother calls and you answer.  You will find the Hall of Spirits on the Spirit Rise.', 'The Earth Mother calls and you answer.  You will find the Hall of Spirits on the Spirit Rise.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5492, 'Every scrap used makes us less wasteful and brings us closer to the Earth Mother.  Mooranta can show you the way.  Seek her just outside the Thunder Bluff Armorers on the middle rise.', 'Every scrap used makes us less wasteful and brings us closer to the Earth Mother.  Mooranta can show you the way.  Seek her just outside the Thunder Bluff Armorers on the middle rise.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5493, 'You, in harmony with nature, and only your skills to survive.  This is the way that the Earth Mother intended it to be.  You will want to find Bale on the Hunter Rise.', 'You, in harmony with nature, and only your skills to survive.  This is the way that the Earth Mother intended it to be.  You will want to find Bale on the Hunter Rise.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5494, 'Clothing the tribe is as important a job as any other.  You should look for Tepa inside Thunder Bluff Armorers.  She has a natural way with the needle.', 'Clothing the tribe is as important a job as any other.  You should look for Tepa inside Thunder Bluff Armorers.  She has a natural way with the needle.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5495, 'Ah, the true sign of the hunter!  To stalk one''s prey in the never-ending game of life.  Look to Drayl on the Hunter Rise for your answers.', 'Ah, the true sign of the hunter!  To stalk one''s prey in the never-ending game of life.  Look to Drayl on the Hunter Rise for your answers.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5496, 'Strong of body and spirit.  There can be no stronger combination!  Find your destiny with Sark Ragetotem in the Hunter''s Hall.', 'Strong of body and spirit.  There can be no stronger combination!  Find your destiny with Sark Ragetotem in the Hunter''s Hall.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5497, 'Ah, to soar with the great birds of the sky.  Seek out Tal at the top of the Winder Rider Roost.  He will steer you toward where you''re going.', 'Ah, to soar with the great birds of the sky.  Seek out Tal at the top of the Winder Rider Roost.  He will steer you toward where you''re going.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5498, 'Look for Innkeeper Pala in the building just south of the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise.', 'Look for Innkeeper Pala in the building just south of the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5499, 'Innkeeper Pala will help you rest your body and spirit.  You can find her in the building just south of the bank on the lower rise.', 'Innkeeper Pala will help you rest your body and spirit.  You can find her in the building just south of the bank on the lower rise.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5500, 'You can find a mailbox just outside the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise.', 'You can find a mailbox just outside the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5501, 'I believe I noticed a new shipment of mail being delivered not too long ago.  You''ll find the mailbox just outside the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise.', 'I believe I noticed a new shipment of mail being delivered not too long ago.  You''ll find the mailbox just outside the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5502, 'It is found on the lowest section of Thunder Bluff.  Search near the bank.  It is not far from there.', 'It is found on the lowest section of Thunder Bluff.  Search near the bank.  It is not far from there.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5503, 'The auction house can be found on the central spire of Thunder Bluff.  Search near the bottom of the Windrider''s Tower. May your ancestors watch over you.', 'The auction house can be found on the central spire of Thunder Bluff.  Search near the bottom of the Windrider''s Tower. May your ancestors watch over you.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5504, 'This may come as a shock to you, but business hasn''t been all that good as of late...', '', 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5505, '', 'I welcome you to Theramore, $n.$B$BI apologize for being abrupt and not having a lot of time to exchange pleasantries, but my city must come first. Too many things threaten our way of life and the sanctity of the Alliance. I must stay ever vigilant against forces outside of our control if I''m to ensure my people remain safe and happy.$B$BPerhaps we''ll have more time to speak later.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5506, '', 'Hendel is in our custody now, $n, thanks to you.$B$BAlthough the questioning goes slowly, I assure you, he will tell us everything he knows.$B$BFor now, please be patient. I will contact you immediately if we have need of your assistance.$B$BUntil then, please, enjoy Theramore and I invite you to stay for as long as you like within our city''s walls as a friend of the Alliance.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5508, '', 'If you''re ready, then Dadanga and I are ready.  Let''s go!', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5509, 'Yes $gbrother : sister;, how may I assist you?', 'Yes $gbrother : sister;, how may I assist you?', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5511, '', 'All right then... I know the way to and from Gadgetzan.  What I need for you to do is to keep the beasts off of us.  I''ve trained Dadanga how to defend herself pretty well, but we can''t handle the overgrown madness out there for long.  Let me know when you''re ready to go, $n.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5512, 'What do you think of Dadanga?
INSERT INTO "world"."broadcast_text" ("entry", "male_text", "female_text", "chat_type", "sound_id", "language_id", "emote_id1", "emote_id2", "emote_id3", "emote_delay1", "emote_delay2", "emote_delay3") VALUES
(5579, 'Why not destroy them with the combined might of the Aspects?', 'Why not destroy them with the combined might of the Aspects?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5580, 'It is not our way, nor would it be possible. Nefarian is guarded by ancient wards, as old as the Aspects themselves. It is what prevents me from entering the inner sanctum of this citadel. The dark magic prevents any of the other flight to enter without being ordained... unless.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0),
(5581, 'Unless?', 'Unless?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5582, 'It is possible for one, not of dragon kind, to obtain the Adorned Seal of Ascension and pass through the protected barrier. While possession of such an item would surely destroy me, perhaps you could utilize it and lower the barrier.
INSERT INTO "world"."broadcast_text" ("entry", "male_text", "female_text", "chat_type", "sound_id", "language_id", "emote_id1", "emote_id2", "emote_id3", "emote_delay1", "emote_delay2", "emote_delay3") VALUES
(5680, 'Vincent!  You and your pathetic ilk will find no more success in routing my sons and I than those beggardly remnants of the Kirin Tor.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5681, 'If you will not serve my Master with your sword and knowledge of his enemies...', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5682, 'Your moldering remains will serve ME as a testament to what happens when one is foolish enough to trespass in my domain!
INSERT INTO "world"."broadcast_text" ("entry", "male_text", "female_text", "chat_type", "sound_id", "language_id", "emote_id1", "emote_id2", "emote_id3", "emote_delay1", "emote_delay2", "emote_delay3") VALUES
(5781, 'I said ye had the blood of a blacksmith in ye, and I was right. Go to Ironforge, to The Great Forge, and find yerself a Dwarven smith by the name of Bengus Deepforge. My teacher, and one of the greatest smiths I''ve ever known.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5783, 'The life of a smith is not an easy one, but it puts steel in yer bones and fire in yer heart. My da'' was a smith, my grandfather before him in the forges beneath Grim Batol. And now my son follows in our footsteps, that boy makes me proud.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5784, 'Sorry $g lad : lass;, ye aren''t quite up to the challenge of learning from me. Go see my son Groum, it would make his day to get a new apprentice.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5785, 'Yer skill is not without merit, but I need to put one last test to ye before I take ye on.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5786, 'Aye, I would love ta teach ye a thing or two about smithing. Grab an apron and a hammer and let''s see what we can accomplish shall we?', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5787, 'A fast learner is what ye are, and a good smith to boot. I would sign off on yer work any day of the week. But I sense ye still have some learnin in ye. Go talk to Bengus Deepforge, he''s a hard taskmaster but he''s also one of the best.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5788, '%s lets out a shrill cry.', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5789, '', 'Don''t come out of the shadows like that. Next time give a girl some warning. ', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5790, '', 'Ever since the shadows claimed Duskwood I haven''t been able to sleep. I am kept awake by the ghostly sounds of screaming on the breeze. It sounds almost like lambs screaming, and they won''t stop.', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5791, '', 'Hmm, your work is allright but it''s nowhere near the quality I look for in a student. Go talk with Smith Argus in Goldshire, I''m sure he can teach you some basics. Then when you''re done, come on back to me and I''ll give you a little test to make sure you are ready.', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5792, '', 'Yeah, I''ve heard through the grapevine that I might be seeing you sooner or later. But I don''t just take on anyone, I need to make sure you have what it takes first. You willing to take my little test and find out?', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5793, '', 'You do fine work, but it''s a bit rough around the edges. Don''t worry about it, it will come with practice. Speaking of which, how about we see what you''ve been working on?', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5794, '', 'Now I''m the one who feels rough around the edges, I honestly don''t think there''s anything left I can teach you. But you know who can? Bengus Deepforge in Ironforge, now there''s a dwarf that knows his steel. Go look him up in The Great Forge of Ironforge, see if he''s up to having a new trainee under him.', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5795, 'If I prove myself to Saru he will have no choice but to let me fight for one of his daughters. Then we will see who is sneering.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5796, 'Stay away from Sumi and Tumi. They are....spoken for.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5797, 'Come to me again with such pathetic work and I will send you home in a small iron box that I tempered in goat urine. Now go see that idiot Ug''thok, he is better suited to your needs.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5798, 'So you think you are good enough to learn from me? The great Snarl? You are no more than a lowly worm beneath my boot. However, taking on an underling might make me seem more appealing to Sumi and Tumi. Let''s see what meager skills you possess.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5799, 'Hmm? Oh yes, I can teach you something if you desire. But stay away from Sumi and Tumi, they are not for the likes of you. Saru only let''s those of great skill approach his daughters.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5800, 'There is nothing more that I can teach - now get out! And don''t even think of approaching Saru, for one as unworthy as you he will use your blood to temper his steel.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5801, 'The spirits have brought you to me, and so I feel blessed by them. ', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5803, 'You need to heed the guidance of the spirits a little better young one. Your path lies with another, Thrag Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff. Perhaps you can learn something from one another.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5805, 'Tell me, do your feel prepared to face the challenge I have laid out for you? The spirits tell me that you will pass, but do you have faith in them or in yourself?', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5806, 'Join me, together we will weave the spirits of the forge and find the true shape that the metal seeks.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5807, 'Our paths through life intersect only briefly and now is the time for ours to part ways. I consider myself blessed to have spent this time teaching you and now send you along to join paths with your next mentor. Seek out Saru Steelfury of Orgrimmar, he will teach what you need to learn.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5808, 'You have great potential, but you must achieve understanding first, you must accept the spirits and listen to their calling. Only then will you be prepared for the path you must follow. Go speak with Thrag, I think perhaps you can learn a lot from one another.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5809, 'You are now ready to follow the path that joins your life with my own, if only for a short time. However we must make sure that you understand the things of which the spirits speak.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5810, 'You have learned much, but I sense that there is more left for the spirits to teach you. I can place your foot on the path but cannot guide your steps. Go and find Saru Steelfury in Orgrimmar, the next stretch of your journey begins there.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5811, 'You waste my time, go talk with my student Basil.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5812, 'Perhaps you have what it takes, perhaps not. If you do then I will take you on and teach you what you wish to know. If you do not... well, I''ll just leave it at that.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5813, 'Very fine equipment you make, very fine indeed. Go to the Orc''s home of Orgrimmar and seek out a smith named Saru Steelfury. One thing you must give the Orcs, they make beautiful instruments of death.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5814, 'I''m sorry $g lad : lass; but ye just don''t have the foundation to learn what I have to teach. But don''t fret, go speak with my student Rotgath, he''ll help ye out.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5815, 'Looks like ye may have the makings of a great smith. But before I teach ye anything I need to know that ye''ve got what it takes. ', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5816, 'I can''t say enough about yer work, truly amazing things that ye can do with a hammer and an anvil. Now, don''t be tellin anyone that I suggested ye go find a goblin to teach ye but that''s exactly what I''m gonna do. Brikk Keencraft is his name, and last I heard he was operating a shop down in Booty Bay.', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5817, 'This isn''t a game you toy with youngling! Go, speak with Snarl outside. He may be a serpent in my lair but he does know his way around an anvil.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5818, 'Still a bit weak, unbalanced, unsure. Not your work youngling, I am speaking of you! Now, are you ready to be shaped into a real smith or not?', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5819, 'I see you know more of the secret of steel than I do. That is good, for it is meant to be taken. Now you must travel to the jungle south of the human lands, to the goblin city of Booty Bay. There you will find a Goblin named Brikk Keencraft. I do not like Goblins but his knowledge of the secret of steel is unmatched by any I know of.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5820, 'Yeah? Of course I''m a smith. What, you think Dwarves are the only ones worth their weight in anvils? Fine, be that way. Go get a dwarf to help you!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5821, 'Are you kidding me? You must be kidding me! Either that or you think I''m a clown here to amuse you. Is that what you think? That I''m a clown? Huh, is it! You think I''m a clown don''t you!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5822, 'You act like this is the best junk I''ve ever seen. Sure it''s ok, but I see stuff this ''OK'' every day. Tell you what, you find a way to wow me, and I''ll teach you things that make dwarves smile in their sleep.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5823, 'Imagination is the limit my friend, if you can figure out how to smith it then you can make it, box it, and ship it to retailers all over the world. Of course, then you have to deal with marketing. Tell you what, let''s just stick with the smithing part for now, ok?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5824, 'Your victory shall be short lived. The days of both the Alliance and Horde are coming to an end! The next time we meet shall be the last.', '', 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5825, 'What did Gryphe tell boss?? Gryphe wasn''t lying! There she is, trying to steal battle plans!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5826, 'Gryfe do his job! Gryfe go now!!!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5827, 'Oh, it''s on now! Bet you thought I''d be alone too, huh?!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5828, 'Whoa! This is way more than what I bargained for, you''re on your own, Slim!', '', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5829, 'Though I hate to admit it, the bear did get the better of me. My oh my, that''s one big ol'' bear!$b$bNonetheless, if you can take that bear down, it''d be a feat to be proud of! It gave more than a few of our best hunters some trouble.$b$b<He claps you on the back.>$b$bBest the bear and we''ll accept you as a regular member of the Farstrider Lodge.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5830, 'Here at the Farstrider lodge, we prize hunting skills above all else. Wish to gain my approval? You''ll have to earn it.$B$BYou look up to the challenge, $Glad:lass;!', '', 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5831, 'You''ve become quite the hunter, $n! Not only have you proven your skills, you also bested Daryl, which gets you extra points in my book!$B$BYou''re welcome here any time.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5832, 'You have summoned me, fool!  Now DIE!', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5833, 'Milk me, John.', 'Milk me, John.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5834, 'With pleasure... just let me savor this moment for a minute longer.', '', 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5835, 'Do it... Do it now.', 'Do it... Do it now.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5836, 'They''s in Magic Quarter.  Look for them in scary skull building.', 'They''s in Magic Quarter.  Look for them in scary skull building.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5837, 'Us know where they are!  Skull building in Magic Quarter on outer ring of city.', 'Us know where they are!  Skull building in Magic Quarter on outer ring of city.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5838, 'Bank in Trade Quarter central tower.  You not miss it.', 'Bank in Trade Quarter central tower.  You not miss it.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5839, 'We have one eye and see better than you!  Bank in center of Undercity!', 'We have one eye and see better than you!  Bank in center of Undercity!', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5840, 'Michael Garrett on upper ring in Trade Quarter.', 'Michael Garrett on upper ring in Trade Quarter.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5841, 'Bat man on upper level of Trade Quarter.', 'Bat man on upper level of Trade Quarter.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5842, 'Yep, you looking for Christopher Drakul in Trade Quarter.  He on eastern platform.', 'Yep, you looking for Christopher Drakul in Trade Quarter.  He on eastern platform.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5843, 'We join guild?  No?  Ok, you find Guild Master on east platform in Trade Quarter.', 'We join guild?  No?  Ok, you find Guild Master on east platform in Trade Quarter.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5844, 'Innkeeper Norman on upper ring of Trade Quarter is one to talk to.', 'Innkeeper Norman on upper ring of Trade Quarter is one to talk to.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5845, 'No rest for wicked, but us guess you ok.  You find Innkeeper Norman on upper ring of Trade Quarter.', 'No rest for wicked, but us guess you ok.  You find Innkeeper Norman on upper ring of Trade Quarter.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5846, 'Mailbox in middle of city, Trade Quarter, upper ring... next to inn.', 'Mailbox in middle of city, Trade Quarter, upper ring... next to inn.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5847, 'Us need check to see if our Brain... Brain... Brain Hacker sold at auction.  You find mailbox next to inn on upper ring of Trade Quarter.', 'Us need check to see if our Brain... Brain... Brain Hacker sold at auction.  You find mailbox next to inn on upper ring of Trade Quarter.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5848, 'We have auction house in central ring.', 'We have auction house in central ring.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5849, 'Central ring.  You go!', 'Central ring.  You go!', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5850, 'Little goblin on top of building north of Ruins of Lordaeron.  Leave Undercity and you go there.', 'Little goblin on top of building north of Ruins of Lordaeron.  Leave Undercity and you go there.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5851, 'Us see balloon north of ruins up above.  It take you to far off places.', 'Us see balloon north of ruins up above.  It take you to far off places.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5852, 'Priest trainer?  You go to outer ring of War Quarter and look for them there.', 'Priest trainer?  You go to outer ring of War Quarter and look for them there.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5853, 'Uh huh.  Unholies in War Quarter standing around main building on outer ring of city.', 'Uh huh.  Unholies in War Quarter standing around main building on outer ring of city.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5854, '', 'Get that head and it''s sure to give Daryl a fright. Not that he doesn''t deserve it, the bloody arrogant bastard. But ha! I can''t wait to see the look on his face when you show it to him.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5855, '', 'Welcome to the Farstrider Lodge, $n!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5856, 'Rogues in building on outer ring of Rogues'' Quarter.', 'Rogues in building on outer ring of Rogues'' Quarter.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5857, 'They teach me to sneak good.  You find them in Rogues'' Quarter on outer ring of Undercity.', 'They teach me to sneak good.  You find them in Rogues'' Quarter on outer ring of Undercity.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5858, '', 'You''re always welcome here, $n. Thanks for the laugh -- and don''t worry about Daryl, he had one coming!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5859, 'Warlock trainers in Magic Quarter in building on outer ring with Mages.', 'Warlock trainers in Magic Quarter in building on outer ring with Mages.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5860, 'Us want felhound for pet.  We feed it and treat it good and teach it play fetch.  You find Warlocks in Magic Quarter on outer ring of city.', 'Us want felhound for pet.  We feed it and treat it good and teach it play fetch.  You find Warlocks in Magic Quarter on outer ring of city.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
