(5884, 'Us have skinning hook.  We get it from Killian Hagey who teach us how to skin kills.  You have nice skin.  You find him on inner ring of Rogues'' Quarter.', 'Us have skinning hook.  We get it from Killian Hagey who teach us how to skin kills.  You have nice skin.  You find him on inner ring of Rogues'' Quarter.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
