(5886, 'Hmmm, that good idea.  Maybe we head there to get some stitches replaced?  Him sew good.  You find Josef Gregorian on inner circle of Magic Quarter.', 'Hmmm, that good idea.  Maybe we head there to get some stitches replaced?  Him sew good.  You find Josef Gregorian on inner circle of Magic Quarter.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
