(5916, 'A profession trainer', 'A profession trainer', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5917, 'Us think you need help.', 'Us think you need help.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5918, 'We help you find them.', 'We help you find them.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5919, 'Our eye say you look lost.', 'Our eye say you look lost.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5920, 'Us hear and obey.', 'Us hear and obey.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5921, 'Can you help me with some directions?', 'Can you help me with some directions?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5922, 'Listen to the stories of an elder. $n. I have many to speak of...', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5923, '', 'Welcome to the refuge, $n. Some come here with a purpose, others found their way here by accident... But everyone here seems to have a unique story to tell.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5926, '', 'Be on guard... Arnak has some strange power over the Grimtotem... they will not be happy to see me escape.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5927, '', 'Look out, the Grimtotem are upon us!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5928, '', 'Here they come.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5929, '', 'More Grimtotems are coming this way!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5930, '', 'Finally, free at last... I must be going now, thanks for helping me escape. I can get back to Freewind Post by myself.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5931, '', '$n!  You''re back!  And not a moment too soon!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5932, '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5933, '', 'Hi, $n.  No hard feelings, ok?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5934, 'I present to you the rabid thistle bear, Tharnariun.', 'I present to you the rabid thistle bear, Tharnariun.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5935, 'Grrr...', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5936, 'I want to release the corrupted saber to Winna.', 'I want to release the corrupted saber to Winna.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5937, 'Be cleansed!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5938, '%s recasts the cleansing spell.', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5939, '%s jumps into the moonwell, and goes underwater...', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5940, '%s follows $n obediently.', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5941, '%s snarls ferociously.', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5942, 'I came to the Crossroads from the south seeking help, $c, but I find only cowards who turn their backs on me--even the mighty Thork insults me so. He is a good leader, but his dismissal of my plea causes me greater anger.$B$BHe claims my rage makes me hasty--that it clouds my judgement--but I will not rest until I have vengeance!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5943, 'I thank you, $n. Your dedication to my plea gives rest to my lost wife''s spirit, and for that I could never repay you enough.$B$BI cannot say that my hatred will ever cease for the quilboar, but it is satiated for now.$B$BNow I must begin to rebuild my life.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5944, '%s points to the parchment on the ground.', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5945, '', 'I''m very curious to see what this sample of water will do!', 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5946, '', '%s pours the corrupted water onto the cat.', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5947, '', 'Haha! Perfect!', 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5948, '%s has been encaged.', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5949, 'Use staff, tell Raze what do! Show Raze poacher! Raze smash!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5950, 'Now this is an example of what not to summon. Look, it''s frail and brittle. One good whack from a mace will send bone shards flying.', 'Now this is an example of what not to summon. Look, it''s frail and brittle. One good whack from a mace will send bone shards flying.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5951, 'Note the weak binding structure of this one. Be sure to finish your incantations or this is what you will end up with.', 'Note the weak binding structure of this one. Be sure to finish your incantations or this is what you will end up with.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5952, 'This one is slightly better than the last. However, it still suffers from the same flimsy bone structure as the others. When you summon one of these, you are on the right path.', 'This one is slightly better than the last. However, it still suffers from the same flimsy bone structure as the others. When you summon one of these, you are on the right path.', 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5953, 'Wow, this one is just plain useless. Let me try again.', 'Wow, this one is just plain useless. Let me try again.', 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5954, 'Hmmm, this one looks like something that would be better off as a windchime. Take notes class... This is NOT what you want to summon in the heat of battle.', 'Hmmm, this one looks like something that would be better off as a windchime. Take notes class... This is NOT what you want to summon in the heat of battle.', 0, 0, 0, 94, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5955, 'What could be taking so long?', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5956, 'How long can it take to pick a handful of weeds?', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5957, 'At this rate I could have gathered them myself!', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5958, 'If you want something done right, do it yourself!', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5959, 'As if I had all eternity.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5960, 'Ah, this must be him now... no?  Bah!', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5961, 'Maybe I should have just bought some off of Faruza?', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5962, 'I had to go and requisition an Abomination... an Abomination!', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5963, '', 'The body is that of a female orc warrior.$B$BIt is clear that she died in battle, probably against the quilboar in the area.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5964, 'I inspect the body further.', 'I inspect the body further.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5965, '', 'You turn the body over and see the marks from blades and spells upon the deceased orc--her armor all but destroyed, her hair matted to her face.$B$BBased on Mankrik''s description of her, there is no doubt in your mind that this was his wife.$B$BHe will be upset by the news, but you are sure he should know the truth.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5966, 'Start running!', 'Start running!', 0, 0, 3, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5967, 'Bring it on!', 'Bring it on!', 0, 0, 3, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5968, 'Do not push me, or I will impale you on my horns!', 'Do not push me, or I will impale you on my horns!', 0, 0, 3, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5969, 'Welcome to the Crossroads, $c. My name is Thork--I lead the defenses here in the name of the Warchief.$B$BPlease, feel free to make yourself at home. As long as you mind your business, no one should have any problem with you taking up some space.$B$BThere are many threats to our safety here. If you''ve already become familiar with the lay of the land, speak to the others here--perhaps they have tasks for you to do.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5970, '<Goretooth spits.>$B$BI am a warrior of the Horde, $n. It fills me with rage to know that our enemies sit in a fortress, less than a day''s ride from Kargath, plotting against us.$B$BHow I long to break free from the bonds of duty and destroy them all in the name of the Warchief.$B$BAlas, we all have roles we must fulfill.
INSERT INTO "world"."broadcast_text" ("entry", "male_text", "female_text", "chat_type", "sound_id", "language_id", "emote_id1", "emote_id2", "emote_id3", "emote_delay1", "emote_delay2", "emote_delay3") VALUES
(5986, '%s and Raider Kerr let their wolves rest a bit and drink...', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5987, '%s and Raider Kerr charge into battle...', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5988, '%s takes aim...', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5989, 'Greetings, young $c.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5990, 'Hello, Eitrigg. I bring news from Blackrock Spire.', 'Hello, Eitrigg. I bring news from Blackrock Spire.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5991, 'Rend, son of Blackhand: Impotent chieftain of the Blackrock clan. A more stubborn bastard does not exist.$B$BAt the end of the second War, Rend and his brother, Maim, fled to find sanctuary within the mountainous stronghold of Blackrock Spire. It was there that Rend declared himself Warchief of the weakened Blackrock clan.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0),
(5992, 'There is only one Warchief, Eitrigg!', 'There is only one Warchief, Eitrigg!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5993, 'Yes, young one, you need not convince me of such things, the Warchief and I have much history. Your dedication, however, is noted.$B$BAs I was saying, Rend had found a new home for his people, and I was among those who would wearily follow.$B$BFrom one conflict arose others... countless others. It was in those battles for Blackrock Spire between the Blackrock clan and the Dark Iron dwarves that my sons were both slain. It was then that I realized my time among the Blackrock clan had come to an end.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0),
(5994, 'What do you mean?', 'What do you mean?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(5995, 'I left. I would not remain with the Blackrock. No, the deaths of my children would not be in vain. I would not serve under an inept, power hungry maniac such as Rend.$B$BI took shelter in the woods of Lordaeron, living as a hermit near Hearthglen.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0),
(5996, 'Hearthglen?? But...
INSERT INTO "world"."broadcast_text" ("entry", "male_text", "female_text", "chat_type", "sound_id", "language_id", "emote_id1", "emote_id2", "emote_id3", "emote_delay1", "emote_delay2", "emote_delay3") VALUES
(6103, '%s snorts.', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6104, '%s cries.', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6105, 'Hahah!  Revenge is mine!', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6106, '%s takes a more careful aim...', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6107, '%s picks the orc target...', '', 2, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6108, '%s takes aim again...', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6109, '%s takes aim one last time...', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6110, '', 'Time is running out for me... for us all...', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6111, '', 'I have so much to do... so much before the plague comes...
INSERT INTO "world"."broadcast_text" ("entry", "male_text", "female_text", "chat_type", "sound_id", "language_id", "emote_id1", "emote_id2", "emote_id3", "emote_delay1", "emote_delay2", "emote_delay3") VALUES
(6205, 'Purged by pain!', '', 1, 5848, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6206, 'Naughty secrets!', '', 1, 5849, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6207, 'I''ll rip the secrets from your flesh!', '', 1, 5850, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6208, 'Take a look at this, Malyfous.', 'Take a look at this, Malyfous.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6209, 'What have you got there, $n?$B$B<Malyfous points to the unfired plate gauntlets hanging out of your pack.>', '', 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6210, '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6211, 'Don''t forget to get some Flame in a Bottle from the box here.  You''re going to need it to destroy their command tent.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6212, 'By Thaurissan''s beard! Slay them!', '', 1, 5852, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6213, 'Me Grimlok, king!', '', 1, 5853, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6214, 'Die! Die!', '', 1, 5854, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6215, 'Reckless mortal!', '', 1, 5858, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6216, 'I''ll feast on your bones!', '', 1, 5860, 14, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6217, 'The Soulflayer comes!', '', 1, 5862, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6219, 'Hakkar shall live again!', '', 1, 5865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6220, 'Turn back! Do not wake the dreamer!', '', 6, 5866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6221, 'Sands consume you!', '', 1, 5872, 14, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6222, 'Fall!', '', 1, 5873, 14, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6223, 'Let the executions begin!', '', 1, 5874, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6224, 'Justice is done!', '', 1, 5875, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6225, 'This desert be mine!', '', 1, 5876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6226, 'Die, outlander!', '', 1, 5877, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6227, 'Feel the fury of the sands!', '', 1, 5879, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6228, 'The Sandfury reign supreme!', '', 1, 5878, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6229, 'Welcome to the front lines, $c.  While politicians may connive and scheme amongst themselves, they''ll find no such luxury afforded to them here.  This is the Bulwark, and we fight for our continued survival on a daily basis here.$B$BIf you''ve come here looking for a chance to prove yourself as a hero, then you''ll find plenty of opportunities to do so... especially as we push towards Andorhal and whatever malign force that controls the Scourge there.', '', 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6230, 'Welcome to the front lines, $c.  The Kingdom of Stormwind, with the aid of its allies, has sent me here to counter the growing threat of the Scourge.  Here at Chillwind Point, we fight for our continued survival on a daily basis.$B$BIf you''ve come here looking for a chance to prove yourself as a hero, then you''ll find plenty of opportunities to do so... especially as we push towards Andorhal and whatever malign force that controls the Scourge there.', '', 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6231, '', '%s looks around nervously.', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6232, '', 'Are you sure you weren''t followed here? I have a very bad feeling all of a sudden...', 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6233, '', 'Be on your guard!', 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6234, 'We are betrayed!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6235, 'It is good to see others who fight the Scourge in Stratholme, for it is here they are strongest.$B$BGreetings.  I am Aurius.  I was once a paladin of the Silver Hand, but like others whose faith wavered... I fell from grace.  The Scourge seduced me and nearly transformed me into a death knight!$B$BFinally sensing my peril, I fled to this chapel.  It is a sacred place, where the first paladin, Uther the Lightbringer, was ordained into the order of the Silver Hand.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6236, 'Rivendare!  I come for you!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6237, 'Argh!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6238, 'I do not have much time in this world, but Light willing, it is time enough to fulfill my destiny.  When you face Baron Rivendare, I will be with you.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6239, 'Leave me.  My wounds are great and I fear they will overtake me.  Thank you, $n.  I will die here, but because of you... I''ll die in peace.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6240, 'Test not my patience, mortal.', '', 0, 0, 8, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6241, 'You will have to excuse me, Lorax, I do not speak ''crazy.''', 'You will have to excuse me, Lorax, I do not speak ''crazy.''', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6242, 'Bite your tongue, $r, lest I rip it from your skull case and use it as a horn warmer.', '', 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6243, 'My apologies, I did not realize that you could understand what I was saying. What is it you are doing out here?', 'My apologies, I did not realize that you could understand what I was saying. What is it you are doing out here?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6244, 'What it is that I do, of course. I brood. I lament. I hate. I plot. When that cycle is complete, I brood again. What is it you want from me? I have much on my mind.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6245, 'Do you? Perhaps you should tell me what it is that is bothering you.', 'Do you? Perhaps you should tell me what it is that is bothering you.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6246, 'You?$B$B<Lorax laughs.>$B$BThat is doubtful.$B$BI stand in these ruins and dream. Dream of the day that I catch that miserable thief, Goraluk Anvilcrack.$B$BWe had a deal, him and I. A deal that he broke. Betrayed.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6247, 'What deal?', 'What deal?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6248, 'I would teach him how to demon forge in exchange for his soul. The soul of a Blackrock orc is worth very little but in these trying times, a soul, any soul, is better than none at all.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6249, 'So how did he break the deal?', 'So how did he break the deal?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6250, 'He took the unforged rune covered breastplate, used in the making of the demon forged breastplate and ran away without making payment. A fool, I am not, however... the unforged chest piece is useless without knowledge or the recipe to apply said knowledge.$B$BI wonder... does he sit safely in his city of Blackrock Spire and attempt to create the item from the raw material? I know he dare not leave!
INSERT INTO "world"."broadcast_text" ("entry", "male_text", "female_text", "chat_type", "sound_id", "language_id", "emote_id1", "emote_id2", "emote_id3", "emote_delay1", "emote_delay2", "emote_delay3") VALUES
(6306, '', '%s jumps in fright!', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6307, '', 'Ahhhh!!! What is that thing?!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6308, '', 'Umi sent you, didn''t she?! She told me to expect a surprise, but I never thought that this is what she meant!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6309, 'There''s a great cook who works at the Pig and Whistle Tavern in Old Town.  I''ve watched him use a knife when he cooks and just between you and me, I don''t think he''s always been a cook.  Don''t get me wrong... if you still want to learn, he''s the best we have.', 'There''s a great cook who works at the Pig and Whistle Tavern in Old Town.  I''ve watched him use a knife when he cooks and just between you and me, I don''t think he''s always been a cook.  Don''t get me wrong... if you still want to learn, he''s the best we have.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6310, 'Ah, you''re looking for Lucan Cordell.  He runs a shop on the outside of the Magic Quarter on your way to the Stockade.  ', 'Ah, you''re looking for Lucan Cordell.  He runs a shop on the outside of the Magic Quarter on your way to the Stockade.  ', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6311, '%s attempts to get help!', '%s attempts to get help!', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6312, 'Hey, that reminds me, I need to have my rocket boots repaired.  Word to the wise my friend, rocket boots and gryphons don''t mix.  
INSERT INTO "world"."broadcast_text" ("entry", "male_text", "female_text", "chat_type", "sound_id", "language_id", "emote_id1", "emote_id2", "emote_id3", "emote_delay1", "emote_delay2", "emote_delay3") VALUES
(6406, 'I come from the land down under... where women plague and men sunder.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6407, 'The what-bringer? Oh, ASHbringer? Never heard of it... What? Stop bothering me!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6408, 'I should have taken the translucent pill.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6409, 'Just sit right back and you''ll hear a ta... *hic* a tai... *hic* a taiiii *hic* Damnit!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6410, '', 'Have you seen Watcher Backus? So brave...$B$BI think he''s the toughest of all the Night Watch. I wonder if he even notices I''m around....', 0, 0, 0, 6, 24, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6411, 'The temperature is... not hot enough!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6412, '*sigh* ...113 degrees Kraklenheit. Can''t you do any better?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6413, 'You''re getting warmer... 7039 degrees Kraklenheit!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6414, '8536 degrees Kraklenheit is the reading... Tired of me yet?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6415, 'Who dares disturb our master?', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6416, '', 'Hurray!  My doll!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6417, '', 'You''ll keep the bad people away, won''t you?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6418, '', 'Let''s find out the whole story.  That''s going to take some magic...', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6419, '', 'There, it is done.  The book has been enhanced...', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6420, 'Looking for these???? You''ll never have em!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6421, 'The bastion is falling! Burn the evidence!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6422, 'I''m going to wear your skin as a smoking jacket! The stogies? You''ll have to pry them from my cold dead... er... RAWR!!!!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6423, 'Leave nothing behind!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6424, 'Destroy the records before the bastion falls!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6425, 'Ramstein hunger for flesh!', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6426, 'Welcome to flavor country!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6427, 'Thank you!  You freed me!', 'Thank you!  You freed me!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6428, 'Oh, thank you!  I have been trapped in this nightmare for so long...', 'Oh, thank you!  I have been trapped in this nightmare for so long...', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6429, 'At last, my soul is free!', 'At last, my soul is free!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6430, 'Thank you!  The battle for Darrowshire doomed me, but you have set me free!', 'Thank you!  The battle for Darrowshire doomed me, but you have set me free!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6431, 'Ah!  Please, if you see a survivor of Darrowshire, tell them I am free!', 'Ah!  Please, if you see a survivor of Darrowshire, tell them I am free!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6432, '', 'The Emerald Circle strives to heal the wounded land of Felwood. Although the land is named for the very thing that has corrupted it, we hope that one day we will be able to eradicate the corruption from this land.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6433, '', 'I''m ready, $n. Let''s find my equipment and get out of here. I think I know where it is.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6434, '', 'We''ve failed, $n!!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6435, '', 'Hello, $c. I am Jessir Moonbow. I have come from Darnassus seeking two friends who came looking for signs of the Shadow Council in Felwood.$B$BIt seems those vile creatures who claim responsibility for much of the orcish race''s suffering seeks to regain some of its power.$B$BMy two friends went looking in Jaedenar to prove one way or the other what was happening.$B$BI expected them to be here when I arrived, but now they are days late.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6436, 'The Scourge have broken into the Bastion!  Redouble your efforts!  We must not fail!', 'The Scourge have broken into the Bastion!  Redouble your efforts!  We must not fail!', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6437, 'Skeletons have advanced past the Hall of Lights!  Destroy them!', 'Skeletons have advanced past the Hall of Lights!  Destroy them!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6438, 'Our defenses are failing!  By the light we must prevail!', 'Our defenses are failing!  By the light we must prevail!', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6439, 'The Scourge have broken through in all wings!  May the light defeat these foul creatures!  We shall fight to the last!', 'The Scourge have broken through in all wings!  May the light defeat these foul creatures!  We shall fight to the last!', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6440, 'Zug zug, brave $c!  I have the finest bred wolf mounts for you to peruse.  You''ll not find another animal with the level of endurance and survival instincts that the wolf has anywhere!  Please, inspect them for yourself.', 'Zug zug, brave $c!  I have the finest bred wolf mounts for you to peruse.  You''ll not find another animal with the level of endurance and survival instincts that the wolf has anywhere!  Please, inspect them for yourself.', 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6441, 'Today you have unmade what took me years to create! For this you shall all die by my hand!', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6442, 'Damn you mortals! All my plans of revenge, all my hate... all burned to ash...', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6443, '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6444, 'I only make my mounts available to those who are considered friendly to Orgrimmar and the Orcish race.  Go prove yourself to us, and I''ll make my mighty wolves available for your inspection.', 'I only make my mounts available to those who are considered friendly to Orgrimmar and the Orcish race.  Go prove yourself to us, and I''ll make my mighty wolves available for your inspection.', 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6445, 'And a good day to ya, brave $c.  I know ya be lookin'' for a fine steed.  There''s no finer steed than a raptor under your reigns, lemme tell you $g mon : sis;!  Take a look at the ones I got to offer - bred from the fiercest stock anywhere.', 'And a good day to ya, brave $c.  I know ya be lookin'' for a fine steed.  There''s no finer steed than a raptor under your reigns, lemme tell you $g mon : sis;!  Take a look at the ones I got to offer - bred from the fiercest stock anywhere.', 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6446, 'I''m sorry $g mon : sis;, but I won''t be sellin'' my raptors to someone who hasn''t proven themselves to be a friendly to the Darkspear tribe.  When ya make a stand and show yourself to be at least friendly to us, then I''ll make my raptors available to ya.', 'I''m sorry $g mon : sis;, but I won''t be sellin'' my raptors to someone who hasn''t proven themselves to be a friendly to the Darkspear tribe.  When ya make a stand and show yourself to be at least friendly to us, then I''ll make my raptors available to ya.', 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6447, 'You fools think you can defeat me so easily? Face the true might of the Nathrezim!', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6448, 'Thieves! I shall smelt your remains!', 'Thieves! I shall smelt your remains!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6449, 'Payment for those plans comes in bones - YOUR BONES!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6450, 'Thank you, $n. My torment is now at an end.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6451, 'FREE!!!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6452, 'The curse ends!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6453, 'Praise be to Egan!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6454, 'May Kel''Thuzad one day feel our vengeance.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6455, 'Rivendare must be destroyed!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6456, '', 'Oh my! Look at this... all these candles. I''m sure they''re used for some terrible ritual or dark summoning. We best make haste!', 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6457, '', 'There! Over there!', 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6458, '', 'All I need now is a golden lasso.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6459, '', 'Let''s get out of here, $n. I''m ready now!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6460, '', 'DIE, DEMON DOGS!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6461, '', 'Ah! Fresh air at last! I never thought I''d see the day...', 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6463, '', 'What was that?! Trey? TREY!?', 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6464, 'They hand the corpses to me, I toss them in the pit.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6465, 'I wish to make a purchase.', 'I wish to make a purchase.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6466, 'BETRAYER!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6467, '', 'NO! What have they done to you!?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6468, '', 'No! My friend... what''s happened? This is all my fault...', 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6469, '', 'I can travel faster on my own from here, $n. Meet Jessir Moonbow near Ashenvale. She should be with the druids of the Emerald Circle. She''ll tell you what to do next. Thank you so much for your help!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6470, 'No tampering with the mail!', 'No tampering with the mail!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6471, 'Try again!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6472, 'Certainly!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6473, 'No chance!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6474, 'Here comes the postmaster!', 'Here comes the postmaster!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6475, 'Greetings, $n. I am Myolor Sunderfury, keeper of the Great Forge.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6476, 'I wish to become an armorsmith.', 'I wish to become an armorsmith.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6477, 'I wish to become a weaponsmith.', 'I wish to become a weaponsmith.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6478, 'Your skill in blacksmithing is exceptional, $n. The time has come to make a decision. There are two paths you may choose: The way of the weaponsmith or the art of the armorsmith.$B$BBe warned, when you have chosen to dedicate yourself to a path, there is no going back. The discipline each path requires leaves no room for hybrids.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6479, '', 'The time has come, my $g brother : sister; in arms, to take back the night from the Scourge!', 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6480, '', 'The time has come, my $g brother : sister; in arms, to take back the night from the Scourge!', 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6481, 'Alas $c, you are not considered to be a true friend of Darnassus and the night elves of Teldrassil.  Only when you prove yourself to be friendly to us through deeds - not just mere words - will I then make available my selection of mounts for your perusal.', 'Alas $c, you are not considered to be a true friend of Darnassus and the night elves of Teldrassil.  Only when you prove yourself to be friendly to us through deeds - not just mere words - will I then make available my selection of mounts for your perusal.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6482, 'By the grace of Elune, I am pleased to offer you the finest steed found anywhere in Teldrassil, and perhaps the world - the nightsaber.  For years, the Sentinel Army has relied on the value of these companions.$B$BTake your time friend and examine each one to your satisfaction.  I am sure you will not be disappointed.', 'By the grace of Elune, I am pleased to offer you the finest steed found anywhere in Teldrassil, and perhaps the world - the nightsaber.  For years, the Sentinel Army has relied on the value of these companions.$B$BTake your time friend and examine each one to your satisfaction.  I am sure you will not be disappointed.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6483, 'Erm... I really don''t know you that well, sorry.  I mean, as an authorized Mechano-strider dealer, I really only can sell my mounts to those people who are considered a friend of the gnomes.  If you ever are recognized as friendly to Gnomeregan, I''d be happy to show you what I have to offer.', 'Erm... I really don''t know you that well, sorry.  I mean, as an authorized Mechano-strider dealer, I really only can sell my mounts to those people who are considered a friend of the gnomes.  If you ever are recognized as friendly to Gnomeregan, I''d be happy to show you what I have to offer.', 0, 0, 0, 24, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6484, 'Um... I think you''re a little too big to ride a Mechano-strider there, $g mister : ma''am;.  You''d likely crush the finely tuned servo-balancers!', 'Um... I think you''re a little too big to ride a Mechano-strider there, $g mister : ma''am;.  You''d likely crush the finely tuned servo-balancers!', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6485, 'If you have come looking for the gift of fast and safe mobility, then you have arrived at your destination!  This year''s model of the new Mechano-striders have recently arrived, and I am ready to show you all they have to offer!', 'If you have come looking for the gift of fast and safe mobility, then you have arrived at your destination!  This year''s model of the new Mechano-striders have recently arrived, and I am ready to show you all they have to offer!', 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6486, 'Speak with Ironus, $n. He''ll be the one training you in the way of the weaponsmith.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6487, 'Grumnus be your man, $n. He''ll school you in the art of the armorsmith.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6488, 'When the work of a blacksmith reaches your level of expert craftsmanship, I present them with a choice.$B$BWhile you are not required to make a choice, it is recommended that you do - after all, do you want to be a neophyte forever? It is the artisan armorsmiths and weaponsmiths that supply our armies, win our wars and garner acclaim!$B$BBe warned, $n. Once a choice is made and the tasks required completed - there is no going back. One can only walk down one path.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6489, 'I am Krathok, overseer of these craftsmen.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6490, 'Borgosh! $n is ready to be trained.', '', 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6491, 'Okothos will train you, $n.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6492, 'One of the Ash''ari Crystals has been destroyed!  Slay the intruders!', 'One of the Ash''ari Crystals has been destroyed!  Slay the intruders!', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6493, 'An Ash''ari Crystal has been restored!', 'An Ash''ari Crystal has been restored!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6494, '$R flesh... must feed!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6495, 'Who dares to approach this cauldron?  Taste my dark blade!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6496, 'The Scourge beckons you, foolish $r.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6497, '$C - I will consume your light!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6498, 'Greetings, $r.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6499, 'I require training.', 'I require training.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6500, 'Hail, $c!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6501, 'I require training.', 'I require training.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6502, 'What do you want?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6503, 'I require training.', 'I require training.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6504, 'Prepare to be Malowned!', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6505, '', 'Highborne spirits! Be at peace! The Crystal of Zin-Malor is whole once again!', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6506, '', 'Cursed spirits! Let go of the past! The Crystal of Zin-Malor no longer binds you!', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO "world"."broadcast_text" ("entry", "male_text", "female_text", "chat_type", "sound_id", "language_id", "emote_id1", "emote_id2", "emote_id3", "emote_delay1", "emote_delay2", "emote_delay3") VALUES
(6507, '', 'Spirits of the Highborne! You may now rest! The curse of the crystal releases you!', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6509, 'Ya may not follow the ways of the Light like a Knight of the Silver Hand, but ya can always ask us for aid.', 'Ya may not follow the ways of the Light like a Knight of the Silver Hand, but ya can always ask us for aid.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6510, 'The Light be with ya, $c. How can I help ya?', 'The Light be with ya, $c. How can I help ya?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6511, '%s raises an undead servant back to life!', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6512, '%s attempts to casts Death Pact on his servants!', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6513, 'I wish to purchase arcane quickener from you.', 'I wish to purchase arcane quickener from you.', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6514, 'A fierce wind is coming - I can tell by the ache in my exposed knee.  I just hope we don''t get caught up in it.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6515, 'Well now $n, let''s get to work on those cauldrons!  If you''re going to collect the components we need, then get a vitreous focuser from me.  You''ll need to have it on you to identify the necessary resources found on the Scourge that will turn those cauldrons.$B$BYou''ll also need a dose of arcane quickener for the cauldrons.  It''s not cheap, nor is it stable.  Once you have it, you''ll only have thirty minutes to use it before it expires on you; be smart about buying it.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6516, 'What''s needed for the cauldron at Felstone Field?', 'What''s needed for the cauldron at Felstone Field?', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6517, 'What''s needed for the cauldron at Dalson''s Tears?', 'What''s needed for the cauldron at Dalson''s Tears?', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6518, 'What''s needed for the cauldron at the Writhing Haunt?', 'What''s needed for the cauldron at the Writhing Haunt?', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6519, 'What''s needed for the cauldron at Gahrron''s Withering?', 'What''s needed for the cauldron at Gahrron''s Withering?', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6520, 'Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, six osseous agitators, and four pieces of runecloth.  With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the agitators from skeletal undead here in the Plaguelands!$B$BOnce you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6521, 'Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, five somatic intensifiers, and and four pieces of runecloth.  With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the intensifiers from zombie or ghoul undead here in the Plaguelands!$B$BOnce you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6522, 'Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, five somatic intensifiers, and and four pieces of runecloth.  With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the intensifiers from zombie or ghoul undead here in the Plaguelands!$B$BOnce you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6523, 'Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, four ectoplasmic resonators, and four pieces of runecloth.  With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the resonators from wraith and ghostly undead here in the Plaguelands!$B$BOnce you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6524, 'This job is definitely not worth sixteen-five a year.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6525, 'Well now $n, let''s get to work on those cauldrons!  If you''re going to collect the components we need, then get a vitreous focuser from me.  You''ll need to have it on you to identify the necessary resources found on the Scourge that will turn those cauldrons.$B$BYou''ll also need a dose of arcane quickener for the cauldrons.  It''s not cheap, nor is it stable.  Once you have it, you''ll only have thirty minutes to use it before it expires on you; be smart about buying it.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6526, 'An Ash''ari Crystal has fallen! Stay true to the Lich King, my brethren, and attempt to resummon it.', 'An Ash''ari Crystal has fallen! Stay true to the Lich King, my brethren, and attempt to resummon it.', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6527, 'An Ash''ari Crystal has been toppled! Restore the ziggurat before the Necropolis is vulnerable!', 'An Ash''ari Crystal has been toppled! Restore the ziggurat before the Necropolis is vulnerable!', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6528, 'Our summoning is complete! The Ash''ari crystal has been restored!', 'Our summoning is complete! The Ash''ari crystal has been restored!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6529, 'Success is ours! The Ash''ari Crystal has been restored!', 'Success is ours! The Ash''ari Crystal has been restored!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6530, 'You''ve been MALOWNED!', '', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6531, 'I need a vitreous focuser.', 'I need a vitreous focuser.', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6532, '', 'Arise, my champion!', 1, 5840, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6533, 'At your side, milady!', '', 1, 5837, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6534, 'Blades of light!', '', 1, 5832, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6535, 'Release your rage!', '', 1, 5797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6536, 'Awake, ye servants! Defend the Disks!', '', 1, 5856, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6537, 'To my side, brothers! For the Makers!', '', 1, 5857, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6538, 'Join us!', '', 1, 5864, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6539, '', 'Shhh... do you smell something?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6540, 'Liladris has been waiting for me at Maestra''s Post, so we should make haste, $n.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6541, '%s begins to drift off...', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6542, '%s suddenly falls asleep.', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6543, 'Yaaaaawwwwwnnnn...', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6544, 'Oh, I am so tired...', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6545, 'You don''t mind if I stop here for a moment, do you?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6546, '%s emerges from the shadows to defend the cauldron!', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6547, 'The Scourge''s plague still dominates the zone, and we have a long way to go before the plague will be altered enough to affect them.  Collect the necessary resources and help out the war effort!', 'The Scourge''s plague still dominates the zone, and we have a long way to go before the plague will be altered enough to affect them.  Collect the necessary resources and help out the war effort!', 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6548, 'We are having difficulty determining the status of the plague within the area; check back shortly and we may have a better idea.', 'We are having difficulty determining the status of the plague within the area; check back shortly and we may have a better idea.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6549, 'The Scourge''s plague is almost to the turning point; a handful more cauldron subversions will push us over the top!  Be sure to do your part to help out!', 'The Scourge''s plague is almost to the turning point; a handful more cauldron subversions will push us over the top!  Be sure to do your part to help out!', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6550, 'We have begun to turn the Scourge''s plague against them, but our hold is tenuous at best!  Be sure to aid the cause by subverting their cauldrons!', 'We have begun to turn the Scourge''s plague against them, but our hold is tenuous at best!  Be sure to aid the cause by subverting their cauldrons!', 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6551, 'We are dominating the Scourge - the effects of the altered plague will affect them for at least another full day!  We need to stay on top of it though, so be sure to sabotage a cauldron when you can.', 'We are dominating the Scourge - the effects of the altered plague will affect them for at least another full day!  We need to stay on top of it though, so be sure to sabotage a cauldron when you can.', 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6552, 'How are we doing in the battle to subvert the cauldrons?', 'How are we doing in the battle to subvert the cauldrons?', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6553, '%s comes to rest as it begins to release the counter agent into the air.', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6554, 'The deeds are mine, brother! Soon you shall be out of my way for good!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6555, 'The fortune is mine, Alexi! Your end comes soon!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6556, 'The Hunter Trainer''s name is Thotar.  Seek him out inside the burrow on the southwest corner of Razor Hill.', 'The Hunter Trainer''s name is Thotar.  Seek him out inside the burrow on the southwest corner of Razor Hill.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6557, 'You''re a hunter?  Well anyway, you''ll find Thotar hiding from the sun inside the burrow at the southwest corner of town.', 'You''re a hunter?  Well anyway, you''ll find Thotar hiding from the sun inside the burrow at the southwest corner of town.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6558, 'Speak with Un''Thuwa to the south in Sen''jin Village.', 'Speak with Un''Thuwa to the south in Sen''jin Village.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6559, 'That''s troll business.  Look for Un''Thuwa in Sen''jin Village down south.', 'That''s troll business.  Look for Un''Thuwa in Sen''jin Village down south.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6560, 'You''re looking for Tai''jin.  Find her in the barracks on the east side of town.', 'You''re looking for Tai''jin.  Find her in the barracks on the east side of town.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6561, 'Tai''jin is her name and you''ll find her inside the barracks on the east side of Razor Hill.  She''ll teach you to respect the gods.  Make certain that you show her the proper respect in return!', 'Tai''jin is her name and you''ll find her inside the barracks on the east side of Razor Hill.  She''ll teach you to respect the gods.  Make certain that you show her the proper respect in return!', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6562, 'Find Kaplak on top of the burrow in the southwest section of town.', 'Find Kaplak on top of the burrow in the southwest section of town.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6563, 'Why would you want to talk to Kaplak?  Nevermind.  Look for him on top of the burrow in the southwest corner of Razor Hill.  Just make sure that you keep your hands in your own pockets!', 'Why would you want to talk to Kaplak?  Nevermind.  Look for him on top of the burrow in the southwest corner of Razor Hill.  Just make sure that you keep your hands in your own pockets!', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6564, 'You need to find Swart.  Look for him inside the barracks on the east side of Razor Hill.', 'You need to find Swart.  Look for him inside the barracks on the east side of Razor Hill.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6565, 'The Warchief brings change that will bring the Horde victory!  Look for Swart inside the barracks on the east side of town.', 'The Warchief brings change that will bring the Horde victory!  Look for Swart inside the barracks on the east side of town.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6566, 'On the east side of Razor Hill, behind the barracks is where you will find Dhugru Gorelust.', 'On the east side of Razor Hill, behind the barracks is where you will find Dhugru Gorelust.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6567, 'Dhugru Gorelust is hiding behind the barracks on the east side of town.  Don''t let me find out that you''re in league with the Burning Legion!', 'Dhugru Gorelust is hiding behind the barracks on the east side of town.  Don''t let me find out that you''re in league with the Burning Legion!', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6568, 'Look for Tarshaw Jaggedscar in the barracks on the east side of town.', 'Look for Tarshaw Jaggedscar in the barracks on the east side of town.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6569, 'Find Tarshaw Jaggedscar inside the barracks on the east side of Razor Hill.  Bring pride and honor to the Horde youngling!', 'Find Tarshaw Jaggedscar inside the barracks on the east side of Razor Hill.  Bring pride and honor to the Horde youngling!', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6570, 'Seek out Miao''zan in Sen''jin Village to the south.', 'Seek out Miao''zan in Sen''jin Village to the south.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6571, 'I hear that the trolls in Sen''jin Village have a potion maker named Miao''zan.  Look there.', 'I hear that the trolls in Sen''jin Village have a potion maker named Miao''zan.  Look there.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6572, 'That would be Dwukk.  Find him next to the heated forge at the northwest corner of town.', 'That would be Dwukk.  Find him next to the heated forge at the northwest corner of town.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6573, 'If you think you have the strength to pound good metal into weapons and armor for the Horde look for Dwukk next to the heated forge in the northwest corner of Razor Hill.', 'If you think you have the strength to pound good metal into weapons and armor for the Horde look for Dwukk next to the heated forge in the northwest corner of Razor Hill.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6574, 'Head north up the road to Orgrimmar.  You can ask one of the grunts there for directions to the Cooking Trainer.', 'Head north up the road to Orgrimmar.  You can ask one of the grunts there for directions to the Cooking Trainer.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6575, 'Mmmmm food.  It''s not too long of a run, but you need to head north to Orgrimmar and ask one of the grunts there.', 'Mmmmm food.  It''s not too long of a run, but you need to head north to Orgrimmar and ask one of the grunts there.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6576, 'There''s one in Orgrimmar.  A grunt up there will know what directions to give you.  Just head north up the road here, you can''t miss it.', 'There''s one in Orgrimmar.  A grunt up there will know what directions to give you.  Just head north up the road here, you can''t miss it.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6577, 'I don''t know of one of those around here.  Your best bet is to go to Orgrimmar to the north and speak to one of their grunts.', 'I don''t know of one of those around here.  Your best bet is to go to Orgrimmar to the north and speak to one of their grunts.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6578, 'There is an Engineering Trainer in Razor Hill.  He is called Mukdrak and can usually be found standing over near the forge.', 'There is an Engineering Trainer in Razor Hill.  He is called Mukdrak and can usually be found standing over near the forge.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6579, 'Bah, that''s goblin work!  Still, we have an orc here in Razor Hill that will teach you of such things.  Look for Mukdrak over near the forge.', 'Bah, that''s goblin work!  Still, we have an orc here in Razor Hill that will teach you of such things.  Look for Mukdrak over near the forge.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6580, 'There''s one of those inside the barracks on the east side of Razor Hill.  Look for Rawrk.', 'There''s one of those inside the barracks on the east side of Razor Hill.  Look for Rawrk.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6581, 'With all of the fighting we do of course we have a First Aid Trainer in Razor Hill.  Find Rawrk inside the barracks on the east side of town.', 'With all of the fighting we do of course we have a First Aid Trainer in Razor Hill.  Find Rawrk inside the barracks on the east side of town.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6582, 'I''ve seen a troll named Lau''Tiki fishing down south at the Darkspear Strand.  That''s just on the outskirts of Sen''jin Village.', 'I''ve seen a troll named Lau''Tiki fishing down south at the Darkspear Strand.  That''s just on the outskirts of Sen''jin Village.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6583, 'You''re looking for Lau''Tiki.  You''ll find him on Darkspear Strand out beyond Sen''jin Village to the south.', 'You''re looking for Lau''Tiki.  You''ll find him on Darkspear Strand out beyond Sen''jin Village to the south.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6584, 'You''re looking for Mishiki.  She has a hut to the south in Sen''jin Village.', 'You''re looking for Mishiki.  She has a hut to the south in Sen''jin Village.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6585, 'Flowers?  In this wasteland?  If anyone can teach you how to find them it will be Mishiki down in Sen''jin Village to the south.', 'Flowers?  In this wasteland?  If anyone can teach you how to find them it will be Mishiki down in Sen''jin Village to the south.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6586, '', 'Spirits of Water, I give you praise, and I beg of you a favor. You have heard $n''s pleas, and I trust $ghis:her; intent is noble. Please, will you aid us?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6587, 'You''ll need to head to Orgrimmar for that.  Just follow the road heading out of Razor Hill to the north through the canyon and you''ll come to it.  When you get there ask one of their grunts for further directions.', 'You''ll need to head to Orgrimmar for that.  Just follow the road heading out of Razor Hill to the north through the canyon and you''ll come to it.  When you get there ask one of their grunts for further directions.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6588, 'To learn to cure leather and work with hides go to Orgrimmar to the north.  One of the Orgrimmar Grunts will be able to tell you the way to the Leatherworking Trainer.', 'To learn to cure leather and work with hides go to Orgrimmar to the north.  One of the Orgrimmar Grunts will be able to tell you the way to the Leatherworking Trainer.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6589, 'Sure, sure.  We have a Mining Trainer right here in town.  Look for Krunn over in the northwest corner alongside the inn.', 'Sure, sure.  We have a Mining Trainer right here in town.  Look for Krunn over in the northwest corner alongside the inn.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6590, 'Plenty of good mining to be had in Durotar, or so I hear.  So good in fact that we have a Mining Trainer right here in Razor Hill.  You''ll find Krunn next to the heated forge in the northwest corner of town.', 'Plenty of good mining to be had in Durotar, or so I hear.  So good in fact that we have a Mining Trainer right here in Razor Hill.  You''ll find Krunn next to the heated forge in the northwest corner of town.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6591, 'There''s a Skinning Trainer in Orgrimmar.  To get there head north up the road out of Razor Hill.  Ask an Orgrimmar Grunt for directions when you arrive.', 'There''s a Skinning Trainer in Orgrimmar.  To get there head north up the road out of Razor Hill.  Ask an Orgrimmar Grunt for directions when you arrive.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6592, 'There''s one in Orgrimmar.  Go north and talk to one of their grunts.', 'There''s one in Orgrimmar.  Go north and talk to one of their grunts.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6593, 'Then Orgrimmar is where you need to go.  The north road out of Razor Hill leads directly there.  Just talk to one of the grunts there and they can give you further directions.', 'Then Orgrimmar is where you need to go.  The north road out of Razor Hill leads directly there.  Just talk to one of the grunts there and they can give you further directions.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6594, 'You can learn to sew up in Orgrimmar.  That''s to the north.  Maybe one of the Orgrimmar Grunts can help you.', 'You can learn to sew up in Orgrimmar.  That''s to the north.  Maybe one of the Orgrimmar Grunts can help you.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6595, 'Huh?  You''ll find the bank in Orgrimmar.  Head north up the road to get there and then talk to one of their grunts.', 'Huh?  You''ll find the bank in Orgrimmar.  Head north up the road to get there and then talk to one of their grunts.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6596, 'Yeah, I need to drop off some things myself.  Find it by heading north up the road to Orgrimmar and then ask one of the grunts there.', 'Yeah, I need to drop off some things myself.  Find it by heading north up the road to Orgrimmar and then ask one of the grunts there.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6597, 'You''ll find the Wind Rider Master in Orgrimmar.  Go north up the road to get there and ask an Orgrimmar Grunt for further directions.', 'You''ll find the Wind Rider Master in Orgrimmar.  Go north up the road to get there and ask an Orgrimmar Grunt for further directions.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6598, 'Can''t you see I''m busy here?  Go north up the road to Orgrimmar and ask one of the grunts there.  You can''t miss it.', 'Can''t you see I''m busy here?  Go north up the road to Orgrimmar and ask one of the grunts there.  You can''t miss it.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6599, '', 'Thank you, great spirit. Thank you!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6600, 'I could use a drink and some rest myself.  You''ll find it right in the northwest corner of Razor Hill.  Say hi to Innkeeper Grosk for me.', 'I could use a drink and some rest myself.  You''ll find it right in the northwest corner of Razor Hill.  Say hi to Innkeeper Grosk for me.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6601, 'It''s the big building in Razor Hill that''s not the barracks.  Just talk to Innkeeper Grosk inside.  Got that?', 'It''s the big building in Razor Hill that''s not the barracks.  Just talk to Innkeeper Grosk inside.  Got that?', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(6602, 'Which trainer do you seek?', 'Which trainer do you seek?', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
