(8458, 'Overflowin'' with rats! Help a pirate out, matey!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8459, 'Do yer part in keepin'' the Deeprun Tram clean!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8460, 'Don''t crowd me, people!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8461, 'Your own strength feeds me, $n!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8462, 'The little feller be hidin'' in one o'' them boxes, matey. G''luck!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8463, 'Monty be me name an'' rats be me game.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8464, 'I''m ready to find the squirrel, Monty.', 'I''m ready to find the squirrel, Monty.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8465, 'Into the box me pretties! Thas it. One by one ye go.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8466, 'Winner! We be havin'' a winner here!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8467, 'The strongest hides come from those kodo that have laid themselves to rest in this wasteland.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8468, 'Your skills have surpassed mine, young one. Go see Una who has a shop in Thunder Bluff''s central plateau. She can give you the guidance you seek.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8470, 'I am sorry but I can not train any more apprentices. Seek out Mak in Thunder Bluff. He will be able to teach you the basics.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8471, 'First you must prove yourself to me, then I will train you.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8472, 'Now you are ready to learn the finer points of kodo hide tanning. Let us begin...', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8473, '', 'Between the light and the dark, there is shadow... and those shadows have powers you have yet to see.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
