(8475, 'You''ll find no finer rat kabob this side of Khaz Modan!', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8476, 'I wish to make a purchase, Nipsy.', 'I wish to make a purchase, Nipsy.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8477, 'You look like you could use some work, $g fella:lady;. You should board the tram and visit my brother, Monty, at the Ironforge Deeprun Tram depot. I''m sure he has something you could do.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8478, 'Watch your back, stranger.', '', 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8479, 'Ravenholdt Manor does not recognize you, $c.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8480, 'Brash. Master Ravenholdt does not like brash.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8481, 'It is good to see you again, $n.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8482, 'Greetings, $c. Have you spoken with Fahrad yet?', '', 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8483, 'The Syndicate is made up of a bunch of hacks - disorganized, unskilled, and lazy... ', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8484, 'You have truly grown more cunning, $n.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8485, 'An honor to see you again, $n.', '', 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8486, 'I believe Simone was looking for you earlier, $n. Have you spoken with her yet?', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 1, 2, 0),
(8487, '$G Master:Mistress; $n! Master Kang has been asking about you! Perhaps it is your time!', '', 0, 0, 0, 5, 25, 0, 1, 2, 0),
(8488, 'Your presence steels our nerves, $G Master:Mistress; $n.', '', 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8489, 'Tales of your heroics are heard throughout Ravenholdt Manor, $G Master:Mistress; $n.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8490, 'I am unworthy of this conversation, $G Master:Mistress;.', '', 0, 0, 0, 16, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8491, 'It is my dream to one day serve under your command, $G Master:Mistress; $n. That is, should you ever deem me worthy of such things...', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 16, 0, 1, 2, 0),
(8492, 'The Manor has been abuzz with talk of your arrival, $G Master:Mistress; $n. We are all honored and graced by your presence.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 16, 0, 1, 2, 0),
(8493, 'You dare set foot inside Ravenholdt Manor, worm?', 'You dare set foot inside Ravenholdt Manor, worm?', 0, 0, 0, 14, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0),
(8494, 'Making it out of here without a blade in your back or poison in your veins would be an accomplishment.', 'Making it out of here without a blade in your back or poison in your veins would be an accomplishment.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8495, 'You''re shaping up nicely, $n. I''ve heard good things...', 'You''re shaping up nicely, $n. I''ve heard good things...', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8496, 'You should talk to Winstone. I hear he''s looking for thieves with your skill.', 'You should talk to Winstone. I hear he''s looking for thieves with your skill.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8497, 'Marvelous. Simply marvelous. You are an inspiration to us all, $n.', 'Marvelous. Simply marvelous. You are an inspiration to us all, $n.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8498, 'I really envy you, $n. You do amazing work.', 'I really envy you, $n. You do amazing work.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8499, 'Your time has come, $n. Master Kang awaits...', 'Your time has come, $n. Master Kang awaits...', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8500, 'And to think, one day you might be the one that the stories of legend are about!', 'And to think, one day you might be the one that the stories of legend are about!', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8501, 'I wept like a babe when I heard of your heroics. Master Ravenholdt would do well to have an apprentice like you.', 'I wept like a babe when I heard of your heroics. Master Ravenholdt would do well to have an apprentice like you.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8502, 'If I was not bound by duty to Master Ravenholdt, I would follow you to the ends of the world, $G Master:Mistress; $n. You are grace and cunning personified.', 'If I was not bound by duty to Master Ravenholdt, I would follow you to the ends of the world, $G Master:Mistress; $n. You are grace and cunning personified.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 16, 0, 1, 2, 0),
(8503, '', 'May Elune walk with you, $c.  The Temple of the Moon has come to help the troubled citizens of Auberdine.', 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8504, 'I''m a test spirit healer.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8505, 'Why did you kill me, $n?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8506, 'Shoja''my is over in front of the inn.  Now move along, I''m busy.', 'Shoja''my is over in front of the inn.  Now move along, I''m busy.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8507, 'Pets to take care of?  Just make sure you clean up after it!  Look for Shoja''my in front of the inn.', 'Pets to take care of?  Just make sure you clean up after it!  Look for Shoja''my in front of the inn.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8508, 'The stable master', 'The stable master', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8509, 'Go to the Valley of Honor and seek out Xon''cha near the stables.', 'Go to the Valley of Honor and seek out Xon''cha near the stables.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8510, 'Xon''cha will stable your extra pets.  Find him in the Valley of Honor at the stables between the arena and the Hunter''s Hall.  Now begone!', 'Xon''cha will stable your extra pets.  Find him in the Valley of Honor at the stables between the arena and the Hunter''s Hall.  Now begone!', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8511, 'The stable master', 'The stable master', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8512, 'Only a fool walks into a den of thieves unaware. That fool rarely walks out...', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8513, 'Ah yes, it is Seikwa that you must find.  I believe I saw her last standing out in front of the inn.', 'Ah yes, it is Seikwa that you must find.  I believe I saw her last standing out in front of the inn.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8514, 'Seikwa can take care of your animal friends when you have the need.  Seek her out in front of the inn.', 'Seikwa can take care of your animal friends when you have the need.  Seek her out in front of the inn.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8515, 'The stable master', 'The stable master', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8516, 'It is the assistance of Bulrug that you need.  You will find him outside on the lower rise standing between the inn and the Thunder Bluff Bank.', 'It is the assistance of Bulrug that you need.  You will find him outside on the lower rise standing between the inn and the Thunder Bluff Bank.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8517, 'The concern that you show for the welfare of your animal companions is commendable.  Bulrug, on the lower rise, can help you with that.  Seek him out between the bank and the inn.', 'The concern that you show for the welfare of your animal companions is commendable.  Bulrug, on the lower rise, can help you with that.  Seek him out between the bank and the inn.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8518, 'The stable master', 'The stable master', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8519, 'Morganus the stable master can be found out in front of the stables strangely enough.', 'Morganus the stable master can be found out in front of the stables strangely enough.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8520, 'Not too clever are you?  Hmm, if I were a stable master perhaps I might be in the vicinity of say, the stable?  Look for Morganus over there.', 'Not too clever are you?  Hmm, if I were a stable master perhaps I might be in the vicinity of say, the stable?  Look for Morganus over there.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8521, 'The stable master', 'The stable master', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8522, 'Anya Maulray at inn on upper ring of Trade Quarter.', 'Anya Maulray at inn on upper ring of Trade Quarter.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8523, 'Us want lots of pets.  Anya Maulray help you take care of them.  You find her at inn, upper ring of Trade Quarter.', 'Us want lots of pets.  Anya Maulray help you take care of them.  You find her at inn, upper ring of Trade Quarter.', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8524, 'The stable master', 'The stable master', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8525, 'Stable Master', 'Stable Master', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8526, 'You can trust any pets you have to be well taken care of by Alassin.  He resides in the Cenarion Enclave where the hunters gather.', 'You can trust any pets you have to be well taken care of by Alassin.  He resides in the Cenarion Enclave where the hunters gather.', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8527, 'For many hundreds of years Alassin has cared for the animals that our hunters befriend.  His care of animals is highly sought for by the hunters around here.  If you seek him as well, then look for him in the Cenarion Enclave.', 'For many hundreds of years Alassin has cared for the animals that our hunters befriend.  His care of animals is highly sought for by the hunters around here.  If you seek him as well, then look for him in the Cenarion Enclave.', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8528, 'We are all pieces of a much larger puzzle, $n. Just as you guide the piece of a puzzle to its destination, so too are we guided by another.$B$BAnd perhaps they who guide us are themselves guided by an even greater force.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8529, 'Stable Master', 'Stable Master', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8530, 'Ah, gentle Seriadne.  All animals are safe while in her care.  You can find her just outside the Inn in Dolanaar.', 'Ah, gentle Seriadne.  All animals are safe while in her care.  You can find her just outside the Inn in Dolanaar.', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8531, 'You seek someone who cares for animals?  Then you should look for Seriadne outside the Inn in Dolanaar.  She is the one that you seek.', 'You seek someone who cares for animals?  Then you should look for Seriadne outside the Inn in Dolanaar.  She is the one that you seek.', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8532, 'Good ol'' Erma, she''s been taking care of the local animals for years now.  I''m sure she''d be happy to take care of any you''d like to put up.  She can be found right outside of the Lion''s Pride Inn.', 'Good ol'' Erma, she''s been taking care of the local animals for years now.  I''m sure she''d be happy to take care of any you''d like to put up.  She can be found right outside of the Lion''s Pride Inn.', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8533, 'Erma does all the caring for animals around here.  She''s right outside the Lion''s Pride Inn if you need to speak with her.', 'Erma does all the caring for animals around here.  She''s right outside the Lion''s Pride Inn if you need to speak with her.', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8534, 'Stable Master', 'Stable Master', 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8535, 'Why did you kill me, $n?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
