(8548, 'May I have it, please.', 'May I have it, please.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8549, 'Welcome to SI:7 headquarters, $n.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8550, '$n, this came for you this morning.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8551, 'Messengers from Ravenholdt delivered this letter to me this morning. It is addressed to you, $n.', 'Messengers from Ravenholdt delivered this letter to me this morning. It is addressed to you, $n.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8552, 'Take heart!  Pain goes away and $gladies love men with scars:men love women with scars;!', 'Take heart!  Pain goes away and $gladies love men with scars:men love women with scars;!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8553, 'I require aid.', 'I require aid.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8554, 'Show strength to your enemy, and we will prevail!', 'Show strength to your enemy, and we will prevail!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8555, 'This will be a tough fight, $n. Follow me closely!', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8556, 'This is the brazier, $n. Put it out. Vorsha is a beast, worthy of praise from no one!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8557, 'Bah, it''s not here.  I wonder where I left it last...', '', 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8558, 'You have my deepest gratitude, $N. I thank you.', '', 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8559, 'Now where did I put that companion document?', '', 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8560, 'Quite the riveting tale.  Now I know why there was so much dust on that book.', '', 0, 0, 0, 274, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8561, 'So many bookshelves, so little time...', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8562, 'I should talk to Dewey about some sort of notation system to these keep books better organized.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(8563, 'A book by a goblin on gnomish military victories... and all the pages are blank.  Figures.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0),
