(11609, 'Elder Primestone has spent many years in the Crystal Vale in Silithus.', 'Elder Primestone has spent many years in the Crystal Vale in Silithus.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(11610, 'To honor your elders is to honor your culture and your people, $c.  For this, the Coins of Ancestry serve as a tangible means to recognize those who choose to follow a venerable path of respect.$B$BDuring this Lunar Festival, you may have the opportunity to honor many elders.  As you do so, you will acquire the Coins of Ancestry.  Bring me these coins, and I will reward your diligence with a selection of unique items.
