(11804, 'It looks like you''ve already found love. You can give me a love token, but I''m not giving you anything nice. I''m waiting for someone special.', 'It looks like you''ve already found love. You can give me a love token, but I''m not giving you anything nice. I''m waiting for someone special.', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0),
